\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit tractatus de practica scientia et eius intencione capitulum 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dicto de sermocionalibus sciencijs et in ordinem supra positum dicendum est de practicis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 qui ne dampnandi legeres mala gaudia mundi, promissum ad regnum se tibi fecit iter etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1471\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  Nachtrag von Hand Schwerzenbeks: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit tractatus de practica scientia et eius intencione \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  185rb-185d-v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ed.: Irene Villarroel \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Fern\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u225 \'e1\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ndez,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  De enciclopedia a florilegio: la transmisi\u243 \'f3n de los libros VI del Speculum doctrinale de Vicente de Beauvais, Dissertation Universidad Complutense de Madrid, 2016, S. 221-581. \endash  Irene Villarroel \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Fern\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u225 \'e1\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ndez\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \ldblquote The Flores Philosophorum et Poetarum: in the Pathway of Vincent of Beauvais\rquote  Speculum Doctrinale\rdblquote , Vincent of Beauvais Newsletter 41 (2017): 4\endash 14.}

