\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit dieta salutis uel via salutis edita a fratre Willhelmo de\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (hinzugef\u252 \'fcgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Lanicea Aquitanico de\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ordine minorum. Prologus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hec est via\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Is. 30,21) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Magnam misericordiam facit qui erranti viam ostendit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 egent gloria et misericordia dei que est infinita. Ad quam gloriam perducat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: GW 4720-4735; S. Bonaventurae Opera VI. Rom 1596, 285-342. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , R\u233 \'e9pertoire, Nr. 305dd\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ; Distelbrink\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Bonaventura, Nr. 124; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Incipits, 2301.}

