\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (285ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In aduentu domini dominica prima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Abiciamus opera tenebrarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Rom. 13,12). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In aduentum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 magni regis et principis expiantur sordes \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (285rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominica secunda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Deus autem spei repleat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  (Rom. 15,13) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quoniam a uiris spiritualibus sunt debiles sustinendi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (285va) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominica tercia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Modestia vestra nota sit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Phil. 4,5) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Regis consueuerunt domicelli et milites \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (294vb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De virginibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Queramus Domino nostro regi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (3.Reg. 1,2) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sicut de prato colliguntur flores\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (295ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De virginibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 O, quam pulchra est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Sap. 4,1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Consueuit homo mirari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... (295ra) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 tercio debemus esse lucidi caritate, quere in materia de caritate et inuidia per contrarium  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\l