\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb240\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (1ra) \u220 \'dcberschrift von Hand Schwerzenbecks\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : Prologus in opus sequens reverendi magistri Engelschalci pragensis vniuersitatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Qvia deus gloriosus summus et supremus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash (7rb-7va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In illo tempore cum appropinquasset Ihesus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Mt. 21, 1-9) \endash  (7va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Illud ewangelium scribitur Mathei 21\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  capitulo. Et legitur bis in anno, scilicet in aduentu ante natiuitatem Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et in dominica palmarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (14ra) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In illo tempore venit Johannes \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [B]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 aptista predicans\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Mt. 3,1-6)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Illud ewangelium scribitur Mathei 3\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  capitulo et legitur feria quarta post primam dominicam aduentus. Et in isto ewangelio ewangelista ostendit ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (19vb-20rb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In illo tempore dicebat Johannes ad turbas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Lc. 3,7-18) \endash  (20rb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Istud ewangelium scribitur Luce 3o capitulo. Et legitur proxima feria 6\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ta\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  post primam dominicam in aduentu domini. Et diuiditur in duo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (426vb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In illo tempore appropinquasset\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ihesus Ierosolomis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Mt. 21,1) \endash  (427ra) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hoc ewangelium scribitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Mathei xxxj\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et legitur bis in anno scilicet de aduentu Christi in carnem, ut supra declaratum est in prima dominica aduentus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (448vb-449rb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In illo tempore ante diem festum pasce\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Jo. 13,1-5) \endash  (449rb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hoc ewangelium scribitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Johannis xiii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et legitur feria quinta post dominicam palmarum que dies cene appellata est \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... (458va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 de carcere liberati et in imperium sublimati beneficia valebunt obtinere etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  Folgt ohne Unterbrechung: (458va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Qvia sancta mater ecclesia instituit quod quilibet fidelis postquam ad annos discrecionis pervenit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... (468ra) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Et hec de sacra communione dicta sufficiant etc. Deo gratias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1471\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (469ra-486va) Alphabetisches Sachregister \endash  468rb-468v, 486vb-492v leer. 
