\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (2ra) Widmungsbrief: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Epistola Ruperti abbatis Tuiciensis ad Chunonem Sigibergensem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cvicumque fideli anime, dum verbo incarnato quodlibet impendit officium pietatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (3vb-11vb) Kapitelverzeichnis. \endash  (12ra) Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit prologus Ruperti abbatis in Genesim\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Facies Moysi cum ubique ex collocucione dei splendida sit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (13rb) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit explanacio Ruperti abbatis in Genesim. II\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Scripturarum omnium vere et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (sic pro: vertex) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sublimis liber Geneseos \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... (238va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et ibi mausoleum eius hodieque cernitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Et sic est finis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1467\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  238vb-246v leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ed.: CCCM 21, 119\endash 578 (Hs. genannt S. xxix). \endash  Stegm\u252 \'fcller, RB; Nr. 7549,1 (Hs. genannt).}

