\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (1ra) Epistulae extra collectionem traditae: Epistula 14: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit liber sancti Ambrosij episcopi ad ecclesiam Vercellensem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ambrosius seruus Christi vocatus episcopus Vercellensi ecclesie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash    \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Confligor dolore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (12ra) Epistulae extra collectionem traditae: Epistula 13: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ambrosius episcopis per Emiliam constitutis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominis fratribus dilectissimis episcopis per Emiliam constitutis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Non mediocris esse sapientie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash    \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (15rb) Epistula 1: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Epistola. Ambrosius Iusto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ambrosius Iusto salutem. Pulchre admonens \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (!), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 frater, ut epistolares fabulas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 75\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (136ra) Epistulae extra collectionem traditae: Epistula 15: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Domino dilectissimo fratri Siricio pape ... Recognouimus litteris sanctitatis tue\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 76\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (137vb) Explanatio super Psalmos XII: In Psalmo 61: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Omnium nostrum indubia consuetudo est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... (144vb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et acerbitate meritorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Expliciunt epistole gloriosi doctoris beati Ambrosij olim ecclesie mediolanensis episcopi. Finito // \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Textabbruch\u8249 \'8b
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ed.: Epistulae: CSEL 82/1-3 \endash  CPL 160; Explanatio super Psalmos XII: CSEL 64 \endash  CPL 140.}

