\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 1ra-109ra {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Robertus Caraccioli de Licio}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Sermones de adventu et de festiuitatibus}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (1ra-9rb) Alphabetisches Register: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit registrum super Septuagesimale Roberti de Licio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (9rb) Datierung: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1479\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (10va) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Roberti de Licio ex ordine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 minorum \u8230 \'85 predicaciones a prima dominica de aduentu quottidie inclusiue vsque ad quartam et de festiuitatibus a nativitate domini vsque ad epiphaniam cum nonnulis suis predicacionibus feliciter incipiunt.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Prima dominica de aduentu de lapsu hominis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (10va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nox precessit dies\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 (Rom. 13,12) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nichil vnicuique tam conueniens esse potest ad se ipsum incitandum ad dilectationem summi dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (15va) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Feria secunda sermo de ardento desiderio sanctorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\ul\lang1033\fs24\cf1 patrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nox precessit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\u8249 \'8b (Rom. 13,12) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cogimur ad cor nostrum inflamandum in amorem \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (19ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Feria 3\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  prime dominice aduentus de reuelationibus factis mentibus prophetarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nox precessit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \u8249 \'8b (Rom. 13,12) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Placuit quondam altissimo deo celi incarnacionis misteria prophetarum mentibus reuelare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 29\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (99ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In vigilia natiuitatis domini nostri Ihesu Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de sancto Joseph\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Joseph fili Dauid noli timere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\u8249 \'8b (Mt 1,20) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dilectissimi in Christo Ihesu, noster doctor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Bonauentura\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 30\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (101va) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de beatitudine magistri Roberti de Licio ex ordine minorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Exultabunt sancti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\u8249 \'8b (Ps. 149,5) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Non potest aliquis percipere que die sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (109ra) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sed consideremus, fratres karissimi, que et quanta sunt que promittuntur in celis ad quos nos perducat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1477\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  9v-10r, 109rb-109v leer.  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: GW 6045\endash 6050, auch in 6039\endash 6044. \endash  Schneyer, Wegweiser, S. 387; Schneyer/H\u246 \'f6dl (Robertus Caraccioli de Licio).}

