\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 110ra-447ra {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Robertus Caraccioli de Licio}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Sermones quadragesimales de paenitentia}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (110ra-111ra) Inhaltsverzeichnis: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hec est tabula omnium sermonum contentorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (gestrichen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 hoc in volumine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , von Schwerzenbeck hinzugef\u252 \'fcgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sequentis Quadragesimali eggregii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (111ra) Datiert: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1475\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (112ra) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sacre theologie magistri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  fratris Roberti de Licio ordinis minorum professoris opus quadragesimale perutilissimum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85\u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (112ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominica in Septuagesima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De facilitate bonorum operum \u8230 \'85 Sermo primus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Mvlti sunt vocati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 (Mt 20,16)\u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Propter nimiam caritatem suam qua diligit deus rationalem creaturam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (119vb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Feria secunda post dominicam in Septuagesima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De qualitate condicionibus seu regula bonorum operum \u8230 \'85 Sermo 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 us\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Mvlti sunt vocati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 (Mt 20,16)\u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Existimaui necessarium esse hjis qui volunt benefacere scire\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (125rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Feria tercia post dominicam in Septuagesimam de hijs que mouere habent penitente\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 s \u8230 \'85\u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Mvlti sunt vocati \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 (Mt 20,16)\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Data est ab omnipotenti deo suo digito conscripta lex mandatorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 72\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (436rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Feria secunda post dominicam ressureccionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De temporalitate, qualitate et veritate resurreccionis Christ\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 i\u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo 72\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Resurrexit dominus vere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 (Lc 24:34)\u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Jocundissima resurreccionis domini nostri Ihesu Chrsiti sacramenta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 73\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (440vb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Feria tercia post dominicam ressureccionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De ressureccione domini generali ante iudicium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo 73\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Uidete manus meas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 (Lc 24,39)\u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cum audimus a mortuis suscitatum dominum Ihesum Christum, spem nostram subleuare debemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash   \u8230 \'85 (447ra) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 anumerari valeamus angelicis choris ordinibusque sanctorum collaudantes et benedicentes deum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash    \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Finis huius in \u8491 \'c5rding sub anno domini 1475\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  111rb-111v, 447rb-447ar-v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: GW 6061\endash 6079. \u8722 - Schneyer, Wegweiser, S. 373; Schneyer/H\u246 \'f6dl (Robertus Caraccioli de Licio).}

