\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit pars estiualis Sermones de tempore domini Chunradi abbatis Haylsprunensis. In die pasce sermo primus de huius diccionis alleluia significacione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...\u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (1ra) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Alleluia dicit Bernardus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (sic!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Qui ad uere predicacionis uerba se preparat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (3va) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 us\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  vnde supra de duplici resurreccione et morte et prerogatiuis siue dotibus corporis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Si conresurrexistis cum Christo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Col 3:1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In hijs uerbis duo facit apostolus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (6ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo tercius vnde supra quid in veteri testamento quatuor locis pasca legitur celebratum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Facias phase domino tuo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Dt 16:1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In verbis propositis duo notare possumus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 123\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (384rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominica xxiiij\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Sermo primus\u8249 \'8b De quatuor generibus nunciorum et de quadruplici cognicione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \u8249 \'8b  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ecce dies venient etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (Jr 23:5)  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dicit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Bernardus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sicut Deus finito tempore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1  124\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (387vb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 us\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  dominica xxiiij\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ta\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . Quod ad suscipiendum dominum debemus cordis hospicium purgare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...\u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ecce dies venient\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (Jr 23:5) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dicit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Gregorius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Pensate, fratres karissimi, quanta sit solempnitas in cordis hospicio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash   ... (391vb\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) et extasi suspensum teneat ammirantem. Quod nobis prestare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Est puer hic unus hinc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Johannes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Require hunc sermonem in media quadragesimali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit secunda pars estiualis Sermones de tempore domini Conradi abbatis Haylsprunensis scriptum per manus fratris Georii Vettinger \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [...] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Anno domni m\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  cccc\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  lv\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  in die sancti Agappiti martyris \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [18 Aug. 1455]\u8249 \'8b \endash  392r-393v leer.
