\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (1ra-2ra) Tabula. \endash  (2rb) Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit prologus in lumine anime\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Svmmi michi pontificis fauente gracia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (3va) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit Lumen anime magistri Johannis apostolici modernioris ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (3vb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Philosophus in vj\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  libro animalium: In cunctis quidem mortuis pectus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (106vb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 castigo corpus meum et in seruitutem r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [edigo] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1471\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  107r-109v leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Redactio C. Ed. (ohne Tabula): The Light of the soul: The Lumen anime C and Ulrich Putsch's Das liecht der sel, Hrsg. Nigel \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Harris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Oxford u. a. 2007 (am Ende von der Edition abweichend). \endash  Lit.:  Mary A. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Rouse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Richard Hunter \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Rouse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , The texts called Lumen Anime. In: Archivum Fratrum Praedicatorum 41 (1971), S. 5-113 (Hs. genannt S. 43).}

