\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Duodecim remedia contra temptaciones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ad honorem dei dicam aliqua remedia contra aliquas temptaciones spirituales que in hoc tempore habundant in terra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et sic superabis deo cooperante qui est benedictus in secula Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Expliciunt duodecim remedia contra temptationes spirituales tradita a quodam experto. Anno domini m\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 cccc lxxj\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [1471] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Scriptum per fratrem Sigismundum professum in Tegernsee\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b
