\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (1r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Prologus prosaicus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  Anfang fehlt. [\u8230 \'85] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 prefati magistri Jacobi viri doctissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (3v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit prologus prosaicus. Incipit prologus metricus sequentis operis intencionem et causam exprimens et quod Roseum memoriale hoc opus vocetur per capita versuum insinuans\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \u8249 \'8b \endash  Prologus metricus: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Rore tuo Christe riga mentem michi lustra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (9r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Canon primus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Canon primus declarat qualiter cuiuslibet libri biblie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sicut ex iniuncto accepi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 (142v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 angelus ostendit se nec adoret ait\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  Conclusio: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Finito libro sit laus et gloria Cristo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85  \endash  \u8230 \'85 (144r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit Roseum memoriale diuinorum eloquiorum compilatum per fratrem Petrum de Rosenhaym monachum monasterii Medlicensis ordinis sancti Benedicti.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Drucke: GW M32721-22, M32724, M32726 \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , RB 6836; Walther, \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Initia \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 1648. \endash  Lit.: Franz \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Thoma\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Petrus von Rosenheim O.S.B. 1380 c. - 1433. Das bayerische Inn-Oberland 32 (1962) 97-164, 148-151.}

