\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (115ra) Aufz\u228 \'e4hlung der Dubia: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Queritur responsio super dubijs sequentibus vnde crebro sollicitudines conscienciarum ecclesiasticis et religiosis viris oriuntur. Dubium primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  Si liceat ecclesiasticis maxime religiosis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (115rb)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Expliciunt dubia super quibus sequitur tractatus de sollicitudine ecclesiasticorum venerande memorie magistri Johannis Gerson olim cancellarij parisiensis continens particulas lxviij\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 to\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (115va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nolite solliciti esse \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (Lc. 12,22) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Jubet hoc supremus abbas noster Ihesus Christus ... \endash   ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (124rb)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  custodiat corda vestra et intelligencias vestras in Christo Ihesu domino nostro Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit tractatus Johannis Gerson de sollicitudine ecclesiasticorum. Deo laus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ed.: Gerson, \u338 \'8cuvres compl\u232 \'e8tes, Bd. IX, S. 434-458, Nr. 455.}

