\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Doctrina eiusdem pro deuotis simplicibus qualiter se in suis exercicijs discrete et caute habeant, originaliter edita in vvlgari gallico in latinum per alium translata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  Deus vvlt ut sit rationabile obsequium nostrum ... \endash  ... declinare extra eius confidenciam et diuinam caritatem. Sibi laus ... Amen. \endash  Laus deo. 1470 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit doctrina magistri Johannis Gerson pro deuotis simplicibus qualiter se in suis exercicijs discrete et caute habeant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b
