\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Epistola magistri Johannis Gerson missa ad Carthusiam cuidam monacho quem in seculo nouerat eo quod medicus domini saluciarum fuerit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  Gracia vobis et pax in Christo Ihesu. Vtique dicetis michi per similitudinem ... \endash  ... cum gloria ordinaria que videatur. Deo gracias. \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit epistola magistri Johannis Gerson missa ad domum Carthusie maioris ... 1470\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ed.: Gerson, \u338 \'8cuvres compl\u232 \'e8tes, Bd. II, S. 232-245, Nr. 49.}

