\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Responsionis gratia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ad questionem cuiusdam monachi Carthusie maioris querentis vtrum pro studio leccionis et exercicij spiritualis liceat conuentum et prolixitatem diuini officij dimittere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  ... tractatus editus per venerabilem magistrum Johannis Gerson. Prologus epistolaris in eundem tractatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  Gracia et pax. Si inimicos iubemur diligere, quanto magis eos qui nos diligunt in veritate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  ... faciles et ad pietatem ydonei. Scriptum Lugduni anno domini 1428 per Joannem cancellarium parisiensem \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit epistola\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b
