\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 VS Tegernseer Besitzeintrag
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 1r Nota zu Hrabanus Maurus: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Anno domini d ccc xv Ludowicus cognomento Pius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  Inhaltsverzeichnis. \endash  1v leer
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 2r-49vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Hrabanus Maurus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 In honorem sanctae crucis}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (2r) Vorrede (Odilo V Cluniacensis, Sermo XV de Sancta Cruce, Auszug): \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sanctus Odilo olim abbas Cluniacensis in quodam sermone quem composuit in honore sancte Crucis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85;  Kapitelverzeichnis: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipiunt capitula libri sequenti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b; (3r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Intercessio Albini pro Mauro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sancte dei presul meritis in secula viuens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85; (4r) Commendatio papae\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : Sedis apostolice princeps lux aurea Rome\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85; (4v) Imago Caesaris: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Rex regum Dominus, mundum dicione gubernans \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85; (5r) Imago Caesaris. Declaratio figurae: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 O Christe saluator rex regum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85; (5v) Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hortatur nos lex diuina ad deferendum domino dona\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85, (6r) Liber I. Praefatio: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Musa cito studio gaudens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85, (6v-34r) Figurae 1-28 cum declarationibus \u8230 \'85 (34r)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  et perfectio rerum est.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit deo iuuante opus magnecij Rabani Mauri in honore sancte crucis conditum. Scriptum anno domini m\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  cccc lix in Tegernsee monasterio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b. \endash  (34va-40vb) Lesefassung der Figurengedichte. \endash  (41ra) Liber II. Praefatio: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Mos apud veteres fuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85, (41ra-49va) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit liber secundus. De prima figura in qua Christi ymago manus in modum expandit crucis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b  (41rb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ecce filius dei et dominus dominantium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 (49va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ibique tibi laus perpetua per cuncta sonabit secula Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Graciarum actio, honor, virtus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit cum grandi labore opus magnecij Rabani Mauri in Honore sancte crucis conditum. Ceptum et finitum per quendam fratrem dictum Anthonium monasterij sancti Quirini in Tegernsee professum anno domni 1459\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  2v, 3v Dedikationsbilder. \endash  49vb leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ed.: CCCM 100, 100A. \endash   Lit: Heinz \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Klingenberg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Hrabanus Maurus: In honorem sanctae crucis, in: Festschrift f\u252 \'fcr Otto H\u246 \'f6fler zum 65. Geburtstag, hg. von H. Birkhan, Wien 1968, 273-300; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 weitere Literatur s. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  https://www.geschichtsquellen.de/werk/2937 }

