\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Si classem virgo Claudia ad litus trahere valet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 siue masculini femine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ambrosius in Exameron de creacione animali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: GW 10271-10275 \endash  Lit.: 2VL 2, Sp. 834\endash 837 (Klaus \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Grubb\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ). \endash  Friedrich \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Zoepfl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Defensorium. In: Reallexikon zur Deutschen Kunstgeschichte, 3 (1954), Sp. 1206\endash 1218
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
