\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 3ra-85va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Bonaventura}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Legenda maior sancti Francisci}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (3ra) Nachtrag: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Autor huius legende fuit dominus Bonauentura\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit prologus in vitam beati Francisci confessoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Apparuit gracia dei saluatoris nostri diebus istis nouissimis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (4rb-4vb) Kapitel\u252 \'fcbersicht \endash  (4vb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit vita sancti Francisci. De conuersacione beati Francisci in habitu seculari. Capitulum 1\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 m\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  [V]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ir erat in ciuitate Assysij Franciscus nomine cuius memoria in benedictione est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (63ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit vita beati Francisci. Incipiunt quedam de miraculis ipsius post mortem ostensis. Et primo de virtutibus sanctorum stigmatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ad omnipotentis dei honorem et gloriam. Beati patris Francisci post glorificacionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... (85va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 per merita serui sui Francisci ad laudem et gloriam vnius dei et trini, qui viuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  Nachtrag: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit vita sancti Francisci \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  85vb-85av leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ed.: S. Bonaventurae Opera omnia. Bd. 8: Opuscula varia ad theologiam mysticam et res Ordinis Fratrum Minorum spectantia, Quaracchi 1898, vol. 8, S. 504-564; Analecta Franciscana 10 (1926\endash 40), 555\endash 626. \endash  Lit.: BHL 3107 (Vita), 3109 (Miracula); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , R\u233 \'e9pertoire, Nr. 305o; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Distelbrink\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Bonaventura, 49f. Nr. 50.}

