\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (Hinzugef\u252 \'fcgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Prohemialis epistola\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (hinzugef\u252 \'fcgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 missa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 summo pontifici super legendam sancte Clare virginis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (86ra) Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Qvasi veterani mundi senecta urgente ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  (86vb) Vita: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit legenda s. Clare virginis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Admirabilis femina Clara uocabulo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et virtute de civitate Assisij nomine claro satis genere \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 pontificatus domini Allexandri pape iiij\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ti\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  anno primo. Ad laudem domini nostri ... Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ed.: Vita: Acta SS Aug. II, Antwerpen 1735, S. 754-767 Lit.: BHL 1815. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Distelbrink\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Bonaventura, Nr. 153.}

