\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Alexander episcopus seruus seruorum dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 virtus sue sanctitatis effulsit. De quibus uide supra in legenda. Et sic est finis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Scriptum per fratrum Sigismundum anno domnin m\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  cccc 6\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 mo\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  vj\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 to\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ? \endash  109ar-v leer.
