\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (283vb) Notiz am unterem Rand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Anno domini 1162 tres magi a Mediolano translati sunt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash   \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit prologus in legendam sanctorum trium magorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dignum est, fratres karissimi ut illorum hodie attollamus preconium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (284vb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit legenda de tribus magis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sanctorum veneranda atque sanctissima vita resplendens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... (300vb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vitam nobis obtineant eternam quod ipse deus ternus et unus sua pietate concedat qui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Scriptum per quendam fratrem Sigismundum professum in Tegernsee anno domini 1466\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b
