\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (11ra) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Reddet deus mercedem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Sap. 10,17) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Vocauit nos deus ad celestem patriam ab hoc exilio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (13rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De primo martyre uel confessore, de vj germinibus que dybolus intoxicare nicitur per vj genera ueneni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Beatus uir qui in sapiencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Sir. 14,22) (13va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sapientes maxime laudantur et qui sciunt sibi cauere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (15vb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo bonus de conuersione sancti Pauli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ecce nos relinquimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Mt. 19,27) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sanctus Paulus hodie in \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (16ra) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 conuersione sua uere omnia reliquit et Christum perfecte est secutus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 86\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (223rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De sancta Margarita\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Inventa una preciosa margarita\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Mt.13,46) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Secundum litteram inuenit Dominus hodie hic in terris preciosam margaritam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 87\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (224vb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de Maria Magdalena\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Multe filie congregaverunt etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . (Prov.31,29) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ad litteram post gloriosam virginem Mariam nullam invenimus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... (227va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 quia nescitis qua hora etc. Quod ipse prestare dignetur Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  227vb leer.
