\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermones communes de apostolis, martyribus et confessores\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (228ra) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Gaudete quia nomina vestra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Lc.10,20) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Beatis apostolis allud verbum bene dicitur quia eorum nomina\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (229va) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Item de apostolis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Pro patribus tuis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Ps. 44,17) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sciendum quod Christus aliquos patres habuit in lege\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (232rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Item de eodem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Uenite ad me omnes qui laboratis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Mt 11:28) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Duo de sanctis apostolis dicit dominus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 18\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (259ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo utilimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Super pauca fuisti fidelis etc \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (Mt. 25,21)  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 O quantum commendantur sancti confessores\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 19\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (260vb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo bonus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Intra in gaudium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Mt. 25,21) (261ra) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Promisit Dominus suis amicis suis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 tristitiam presentis vite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 20\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (261va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Vos qui secuti \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (Mt. 19,28) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Petrus et alij apostoli audierant dominum dicentem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... (262vb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ipsum secuntur in\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [orationibus?] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 predictorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ?
