\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 4ra-258rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Johannes Herolt}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Liber de eruditione christifidelium
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (4ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit liber Discipuli de erudicione Christi fidelium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b (Hinzugef\u252 \'fcgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De X preceptis in generali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \endash  De decem praeceptis: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Si vis ad vitam ingredi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Mt. 19,7) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In verbis propositis ostendit Christus cuilibet hominum viam eterne vite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  (99rb) Datiert: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1472\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  (99va) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sequitur tractatus de nouem peccatis alienis etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nouem sunt peccata aliena quorum si peccator in vno in morte deprehensus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  (106ra) Datiert: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1472 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  (106rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit tractatus de septem peccatis mortalibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Peccatum cum consummatum fuerit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Jac. 1,15) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hoc intelligitur de quolibet peccato mortali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (188rb) Datiert: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1472\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  (188va) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit tractatulus de sex operibus misericordie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Opera misericordie corporalia sunt sex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (194vb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit exposicio super oracionem dominicam etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Omnes vnanimes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (1Ptr. 3,8) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sicut dicit glossa super illud psalmo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (200rb) Datiert: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1472\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  (200va) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit exposicio super salutacione angelica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ave Maria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Lc. 1,28)\u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sciendum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 quod ista salutacio angelica est Marie virgini valde gratiosa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (203rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit exposicio super symbolum apostolorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Omnis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 qui viuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Jo. 11,26) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sciendum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 quod fides frequenter est predicanda fidelibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (212rb) Datiert: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1472\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  (212va) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit tractatus de septem sacramentis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (gestrichen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 )\u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sacramenta sunt septem que deus instituit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (237va) Datiert: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1472 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  (237vb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tractatus de septem donis spiritus sancti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Septem sunt dona\u8249 \'8b spiritus sancti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Que ideo sunt septem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... (241va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 si carnali delectacione cor maculas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  1472. \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Et sic est finis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit liber de erudicione christifidelium collectus anno domini millesimo quadringintesimo sexto ex diuersis et pluribus libris doctorum katholicorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \u8249 \'8b \endash  (242ra-251ra) Themata dominicarum totius anni: \u220 \'dcberschrift von der Hand Raphael Neup\u246 \'f6cks: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Breuis annotacio qualiter super euangelia dominicalia tocius anni possit materia predicabilis accipi ex tractatibus et per litteras alphabeti signatis siue distinctis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominica prima aduentus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ecce rex tuus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Mt. 21,5) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Jam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 presenti tempore celebratur aduentus Christi pro ut venit in vterum virginis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  (251ra) Datiert: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1472\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash   (251va-258rb) Tabula secundum ordinem alphabeti  \endash  (258rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit tabula presentis operis. In die Kyliani martyris anno etc millesimo quadringintesimo septuagesimo secundo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b [1472 Juli 8] \endash  241vb, 251rb, 258v leer.
