\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 82r-85v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Pius II papa}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : Oratio \u8222 \'84Superioribus diebus (1462 M\u228 \'e4rz 31)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u220 \'dcberschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Registrum responsionis domini nostri sanctissimi domini Pii pape 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 i\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ad oratores regis Bohemie. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Superioribus diebus cum audiuissemus vos oratores carissimi filii nostri \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 eritisque in hoc seculo felices in alio letati prestante domino nostro \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Nachgetragen. \endash  Edition: Oration \u8222 \'84Superioribus diebus\ldblquote  of Pope Pius II (31 March 1462, Rome), hrsg. von Michael von Cotta-Sch\u246 \'f6nberg. 5th version (Orations of Enea Silvio Piccolomini/Pope Pius II 66), Online-Ausgabe 2019: https://hal.archives-ouvertes.fr/hal-01230088.}

