\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 102r-104v \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Epistolae
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (102r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Salutem qua nos impertis non iocundissime reddimus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 celerem recessum die saturni 10 Augusti 65. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (102v) \u220 \'dcberschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Copia litterarum domini apostolici ... \endash  Domino imperatori. Carissime in Christo fili. Etsi contemplacione ac precibus tue sublimitatis animum nostrum in factis regis Bohemie et regni ipsius suspenderimus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Item domino duci Ludwico Bauaris omnino consiliis mutatis mutandum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Domino episcopo Olomucensi. \endash  Venerabilis frater etc. Quamuis non dubitamus tuam fraternitatem semper constantem fuisse \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (103v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Capitulo Olomucensi.\endash  Dilectis filiis decano et capitulo ecclesie Olomucensis Pius papa secundus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Crebra fide dignorum relacione intelleximus vos continue \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sub annulo piscatoris die iii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  decembris anno M cccc lxii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 mo\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [Dezember 3 1462] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 pontificatus nostri anno quinto. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (104r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Domino abbati. \endash  Dilecti filii etc. Quoniam ex iniuncto nobis apostolatus officio ad ea omnia intendimus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 6\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ciuitatis et vniuersitatis Olomucensis dilecti filii etc. Intelleximus continue hactenus relacione fide digna vniuersitatem vestram \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Nachgetragen. Teilweise bruchst\u252 \'fcckhafte Abschrift von Briefen u.a. von Papst Pius II.}

