\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Summa praeceptorum ad eam partem composicionis superioris pertinencium \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ad omnes res honestas flamato\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 studio rapiebatur etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  112v-112cv leer.
