\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 113r-121r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Quintus Horatius Flaccus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : Ars poetica
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Liber Oracii poete de poetria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Humano capiti ceruicem pictor equinam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 plena cruoris irundo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [! vielm. [h]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 irudo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . Explicit feliciter liber Oracii in poetria die sabati finitus post festum sancti Bartholomei \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 anno lviii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1458 September]. Darunter kurze Notiz zum Tod von Ladislaus Postumus. \endash  121v-121bv leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Stellenweise mit Marginalglossen. \endash  Edition: Q. Horatii Flacci opera, hrsg. von F. Klingner. Leipzig 1959 (Bibliotheca Teubneriana). }

