\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u220 \'dcberschrift Schwerzenbeck: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ars rethoricalis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ad summi artificis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (! sonst: opificis) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 laudes suique inclite matris amorem et ad scholarium in arte dictatoria \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 cum toto agmine celesti sit in secula seculorum benedictus. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Granum rethorice codex sit iste liber vocatus etc. Anno 1450\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  Darunter zeitnah nachgetragene Notae zur Ars dictandi.
