\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ihesus. De memoria artificiali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nunc igitur ut ait Tullius due memorie sunt vna naturalis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et quod concepit tua mens meditare frequenter. Explicit etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  Darunter (65v) Hymnus AH 15 Nr. 5.\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  
