\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2r-22v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Sermones}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (2r) Nachgetragen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In die natiuitatis beate virginis sermo sancti Augustini episcopi. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Adest nobis dilectissimi optatus dies natalis beate ac venerabilis semper virginis Marie \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (4r) Nachgetragen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominica infra octauam natiuitatis beate virginis. Sermo sancti Augustini episcopi. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Merito hodie profusis gaudiis totus vbique terrarum orbis exultat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (6v) Titel am Rand (beschnitten): [fe]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ria 3\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  post pa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [rasceve?] ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Exhibuit se dominus oculis discipulorum videndum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 16\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (19r) Nachgetragen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Secundum Matheum. In octava sancti Benedicti. Omelia sancti Iohannis episcopi. \endash  In illo tempore dixi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [t] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Simon Petrus ad Iesum: Ecce nos reliquimus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Mt 19,27). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Qualia omnia o beate Petre ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 17\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (20r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ad vincula sancti Petri sermo sancti Ambrosii episcopi. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Diximus fratres quod ad similitudinem Eve \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Illi veluti latenti et celanti se a diuinitate \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 18\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (22r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo sancti Ambrosii episcopi. Immaculatus dominus etc. Lectio 2a Nomen virginis titulus est pudoris \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Postremo non meum est illud \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  Kolophon: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit in Mellico in festo sanctorum martyrum Mauricii et sociorum eius \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [September 22]. Darunter theologische Notiz. \endash  (14v) Kolophon: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Oretur pro fratre Iohanne baccalario nouello monacho qui ad vestri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rogatum hos sermones copiauit et finiuit 1479. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  15r-v, 23r-v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 1= aus Ps.-Augustinus, Sermo de Annuntiatione, PL 39, 2104. \endash  2 = Beginn identisch mit Petrus Damiani, Sermo 31, PL 144, 67. \endash  3 = aus Augustinus, Sermo 262, PL 38, 207. \endash  17 = aus Maximus Taurinensis, Homilia 53, PL 57, 349. \endash  18 = aus Ambrosius, De virginibus, lib. I, PL 16, 191.}

