\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 140r-210r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Augustinus Holzapfler}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermones de tempore et de sanctis}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (140r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipiunt aliqui sermones quos quidam frater \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Nachtrag: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Augustinus Holczapfler prior noster arcium liberalium baccalarius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 collegit et praedicauit communi populo post prandium in ecclesia Tegrinsensi quorum primus est de sancto spiritu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dicta benediccione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hodie sancta mater ecclesia agit festum solemne quo ille dulcissimus consolator \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (144v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sermo de sancta trinitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 O altitudo diuiciarum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (Rm 11,33). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hodie sancta ecclesia agit sanctissime trinitatis festum et hoc ideo ob simplicem populum instruendum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (148r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sermo de corpore Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hoc facite in meam memoriam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (Lc 22, 19; I Cor 11,24). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Karissimi, prouidus paterfamilias habens vxorem pulchram facie et moribus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 14\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (197r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Alius sermo de caritate. \endash  Deus caritas est \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (Io 4,16). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dicit Dyonisius libro de diuinis nominibus: Amor est virtus vnitiua \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 15\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (203v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Alius sermo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Diliges proximum tuum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (Mt 22,39). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Deus dominus omnipotens legislator antiquorum patrum hoc quod antiquitus praeceperat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 15 Sermones, teilweise mit deutschsprachigen Passagen, von Augustinus Holzapfler, ab 1482 Prior in Tegernsee. Weitere Sammlungen der Sermones Holzapflers in Clm 18676-18680. \endash  Lit.: Johann Baptist Schneyer, Winke f\u252 \'fcr die Sichtung und Zuordnung sp\u228 \'e4tmittelalterlicher lateinischer Predigtreihen, in: Scriptorium 32 (1978), S. 231-248, hier S. 234. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 VL 4 (1983), Sp. 119.}

