\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tractatus de virtute discretionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b (221r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Discrecio secundum Iohannem Climacum est diuine voluntatis certa comprehensio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de cibo delicato et superfluo nimis indulgeat. Explicit tractatulus. Scriptor sit omni delicto lotus.}

