\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In nomine sanctissime et indiuidue trinitatis incipit tractatulus contra oblatrantes statui perfectionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Multi modernorum non solum horrent Christi sequelam summi doctoris \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 timore malorum sublato praestante hoc domino nostro Ihesu Christo vero pastore \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash  228r leer. }

