\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (2ra) Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Prefaciuncula in sequens opusculum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quidam frater confratrum suorum in conuentu publice legencium \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (2ra-30ra) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Liber Genesis hebraice Bresith\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In principio creauit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Gn 1,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Inanis pomiferum luminare reptile volatile \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 quid agendum sit de ceteris pluribus omissis. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Versus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Laus et gloria semper tibi Christe Iesu. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  (2ra) Beginn Glossierung: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Extractio item Genesis 3\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  tunicis pelliceis et ita dicitur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  30v-37v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Parallel\u252 \'fcberl.: Melk, Benediktinerstift, Cod. 1396 (1844, 1679, H 30), 195vb-219rb (https://manuscripta.at/?ID=41052) sowie Melk, Benediktinerstift, Cod. 1835 (416, H 32), p. 49-128b (https://manuscripta.at/?ID=41448), jeweils mit abweichendem Explicit und ohne den Prolog.}

