\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 52r-61v \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Acta processus resignationis et electionis praepositi monasterii Beyharting (1500)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sequitur processus resignationis seu cessionis necnon electionis prelature \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [\u252 \'fcbergeschrieben: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 praepositure\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 seu prelati monasterii Beyharting. Renunctiatio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  seu cessio praepositure. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In nomine patris \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Coram vobis venerabili patri domino Iohanne Schrennath \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ego frater Udalricus praepositus monasterii sancti Iohannis Baptiste in Beiharting considerans quod propter debilitates corporis mei multas \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (52v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Acta sunt hec anno M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  quingentesimo die martis xxiii mensis nouembris \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1500 November 23] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 in loco capitulari monasterii praefati Beiharting ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  Daran anschlie\u223 \'dfend \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Forma citationis ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  ... (61v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Processus electionis. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  62r-63v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Schriftst\u252 \'fccke zur Resignation von Ulrich IV. Eisenhofer, Propst des Augustinerchorherrenstiftes Beyharting, und zur Wahl und Einsetzung seines Nachfolgers Ambrosius Treitwein. }

