\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (65r) Forma electionis: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In nomine sanctae trinitatis. Item primo statuent electores competentem terminum ad electionem celebrandam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (66r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sequitur modus procedendi per viam compromissi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Modus procedendi per compromissum mixtum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (67r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Collacio ante electionem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (68r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Forma contestationis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Forma tradicionis potestatis compromissoribus electis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (68v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Iuramenta ante electionem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (69v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Forma electionis pronunciande \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Forma publicacionis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (70r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Iuramentum ante electionem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Forma nominacionis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Forma adiuracionis in scrutinio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (70v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Forma promittendi oboedientiam nouo praelato \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Forma promittendi oboedientiam commissorum in vulgari. Ich pr\u252 \'fcder N. verlob euch erwirdigen in got her \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  71r-72v leer.}

