\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (206v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Collacio de sancto Nicolao\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 confessore et pontifice. \endash  Sanctus Nicolaus patres colendi vt cetera eius dona taceam hoc vnum a deo donari sibi meruit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (212v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ihesus Maria. Anno 1503. Collacio de verbis euangelii Puer Ihesus erat subditus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Lc 2,51). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quocumque me vertam patres et fratres venerabiles omnia diuinis referta misteriis conspicio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... mit erg\u228 \'e4nzender Notiz (221v). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (222r)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Collacio de sancto Mauro abbate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1503 est in refectorio lecta. \endash  Plurimi romani colendi patres a parcitate vite laudantur praesertim principes Fabricius et Marcus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 14\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (298v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ihesus Maria. Sermo in natiuitate domini nostri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ihesu Christi 1504. \endash  Hoc vobis signum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Lc 2,12). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Non potest sermone humano dilectissimi huius celeberrime diei festiuitas satis explicari \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 15\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (304r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ihesus Maria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In die circumcisionis domini 1504. \endash  Postquam consummati sunt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Lc 2,21). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Verba illa charissimi que in hodierno euangelio continentur informant omnes christicolas \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 16\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (308v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo in die sanctae epiphanie 1504\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cum natus esset Ihesus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Mt 2,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dignum est charissimi vt hodiernam festiuitatem congrua deuocione gaudio spirituali \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... }

