\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (221v) Nachtrag Schwerzenbeck: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tres sunt rationes quare terra sancta possidetur ab infidelibus. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Adorabimus in loco \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (Ps 131,7). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Verba ista intelliguntur de sancta ciuitate Ierusalem quae deo disponente \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (225v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Da pacem domine in diebus nostris etc. Sic orat cottidie sancta mater ecclesia \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  (227r) knappe theologische Notiz. \endash  227v leer.}

