\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 247r-255r \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Sentimentum cuiusdam cartusiani de visione Dionysio Cartusiano adscripta
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur sentimentum sew declaracio visionis praedicte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Reuerende ac praedilecte pater ad satisfaciendum obedientie mihi per paternitatem vestram \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de salute prouideat eterna. Amen. Explicit predicte visionis seu reuelacionis declaratio et sentimentum. 1474. 
