\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipiunt sermones de domini decem praeceptis ex diuersis doctoribus collecti apti ad praedicandum pro simplici populo per domini aduentum et per Quadragesimam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (23r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Si vis ingredi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Mt 9,17)\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hec sunt domini Ihesu verba et consilium valde efficax saluari volentibus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (33r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Non assumes nomen \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Ex 20,7)\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Verba vestre proposita charitati sunt scripta originaliter Exodi 20 et sunt 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 m\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  domini praeceptum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (43r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sequitur 2m praeceptum decalogi. Non assumes nomen \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Ex 20,7)\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Carissimi, verba caritiati vestre proposita scribuntur Exodi 20 capitulo et exprimuntur 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 m\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  praeceptum omnipotentis dei \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 13\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (143r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Non loquaris contra proximum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Ex 20,16)\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In Christo dilecti, proxime audiuit vestra caritas septimum domini praeceptum. Hodie ingreditur octauum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 14\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (153r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Non concupisces vxorem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Ex 20,17)\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In Christo dilecti, in sexto praecepto dominus vniversalis celi et terre volens nostram salutem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 15\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (163r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Non concupisces rem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Ex 20,17)\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... Proxime audivit caritas vestra declaracionem noni praecepti \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  30v-32v, 39v-42v, 50r-52v, 59-62, 69r-72v, 81r-82v, 89v-91v, 101r-102v, 110r-112v, 121r-122v, 130r-132v, 139v-142v, 150v-152v, 160v-162v, 170r-171v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Im Inhaltsverzeichnis (VS) einem \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20\cf1 frater Gabriel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  zugeschrieben, den Lindner, Familia, S. 110, mit dem Tegernseer Professen Gabriel Walch identifiziert und dem er auch die Sermones in Clm 18989 b und 18989 c zuschreibt. \endash  Sermones 1, 2, 13, 14, 15 auch in Clm 18680, dort als Predigten von Augustinus Holzapfler (GND 103154795). }

