\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (4v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tabula quaestiuncularum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...\u8249 \'8b \endash  (5r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Argumentum in manuale viaticum super regulam sancti Benedicti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quoniam textus regule sancti Benedicti secundum librorum diuersitate \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit argumentum milleno quadringenteno cum quadrigeno septeno Christi praesens opus editur anno \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1447, Werkdatierung]\u8249 \'8b \endash  (5r) Prooemium: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hoc fac et viues \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Lc 10,28). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Applicando breuissime hoc ewangelicum verbum regule beati patris Benedicti \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (6r-196r) Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Obsculta o fili \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Regula beatissimi patris Benedicti abbatis prima sui divisione dividitur in duas partes \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 haec regna patebunt superna que nobis tribuat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen. \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Schreibervers:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ceperunt Geruasius et Prothasius \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [Juni 19] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 almus hoc manuale super sancti norma Benedicti octobris nonus finit opusque dies 1447 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1447 Oktober 9, aus der Vorlage \u252 \'fcbernommen?]\u8249 \'8b Darunter nachgetragen redaktionelle Notiz.
