\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit charta papalis Nicolai quinti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... Redemptor humani generis visitans nos oriens ex alto \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 nos fratres Martinus et Laurencius abbates prenominati \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 munire curauimus. Datum in praedicto monasterio sancti Quirini in Tegernsee anno domini millesimo quadringentesimo quinquagesimo secundo quarta decima die mensis aprilis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1452 April 14]. \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit charta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Parallel\u252 \'fcberl. aus Tegernsee: Clm 18552 b, 3r-11v. \endash  Vgl. Acta Cusana I/3a, 1026-1028, Nr. 1545, Formular I f\u252 \'fcr M\u228 \'e4nnerkl\u246 \'f6ster b.}

