\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 5r-344r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes Schlitpacher}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Manuale viaticum}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (5r) Index quaestionum. \endash  5v leer. \endash  (6r) Prooemium: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hoc fac et viues \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Lc 10,28). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Applicando hoc ewangelicum verbum regule sancti patris Benedicti duo dantur ibi consideranda \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  (6v-344r) Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Absculta \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  o fili \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (7r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Regula beatissimi patris Benedicti abbatis prima sui diuisione diuiditur in duas partes scilicet in partem prohemialem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 hec regna patebunt superna que nobis tribuat Christus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash  Schreibervers: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 1447 ceperunt Geruasius et Prothasius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 almus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [1447 September 19]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  / hoc manuale super sancti norma Benedicti / octobris nonus finit opusque dies \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [1447 Oktober 9. Datierungen aus der Vorlage \u252 \'fcbernommen?]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit manuale viaticum super regula sancti Benedicti a quodam fratre Mellicensis monasterii compilatum. Laus trinitati eterne. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash  344v-352v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Parallel\u252 \'fcberl. aus Tegernsee: Clm 18553 b, 3r-212v. \endash  Clm 18993, 4v-195r, dort mit gleichlautendem Schreibervers. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 VL 8 (1992), Sp. 733 (Franz Josef Worstbrock, Hs. genannt).}

