\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (355r) Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Praefaciuncula praesentis operis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In sequenti opusculo quod auizamentum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 siue auizacio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  praelatorum posset attitulari \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (355v-365v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sequitur compendium pro auisacione praelatorum ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Prelatus ordinis sancti patris Benedicti dupplici \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  debito ad obseruanciam obligatur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 obmissa sunt causa breuitatis. Deo gracias. Hanc rem collegit vna dies vicesima sexta Augusti \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [August 26]. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 VL 8 (1992), Sp. 733 (Franz Josef Worstbrock).}

