\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ihesus nostrum gaudium. \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (386r) Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit epistola siue exhortacio venerabilis patris Cristanni prioris Tegernseensis ad fratres iuniores in Ebersperg professos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In Cristo sinceram caritatis oracionem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Certe, religiosi et deo deuoti fratres, dignum et equum est vt ante dudum promissum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  (386v-397r) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit prologus. Exhortacio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Exhortor igitur primum vos omnes ad quos mihi est sermo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 per vestrem fratrem Cristannum in Tegernsee professum. Datis dominica ante Cholomanni anno 1478. Merces scriptoris sis, Christe, quietis laboris. Benedicto requiem dona deus alme perhennem.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit. Orate deum pro me pater sancte \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [am unteren Blattrand, beschnitten: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Zacharias filius noster\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ]. \endash  397v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 VL 9 (1995), Sp. 715, Hs. genannt (Franz Josef Worstbrock). }

