\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (1r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de natiuitate domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b [von sp\u228 \'e4terer Hand nachgetragen]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Locuturus de tam ingenti et ineffabili praesentis sollempnitatis leticia animus obstupescit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (3r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de sancto Stephano\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b [von sp\u228 \'e4terer Hand nachgetragen]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Post passionem et resurrectionem domini nostri Ihesu Christi et in celos ascensionem, cum apostoli profecti praedicauerunt ubique \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (4v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de sancto Iohanne evangelista\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  Tempore illo quo apostoli per uniuersum orbem verbum dei praedicauerunt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 16\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (27r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In dedicatione ecclesie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Domus mea domus orationis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Mc 11,17). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Domus dei est sancta ecclesia quam per effusionem sanguinis sui \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 17\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (28v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In festiuitate omnium sanctorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Legimus in ecclesiastica historia quod sanctus Bonifacius a Foca cesare \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 18\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (30r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De aduentv domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Egredietur virga de radice \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Is 11,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Propheta iste sancto inebriatus spiritu redemptionem humani generis longe praeuidit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... }

