\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 91r-v leer. - 92r-96v \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Iohannes de Lambaco: Epistola ad Sebastianum F\u252 \'fcssteiner priorem in Mondsee (1454)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u220 \'dcberschrift nachgetragen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Epistola venerabilis patris Iohannis de Lambaco sacre theologie doctoris \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Affectum caritatis amoris obsequio iugiter exhibere. Dignissime frater, petisti nuper sermone tibi breuiter explicari \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 qui prior constituitur in honore // \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Textabbruch.  
