\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (151r-160r) Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tempus opposicionis vel coniunctionis medie luminarium locum solis et argumenta \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 in linea transitus eius a principio ad finem. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Et sic est finis canonum tabularum de eclipsibus luminarium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b Darunter nachgetragene astronomische Notizen. \endash  (160v) Schema: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Figuratio eklipsis lunaris ad annum Christi 1460 currentem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (161r-213v) Tabulae. \endash  (213v) nachgetragene astronomische Notizen (Johannes Keck?). \endash  214r-216v leer.
