\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 115v-126v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Iohannes Keck}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : Decaperotision ad canonicos Indersdorfenses 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (115v) Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Prologus fratris Iohannis Keck in decaperotision eiusdem ad canonicos Vndensdorffenses \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [Indersdorf]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Venerabili in Christo patri domino Iohannes \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tuus me cogit amor patrem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 optime nec minus augit ardor dilectionis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (116r-126v) Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ducentorum denariorum panes non sufficiunt vt vnusquisque difficultatis nodus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 motis satagat respondere. Explicit decaperotision fratris Iohannis Keck de Tegernsee ad canonicos Vndensdorffenses datis prima die mensis maii anno domini m\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  cccc\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  xlvii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1447 Mai 1] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 etc. Frater Iohannes Keck manu propria. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  127r-132v leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Autograph. \endash  \u8222 \'84Zehnfragentraktat\ldblquote , verfasst als Antwort auf die Anfragen des Indersdorfer Propstes Iohannes I. Rothuet, siehe \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 VL 4 (1983), Sp. 1097 (Heribert Rosssmann, Hs. genannt).}

