\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u220 \'dcberschrift Schwerzenbeck: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de laude sacre scripture fratris Iohannis Keck. \endash  Vtinam sicut olim ad Ysaiam sic ad me volare dignaretur hodie de Seraphim angelus vnus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... 
