\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 248r-258r{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1  Iohannes Keck}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : Tractatulus de cautela et modo praedicandi
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (248r) Widmungsbrief: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Praesuli Augustinensi frater Iohannes Keck monachus Degrandesensis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  Almo praesuli Augustinensi aut eius in spiritualibus vicario generali \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tue ciuitatis clericorum nonnullis meam placuit imperitiam consulere \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (248v) Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Fratris Iohannis Keck monachi Degrandesensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 in theologia magistri ordinis sancti Benedicti vallis salinarum de fossione salis quo sermo docentis condiatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 incipit. \endash  Beatus apostolus Iacobus quem hodierne dominice in lectione missali audiuimus recitari \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 quibus datur occasio fodiatur. Explicit vallis salinarum de fossione salis quo docentis sermo condiatur edita a fratre Iohanne Keck monacho Degrandesensi. \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 258v-259v leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Autograph. \endash  Druck des Widmungsbriefes: Bibliotheca Augustana, Bd. 1, hrsg. von F. A. Veith. Augsburg 1785, S. 93f. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 VL 4 (1983), Sp. 1096 (Heribert Rosssmann, Hs. genannt, Titel von dort \u252 \'fcbernommen).}

