\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 260r-270r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Iohannes Keck}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : Sermones
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (260r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de sancto Michahele \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  Angeli eorum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Mt 18,10). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sacrosancta generalis synode \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 videns ego me stantem in medio tui \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... (267r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hic sermo pronunciatus est per me Iohannem Keck coram sacro Basiliensi concilio in die sancti Michahelis anno domini 1441 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1441 September 29]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Iohannes Keck. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (267v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In assumptione beate Marie sermo anno domini 1447\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  Intrauit Ihesus in quoddam castellum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Lc 10,17). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Reuerendissimi patres \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ciuitatem suam gloriosam quam altissimus fundauerat tabernaculum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  270v-271r leer, (271v) leer bis auf knappe redaktionelle Notiz Iohannes Kecks. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Autographa. \endash  1 =\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 gedruckt in VD 16 K 584 (Klosterdruckerei Tegernsee 1574). }

