\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Vtrum angeli mittantur ad homines viatores. Quod non arguitur quia frustra mittitur nuncius \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 est pro dictis. Haec de quaestione. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Autograph. \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 VL 4 (1983), Sp. 1093 (Heribert Rosssmann, Hs. genannt).}

