\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (36r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In die pasce\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b [\u220 \'dcberschrift stark verblasst]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hec est dies quam fecit dominus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Ps 117,24). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sciendum quod praesens festiuitas praecellit alias festiuitates in sollempnitate \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (37v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Surrexit dominus vere \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Lc 24,34). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sciendum quod Christi resurreccio est exemplar nostre future resurreccionis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 1 = Schneyer, RLS 2 Nr. 56 (Johannes Herolt). }

