\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 137r-146v \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Epistolae et Bullae (1465/1466)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (137r) Paulus II papa ad Matthiam regem Hungariae: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Carissimo in Christo filio nostro Mathie regi Vngarie illustri. \endash  Paulus episcopus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Suspendit hactenus apostolica sedes processum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Datum Rome aput \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (! fehlt: sanctum Petrum anno quadrin-) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 gentesimo sexagesimo quinto decimo kalendas Augusti \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1465 Juli 23]. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (137v) Matthias I. Corvinus ad Paulum papam: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Beatissime pater etc. Mandat michi per litteras suas apostolicas vestra beatitudo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (138r) Georgius de Podiebrad ad Paulum II papam: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Copia littere misse domino apostolico scilicet Paulo per Georgium assertum regem Bohemie. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Beatissime pater \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Pridem rumor insonuit quod fiscalis vestre beatitudinis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... (138v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Datum Prage 21 Octobris anno 1465. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (138v) Paulus II papa ad Georgium de Podiebrad: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Responsio sanctissimi domini nostri ad litteras Georgii heretici \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Paulus etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Causam declaracionis penarum iuris aduersum te ob heresim notoriam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (141r) Paulus II papa: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Copia bulle in qua sanctissimus dominus noster omnes et singulos absoluit ab homagiis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  Paulus episcopus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sacrosancta romana et apostolica ecclesia quam inscrutabilis diuine prouidencie altitudo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... (142r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Datum Rome aput \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sanctum Marcum anno dominice incarnacionis m\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  cccc\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  65 sexto idus decembris \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1465 Dezember 8] ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (142v) Paulus II papa ad Ludowicum ducem Bavariae: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Responsio sanctissimi domini nostri ad litteras Ludowici ducis Bauarie \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  Paulus etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quanto feruore pro catholici fidei vnitate et pacis studio mouearis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Datum Rome apud sanctum Marcum anno incarnacionis dominice m cccc lxvi ydus februarii \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1466 Februar 13] ... \endash  147r-148v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Briefe und Bullen zur Hussitenfrage. \endash  In \u228 \'e4hnlicher Zusammenstellung auch in Klosterneuburg, Augustiner-Chorherrenstift, Cod. 933 (https://manuscripta.at/?ID=1179). }

