\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u220 \'dcberschrift Schwerzenbeck: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Fabula seu hystoria de Tancredo et Sigismunda eius filia. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  (179v) Widmungsbrief: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Leonhardus Aretinus Vindacio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ricasolano \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [Bindaccio Ricasoli]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  viro praestantissimo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cum sepius mecum egisses ut fabulam illam Boccacii \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (179v-184r) Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tancredus fuit princeps Salernitanus vir mitis atque benigni ingenii \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 in eodem sepulchro sepiliri \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 omnes \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (! sonst: ambos)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  fecit. Amen. \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 184v leer.
