\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Posicio siue determinacio de arte oratoria siue poetica magistri Georgii de Peurbach\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dum nuper huic actui celeberrimo daretur inicium hoc in loco vir praestantissime disputator \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 reseruare cogitaui etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Anno domini m\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  cccc\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  lviii \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1458] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 in disputacione de qualibet cui praesidebat magister Conradus S\u228 \'e4lder etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b
