\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2r Besitzvermerk (Schwerzenbeck): \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1484. Iste liber attinet venerabili cenobio sancti Quirini regis et martiris in Tegernsee\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b mit Hinweis: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Totum volumen istud scripsit manu propria. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  Unten Vermerk: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sunt lxxii sermones huius voluminis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (2r-3r) Inhaltsverzeichnis. \endash  3v-4v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 5r-337v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Wolfgangus Kydrer de Salzburg}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Sermones}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (5r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In festo concepcionis christifere virginis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b [am unteren Blattrand Datierung: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1470\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 mo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ]. \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tota pulchra es \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Ct 4,7). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Altissimus cuius celum sedes est appropinquare volens mortalibus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (9r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In die sancto natiuitatis domini. \endash  Hoc vobis signum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Lc 2,12). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Scribitur M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 t\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  5\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 to\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  non potest ciuitas abscondi supra montem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (13r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In die circumcisionis domini. \endash  Postquam consummate sunt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Lc 2,21). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Morali dicit: beneficii accepti memor esto \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 70\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (318r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In natiuitate beatissime virginis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ipse fundauit eam altissimus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Ps 86,5). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Precelse genitricis natalem quo nostre salutis primordia recolendum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 71\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (323v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Luc. 19. In dedicacione ecclesie. \endash  Hodie huic domui \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Lc 19,9). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In festo dedicacionis huius templi quod singulariter in honore dedicatum est \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 72\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (330r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sap. 10\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 mo\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In festo sancti Quirini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Reddet deus mercedem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Sap 10,17). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sancta mater ecclesia beatorum martyrum festa colit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  137-138v, 150v, 163v, 170v-173v, 221r-v, 241v-245v, 281r-v, 293v, 338r-341v leer. \endash  (342r-v) siehe Einbandmakulatur.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Sermonessammlung. Datierungen: 1460 (139r), 1464 (294r, 302r) 1465 (23r, 27v). Vereinzelt deutsche Passagen (33r). \endash  Sermo 1 auch in Clm 18729, 136r. \endash  Zu Sermo 3 vgl. Schneyer/H\u246 \'f6dl s.v. Jacobus de J\u252 \'fcterborg 66. T8. \endash  Zu Wolfgang Kydrer siehe \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 VL 5 (1985), Sp. 474-477 (Dennis D. Martin, Hs. genannt).}

