\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (1r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Exiit edictum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Lc 2,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Notandum quod idem cesar erat potentissimus super omnes paganos \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (2r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In purificatione. \endash  Postquam consummati sunt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Lc 2,21). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In isto ewangelio 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 or\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  sunt notanda, primo purgacio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (3v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De anunciacione. \endash  Ecce concipies \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Lc 1,31). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hec verba Gabriel angelus hodie ad Mariam dixit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 13\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (29r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Stans retro secus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Lc 7,38) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... Quia magna multipliciter pectavit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et deum offendit ideo multipliciter deo satisfaciat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 14\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (31r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Egressus Ihesus trans torrentem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Io 18,1) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cum Ihesus egrediebatur Ierusalem facta cena cum discipulis suis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 15\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (37r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Pater noster \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Mt 6.9) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Per totum anni circulum praedicatur nobis verbum sacre scripture \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  Dazwischen 30r-v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Die Initien der zitierten Sermones 1-3 mit leichten Abweichungen auch in Innsbruck, ULBT, Cod. 770, 170v, 195r, 201v (https://manuscripta.at/?ID=29442). \endash  Sermo 13 nachgetragen. }

