\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (49v) Sermo: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Michi autem absit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Gal 6,14). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Modus est bonorum hospicium \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (! vielm.: hospitum) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 curiam suam decorare \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (51r) Legenda: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Otilia \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 virgo dilecta ex nobilissimis parentibus hoc modo nata est: temporibus Childerici \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (55r) Sermo: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Erat enim magnus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Lc 1,15). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Angelus Gabriel nativitatem praecursoris annunccians \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (!) ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (59v) Sermo: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Thesaurus desiderabilis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Prv 21,20). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Iste iustus fuit de quo dicitur: iuste et pie viuendo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (61v) Sermo: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Suscepimus deus misericoriam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Ps 47,10). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Olim sancti patres erant in continua exspectacione \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (65r) Sermo: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Erat Ihesus eiciens \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Lc 11,14). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Per hunc hominem intelligere possumus peccatorem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  54v, 66r-v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 1 = auch in Mattsee, Kollegiatstift, 75, 44ra (Peregrinus de Oppeln, GND 100380824). \endash  2 = BHL 6277. }

