vicesima septembris anno domini 51\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1451 September 20]. \endash  Darunter biographische Notiz zu Johannes Rockycana. \endash  147v-148v leer.
