\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Copia literarum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  quittationis dominum abbatem. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nos fratres Syxtus prior totusque conuentus monasterii in Tegernsee presertim recognoscimus per tenorem quod reverendus in Christo pater et dominus noster dominus Augustinus abbas \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 datum in loco capitulari monasterii praefati feria 6\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  post Scolastice virginis anno virginei partus 1541.
