\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (219v) Kaspar Ayndorffer an Iohannes Gr\u252 \'fcnwalder: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... Hinc ait in regula frater sanctissimus Benedictus vt opera talia fratribus iniungantur quatinus nec ociosi existant \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 datum et actum in praefato monasterio Tegernsse \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  die decima mensis Ianuarii anno a natiuitate Christi millesimo quadringentesimo quinquagesimo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [septimo]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1457 Januar 10]. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (222v) Iohannes Gr\u252 \'fcnwalder an Kaspar Ayndorffer: ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Premissis litteris vestris et lecturis vobis venerabili abbati ... vestre zelum devocionis ac studium sanctum commendantes \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 in castro nostro Frisingensi sabbato die proximo post octauas epiphanie anno domini millesimo quadringentsimo quinquagesimo septimo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1457 Januar]. \endash  223v-223dv leer.}

