\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (224r) Praefatio: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Praefacio opusculi sequentis de obseruanciis regularibus secundum Mellicenses\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In Ihesu Christi nomine. Amen. Anno natiuitatis eiusdem millesimo cccc\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  lx\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  in mense februario \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1460 Februar] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 patribus ordinis quibusdam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (225r) Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sequitur prologus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quamuis beatissimi patris nostri Benedicti regula sufficientissime ac clare regularis vite exprimat modum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (225v-268r) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De sono ad collacionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Omni itaque tempore quando bis manducatur facta cena \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 nil aliud quaerere quam deum quod nobis concedat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  Darunter Verzeichnis ausgelassener Kapitel.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Parallelhs. u.a.: Clm 18552 b, 136r-167r. \endash  Edition: Breviarium caerimoniarum monasterii Mellicensis (Textus y), hrsg. von Joachim F. Angerer. Siegburg 1985-1987 (Corpus consuetudinum monasticarum 11,1-2), S. 7-118. }

