\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sequitur quiddam notabile scriptum venerabilis patris Casparus Schatzgeri pro tunc custodis Bauarii et gardiani N\u252 \'fcrnbergensis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Casus. In monasterio quodam pro regularis obseruancie manutentione habetur constitucio Nicolai quinti pro eodem monasterio facta huiusmodi tenoris: abbati iniungimus vt fratribus suis discretos et boni zeli constituat confessores \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ex Monaco feria 2a post Augustini anno etc 1517 frater Caspar Schatzger custos Bauarie et gardianus Nurnbergensis. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  274ar-274bv leer. }

