\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 9r-v \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Epitaphia
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In Alexandrum magnum: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hos Demostenes philosophus in persona Alexandri \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 fecit versus. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 En ego qui totum mundum certamine vici \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (9v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Epitafium \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 quod tibi fecisti de idus februarii anno 1474 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hec continent metra peryodum tecti sub petra / Vlricus Greymolt rector ecclesie huius \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... Darunter Nota (Schwerzenbeck): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Obiit anno domini 1495 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 1 = Walther, Initia Nr. 5386. }

