\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ihesus Maria. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Excerptum ex Egidii de Roma ordinis fratrum heremitarum libro de regimine principum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (40r) Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ex regia ac sanctissima prosapia oriundo suo domino speciali domino Philippo primogenito \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (40r-74r) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 I. Quis sit modus procedendi in regimine principum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Oportet ut latitudo sermonis in unaquaque re \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 eternam pacem quam nobis dignetur concedere qui est benedictus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen. In die sancti Clementis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [November 23]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  anno 1452. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  74v-83v leer.
