\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 8r-60v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Udalricus Kaegerl de Landau}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : Sermones
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (8r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de sancto Hainrico confessore et imperatore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Homo nobilis abiit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Lc 19,12). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Iste nobilis sanctus fuit Hainricus qui abiit in regionem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (10r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de verbis epistole none dominice post octauam penthecostes. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Temptacio uos non apprehendat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (I Cor 10,13). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sciendum quod temptari non est malum sed eciam uirtutis exercicium \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (20r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Collacio capitularis in die parasceues 1495\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Inclinato capite tradidit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Io 19,30). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Reuerende in Christo pater \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 opus mirabile nostre redempcionis hodie digne colendum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 10\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (39r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de natiuitate beate virginis. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Liber generacionis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Mt 1,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Notandum quod sunt tria genera graciarum circa beatam virginem Mariam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 11\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (52r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de natiuitate beate Marie virginis. \endash  Liber generacionis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Mt 1,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quoniam, ut ait Petrus Damiani in sermone hodierne festiuitatis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  Dazwischen 9av und 19v leer.}

