\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quartus liber de imitacione Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (15r) Kapitel\u252 \'fcbersicht. \endash  (15v) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Deuota exhortacio ad sacram Christi communionem. Vox Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Venite ad me \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Mt 11,28) ... \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cum quanta reuerencia Christus sit suscipiendus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hec sunt verba tua Christe veritas eterna \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ineffabilia dicenda. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  pars huius totalis libris \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 deo gratias. Finitum Erfordie in die Ianuarii et sociorum eius martyrum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [Oktober 19] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 anno 1442\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  etc \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...\u8249 \'8b \endash  Darunter theologische Notiz.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 De imitatione Christi libri quattuor, hrsg. von Tiburzius Lupo. Citt\u224 \'e0 del Vaticano 1982, hier lib. IV.}

