\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u220 \'dcberschrift Schwerzenbeck (teilweise beschnitten): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cursus de eterna sapientia. \endash  Quicumque desiderat sapientiam eternam familiarem sponsam habere \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Versus: Salutem mentis et corporis donet nobis Ihesus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Expliciunt hore de eterna sapientia. 
