\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quartus sentenciarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b [am unteren Blattrand: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Excerpta vtilia ex quaestionibus magistri Nicolai de Dinckelspuchel super quarto sententiarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b] \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Vtrum in quolibet statu hominum fuerint aliqua sacramenta etc. Arguitur quia wlnera peccati sanantur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 de qua etiam gaudent. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Finis a deo est. Collat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [um?] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1450\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  213r-214v, 253v-261v leer
