\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 31r-173v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Ex iure canonico}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 u.a. (31r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Confessor nota casus de impedimentis matrimonii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nouem sunt que impediunt matrimonium \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (45r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nota de arbore consanguinitatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Consanguinitas est attinencia personarum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (50r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quomodo confessor debet interrogare peccatores in confessione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nota quod confessor tenetur sub pena mortalis peccati eas interrogaciones facere \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (70r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De obediencia. \endash  Aliqui dicunt et tenent quod papa sit supra concilium \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (75r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nota canones paenitentiales\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Queritur qui sint paenitentiales. Responditur quod reduci possunt ad 20 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (84r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Casus de iure episcopis reseruatis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sunt sex. Primus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Primus est excommunicacio maior \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (90r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Regule iuris secundum alphabetum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Accessorium sequitur naturam sui principalis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (102r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Casus in quibus excommunicacio incurritur ipso facto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nota quod maior excommunicacio separat hominem ab ingressu ecclesie \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (116r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Licencia pape est neccessaria in subnotatis casibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Monachus sine licencia pape non potest transire ad laxiorem ordinem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (128r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Praescripcio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Praescripcio est quoddam ius ex tempore congruens \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (141r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De arte magica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hanc artem deus permittit ut homines probentur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (148r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De vsura. \endash  Vsura est vbi amplius requiritur quam quod datur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (168r) Index alphabeticus. \endash  36r-v, 38v, 41r-v, 42v-43v, 49v, 68v, 69v, 71r-v, 72v, 73v-74v, 81v, 82r-83v, 89v, 99v, 101r-v, 106v, 109r-v, 111v, 113v-115v, 117r-v, 119r-v, 121v, 122v-127v, 131r, 136v, 140v, 166v-167v, 174r-187v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Teilweise bruchst\u252 \'fcckhafte Sammlung zu verschiedenen Themen des Kirchenrechts. Behandelt werden u.a. Bu\u223 \'dfe und Beichte, Eherecht, Verwandtschaft, Reservatf\u228 \'e4lle, Zehnt, Exkommunikation und Suspensation, Kirchenversammlungen, Vasallen, Erbrecht, Zauberei, Privilegien und Zins, Visitation von Kl\u246 \'f6stern und Fleischverzehr.}

