\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1r-29v \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Speculum artis bene moriendi
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u220 \'dcberschrift nachgetragen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tractatus pro in extremis agonizantibus. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  (1r) Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cum de presentis exilii miseria mortis transitus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (1r-10r) Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cum igitur omnium terribilium mors corporis sit terribilissima \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 antequam mors \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [fehlt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 eum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  occupet mori discat. Explicit libellus de arte moriendi.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Hier Nikolaus von Dinkelsb\u252 \'fchl zugeschrieben. \endash  Druck: GW 592, 592a, 2597-2614, Explicit abweichend. \endash  Lit.: Madre, S. 292-295. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 VL 9 (1995), Sp. 40-44 (Karin Schneider), zur Verfasserfrage Sp. 41. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \par}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 29v-31v \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Confessio
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ego frater N. indignus etc confiteor igitur tibi clementissime deus pater multitudinem magnitudinem et enormitatem vniuersorum scelerum et peccatorum meorum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 remedia efficaciter senciam michi profuisse. Amen. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Gedruckt in: Reliquien alter Zeiten, Sitten und Meinungen. Dritter Theil ..., hrsg. von Johann Georg M\u252 \'fcller. Leipzig 1806, S. 273-275.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 31v-44r \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tractatus de expeditione infirmorum, qui sunt in articulo mortis
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quia circa infirmos maius est periculum ideo cum ipsis est consulcius agendum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a facie eius. Et sic domino committat infirmum. Amen. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Zu diesem Text Hartmut Boockmann, Zu den Handakten des Kanonisten Johannes Urbach (Auerbach), in: DA 28 (1972), S. 497-532, hier S. 529f. mit Anm. 91. }

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 44r-47v \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De peccato
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Anshelmus in libro contemplacionum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sic dicit: cum peccaui in filium irritaui matrem nec offendi matrem sine iniuria filii \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 inter gementem et gemitus exaudientem etc.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Zum Textanfang vgl. Bonaventura, Soliloquium, opera omnia, Bd. 8. Quaracchi 1891, S. 37, c. 1,24. }

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 48r-70v \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De spe
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Gregorius dicit: Spem in solo redemptore figite ad eternam patriam mente transite. Si consideremus fratres karissimi quo et quanta sunt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 que fletibus lauatur Ihesu Christo domino nostro qui viuit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen.}

