que deuocione dignissimam memoriam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (188r) Nachgetragen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Collacio in festo omnium sanctorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Beati pauperes \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Mt 5,3). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Patres ac fratres dilecti, hodie ut nouit caritas vestra sancta mater ecclesia omnium sanctorum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (200r) Nachgetragen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Collacio in die animarum. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Anima mea turbata \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Ps 6,4). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ex quo hodie peragitur dies omnium animarum fidelium in purgatorio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... 
