\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 26r-34v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Iohannes Schlitpacher}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : Compendium tractatus Hugonis de Sancto Caro \u8222 \'84De divinis praedicationibus\ldblquote  cum expositione
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (26r-33r) Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In Cristi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 nomine. 1465 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [am unteren Blattrand \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 18 iunii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tractatus de diuinis praedicacionibus domini Hugonis cardinalis de ordine praedicatorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Iuxta sanctorum tradicionem quaedam quae vnum sunt tria esse dicuntur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 trinitas aut filius nullo modo potest dici. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit 20 Iunii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (33v-34v) Expositio: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Exposicio magistri Iohannis Slitpacher aliquorum terminorum praecedentis tractatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Iuxta sancorum etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In primo capitulo libri tria accipitur essentialiter \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 summe conuenit trinitati. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  35r-v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 M\u246 \'f6glicherweise Autograph. \endash  Parallel\u252 \'fcberl. u.a.: Melk, Benediktinerstift, Cod. 1653 (666, L 96), 156r-162r (Text), 162r-164r (Expositio, mit Abweichungen) (https://manuscripta.at/?ID=41294).}

