\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In Christi nomine 1469. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit explanacio officii capitularis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Officium capitulare quod in monasteriis bene institutis quotidie celebratur ex antiqua consuetudine \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 plura inuenire et meliora cogitare. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  55v leer.
