\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1r-70v \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Excerpta ex quaestionibus super libros Sententiarum
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De incarnacione Christi \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ex questionibus super libros sentenciarum. Ex libro tercio. Dubitatur an hec sit concedenda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Deus factus est homo. Responditur quod est concedenda et est catholica fides \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (16v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ex quarto sentenciarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dubitatur primo quid sit sacramentum. Responditur quod magister sententiarum sic describit sacramentum: est sacre rei signum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 celis reuertentes a terra etc.}

