\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Notantur auctoritates alique beati Bernardi in epistolis suis contente\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b (277r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De misericordia dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Felix latro salutis compendium est consecutus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ad quendam canonicum qui suasit cuidam iuueni amico suo de monasterio redire ad seculum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b (277v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Christus clamat contra te dicens: Quid agis miser \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... (315v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Idem consolans quosdam de morte praelati sui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Si haberemus hic manentem ciuitatem copiosissimis iure lacrimis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 congregacionem vestram Christus custodiat. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit ex epistolis beati Bernhardi abbatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b
