\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (317v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Idem in speculo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Frater si fuerit in colloquio secundum regulam leniter et sine risu \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (318v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Idem de libero arbitrio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In tribus consistit interior renouacio, in rectitudine \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (319r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Idem ad Cluniacenses\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ordo vester. Modus quidem est vitae sanctus honestus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... (328r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Clerici tria debent obseruare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Primum ut inter se caritatem habeant \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...
