\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 85ra-116vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Sermones}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (85ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo sancti Ambrosii episcopi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Commemoracionem virginis Marie venerantes fratres dilectissimi quantis dei muneribus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (85rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo sancti Maximi episcopi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Scientes fratres dilectissimi auctori nostro multum nos debere \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (87ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de assumpcione beatissime Marie virginis gloriose\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 domini Clementis pape vi\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ti\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ueni de Libano \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Ct 4,8). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Videmus manifeste quod aliqua mulier inuitatur ad coronam regis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (92rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de natiuitate beatissime virginis Marie domini Clementis pape vi\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quasi flos egreditur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Iob 14,2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Videtur michi quod flos in suo egressu habet quinque condiciones \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (98ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo in festo omnium sanctorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 domini Clementis pape sexti. \endash  Sufficiat nobis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Nm 16,3). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Philosophus primo ethicorum dicit quod ad beatitudinem seu felicitatem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (104rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo Clementis pape sexti de passione domini nostri Ihesu Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Respice in faciem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Ps 83,10). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Videtur mihi quod inter cetera membra corporis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (114rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de festo penthecostes Clementis pape vi\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Accipite spiritum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Io 20,22). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Gregorius Nazanzenus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (! sonst: Nazianzenus) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 in quodam sermone quem fecit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  86r-v, 116ar-116dv leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 2 = Ps.-Maximus Taurinensis, Sermo 36a, PL 57, 606-607. \endash  3-7 = Petrus Roger (Clemens VI. papa), siehe Schneyer, RLS 4, S. 757ff. Nr. 96, 72, 85, 76, 4. }

