\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (1ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Prologus Ruperti Holkot in exposicionem super librum sapientie Salomonis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominus petra mea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (2Rg 22,2) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Artes et scientie humanis studijs\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (2va) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Lectio prima. Diligite iustitiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Sap 1,1)\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Circa istum librum qui liber sapientie nuncupatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash   ... (249ra) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sapientia deducet ad regnum perpetuum, ad quod regnum nos perducat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit postilla super libro sapientie edita a sollemnissimo sacre pagine doctore fratre Rutperto Holkot de Anglia, ordinis predicatorum, non solum in scola legibilis, sed et in kathedra multum predicabilis, finita sub anno domini m\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  cccc\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  l\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 mo\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , in vigilia natiuitatis Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  (249rb - 257ra) Alphabetische Tabula. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ad euidentiam tabule sequentis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (257ra- 257va) Dubitationes: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Utrum licitum sit et meritorium alicui christiano\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (257va-b) Nota:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Nota quod iustitia coronat hominem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  residuo populi sui etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Vni ternoque Domino sit sempiterna gloria \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Deo grates semper\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b
