\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (1ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De laude psalmorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  [Alcuinus]:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Quia eciam prophetie spiritus non semper prophetarum mentibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...  \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 per Dei graciam perueneris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  (1va) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dicta sancti Augustini de virtute psalmorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Canticum psalmorum animas decorat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 animam suam in celo mirificabit.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  (1va-1vb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dicta sancti Jeronimi quanta sublimitas psalmorum sit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Qvid in psalmis non inuenitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 in qua sancti exultent cum Christo Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\u252 \'fcller, PB, Nr. 417, 369, 394, vgl. Melk, Benediktinerstift, Cod. 979 (784, O 20), 247r-248v. Druck (Alcuinus): Jonathan Black: "Psalm Uses in Carolingian Prayerbooks: Alcuin and the  Preface to De Psalmorum Usu", in: Mediaeval Studies 64 (2002),  S. 1-60 (Hs. nicht genannt), vgl. Clm 18121 aus Tegernsee.}

