\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (1vb) Nachtr\u228 \'e4glich hinzugef\u252 \'fcgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Expositio libri psalmorum regij prophete per reuerendum et religiosum patrem Petrum de Harentalis priorem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Florefiensem premonstratensis ordinis ex diuersis sanctorum codicibus industriose collecta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit prologus eiusdem in librum psalmorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .  \endash   (2ra-4va) Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Patri reuerendoque meo carissimo domino Iohanni de Nikel \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (!) ...   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Pater carissime, cum rem quamlibet  honestatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 prolixioris operis expetit tractatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .  \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sequitur psalmus primus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b  \endash  (4vb) Text:  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Beatus vir \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Ps 1,1)\u8249 \'8b  \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Jeronimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Psalterium est quasi magna domus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash   ... (193va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 humiliter obedire ad laudem et gloriam tuam qui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  193vb-194b leer.
