\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ir  1) Besitzvermerk u. Inhaltsverzeichnis mit nachgetragenen Folioangaben. 2) Notiz: Antwort des Johannes Schlitpacher auf die Additiones von Paulus Burgensis:  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Pater Iohannes Slitpacher de Mellico ad interrogacionem sibi factam an magister Paulus Burgensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 respondit: Puto quod\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash   Iv leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 1ra-42rb  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Nicolaus de Lyra}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 :  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Postilla litteralis in Vetus Testamentum}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1(1ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit postilla super librum Josue, capitulum I\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 m\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Introduces eos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \u8249 \'8b(Ex 15,17) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Secundum hebreos a libro \u8250 \'9bJosue\u8249 \'8b incipiunt libri prophetales\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (19vb) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et non est in hebreo nec in libris correctis etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit postilla Nicolay de Lyra super libro Josue vigilia sancti Thome apostoli, anno Domini etc. 55\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [1455 Dez 21]  \endash   2(19vb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit liber Judicum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Suscitauit Dominus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \u8249 \'8b  (Jdc 2,16) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sicut in libro Iosue, a quo hystoriales libri incipiunt, agitur de tempore promissionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 quia non ceperunt eas de uoluntate vestra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  3(39rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit Ruth\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In diebus unius iudicis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b  (Rt 1,1)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . Hic ponitur tercius casus scilicet ipsius Ruth\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85  \endash   (42rb) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sicut dictum est supra secundo capitulo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et sic est finis huius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b  \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Frater Johannes et frater Leonardus 1456. Anno 1456 sabbato ante Invoca\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [u]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 it\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b [1456 Febr 14] \endash  42v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Glorieux, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ma\u238 \'eetres 2, S. 217 NR. 345 F. 7, 8, 9; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  RB IV, S. 54, 5834, 5835, 5836.  Druck: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hain\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  10397-99. 2 VL 6 Sp. 1117-1122.}

