\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 43ra-214ra  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Paulus Burgensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Additiones ad Postillam Nicolai de Lyra}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (43ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Additiones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (Schwerzenbeck? erg\u228 \'e4nzt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Pauli Burgensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 super Postillam psalterij in prologo ubi dicitur in Postilla\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 tamen apud latinos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash   \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Additio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Oppositum videtur sentire beatus Ieronimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (107v) leer. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (108ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipiunt Addiciones super Postilla magistri Nicolai de Lira in librum Ysaie in capitulo primo ubi dicitur in Postilla\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Queritur hic quare fecit mencionem in hac prefaticione \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 de regibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (135rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hieremie in Capitulo primo vbi dicitur in Postilla\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Et filij Elchie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash   \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Additio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quod sit regula aput hebreos quod quando\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash   \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 39\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (209rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Secunda canonica Johannis in primo capitulo ubi dicitur in Postilla\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Senior et hac racione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash   \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Additio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Beatus Iohannes tante humilitatis fuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash   \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 40\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (209rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Liber Apockalipsis beati Johannis in primo capitulo ubi dicitur in Postilla\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Et fecit nos regnum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 (Apc 1,6) \endash    \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Additio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (209va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Racio autem quare populus Dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85  \endash  \u8230 \'85 (214ra) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 nunc per gratiam et in futuro per gloriam Amen etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Et sic est finis hujus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Deo gratias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  214rb-215v leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Text unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig. Druck: GW 04286-04294; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , RB, Nr. 6329. Horacio Santiago-Otero u. Klaus Reinhardt, Biblioteca b\u237 \'edblica ib\u233 \'e9rica medieval, Madrid 1986 (Hs. genannt S. 242); H. Santiago Otero, Pablo de Santa Mar\u237 \'eda (o de Burgos). Manuscritos de sus obras en la Staatsbibliothek de Munich: Revista Espa\u241 \'f1ola de Teolog\u237 \'eda 30 (1970) 81-92 (Hs. genannt S 86. Nr. 6.)}

