\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 1ra Brief Papst Leos IX: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Ego\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (eher Leo) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 episcopus servuvs seruorvm\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Dei dilecto in Christo filio Dei P[etro] heremite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Ad splendidum nitentis pudicicie thorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  1va \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Incipit liber Gomorianus Petri Damiani humilis monachi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Prolog an Leo IX\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Beatissimo pape L[eoni] P[etrus] vltimvs\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  monachorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \endash  Quoniam apostolica sedes \u8230 \'85 \endash   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 1vb Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 De diuersitate sodomitarum. Capitulum secundum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Ut autem res vobis tota per ordinem pateat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 (12vb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 et iacentis ecclesie status vndique ad sui vigoris iura resurgat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . 
