g1033\fs22\cf1 ?... \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Qui sub estiuo meridiatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 62\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (264rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Epistola Petri Damiani ad Alexandrum papam de eo quod canonicis a quibus in monasteriis regulariter viuitur proprietatis habende licencia denegatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 .\u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Domino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 A[lexandro] beatissimo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  pape, Petrus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85 (264va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Quantum ad nostre intelligencie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash   \u8230 \'85 (270rb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 apostolatus vestri uigor impellat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Iste liber attinet monasterio Tegernsee quem reuerendus in Christo pater et dominus Conradus abbas ibidem comparauit et est finis in vigilia Affre mart[y]ris anno millesimo quadringintesimo septuagesimo primo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 .\u8249 \'8b [1471 Aug 6] \endash  270v-275v, I\rquote rv leer.
