singullatim quaslibet in hoc opere contentas materias\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash  (294ra-301va) Inhaltsverzeichnis.  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash   (301va) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 1484\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Iste liber attinet monasterio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sancti Quirini \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [\u252 \'fcber Rasur]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in Tegernsee\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quem reuerendus in Christo pater et dominus Conradus abbas ibidem comparauit anno millesimo cccc lxxxiiii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \endash  301vb-I\lquote v leer. 
