\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dixit quidam. Dulcia non meruit qui gustat amara\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (Thesaurus proverbiorum medii aevi, S\u252 \'fcss 34-36; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , Proverbia, Nr. 6357. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Vgl. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cgm 809, 29b Cgm 817,36)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Wiltu nichts me\u255 \'ffden \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 (Vgl. Cgm 809,51d Cgm 817,49) \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9bDiuo Quirino\u8249 \'8b Quid claros inter patribus Romane Quirinus \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Vgl. Cgm 809,1b Cgm 817,75 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9bDiue Virgini\u8249 \'8b Parce precor misero\u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Vgl. Cgm 809,1c  Cgm 817,75  \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Diue Virgini\u8249 \'8b Sola potens placare\u8230 \'85 (vgl. Cgm 809,29d \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Cgm 817,70\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Leid dich da du pist \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (Vgl. Cgm 809,29k) \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Streyt als am ritter\u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Der sel und des leibs s\u228 \'e4ligka\u255 \'fft \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Curia romana non petit ovem \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , Proverbia, Nr. 4765, Vgl. Cgm 809,29f  Cgm 817,70 ) \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Rex sedet in cena \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , Proverbia, Nr. 26863, Vgl. Cgm 809,33c Cgm 817,36 ) \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Crescit amor nummi quantum pecunia crescit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (Datiert 1510. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , Carmina, Nr. 3731).}

