\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipiunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [corr. in \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur prologus in additiones.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 additiones ad postillam magistri Nicolai de Lira super biblia edite a reuerendo patre domino Paulo de Santa Maria magistro in theologia episcopo Burgensi\u8230 \'85 finiuit autem eas anno Domini millesimo quadringentesimo xxix\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [1429]\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Qvid tibi vis ut donem dilectissime fili \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 fides mea et sic terra esset percucienda anathemate etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Deo gratias. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash  219r-220v leer.
