\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa30\cbpat8\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Iesus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Prohemium in exposicionem super Regula sancti Benedicti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  Am unteren Rand. \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Exposicio regule sancti Benedicti compilata par fratrem Iohannem de Weilham monachum monasterii Mellicensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (2ra) Prolog. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Patrem multarum gencium \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Ex 17,4) \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hec verba iuxta historiam litterae de sancto patriarcha Abraham \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (2rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Alius prologus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ociositas inimica est anime, ait capitulo 48 beatus pater Benedictus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (2vb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit prologus regule sancti patris nostri Benedicti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .\u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Osculta o fili \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (2va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hic incipit regula beati Benedicti abbatis que in prima sui diuisione diuiditur in duas partes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... (271rb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Unus simplex eternus deus per infinita secula benedictus Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit glossa super regula sancti Benedicti abbatis scripta per fratrem Johannem Hachelstat de Ratispona professum monasterii sancti Michahelis in M\u228 \'e4unsee \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 etc.
