\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dionisij Areopagitae Atheniensis episcopi de celesti ierarchia ad Thimotheum episcopum Ephesi liber incipit feliciter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  Kapitelverzeichnis. \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Expliciunt capitula. Incipit liber. Quod omnis divina \u8230 \'85 vnum efficit. Capitulum I\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Omne datum optimum et omne datum perfectum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 archana celestia silencio honoranda putauimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dionisij Areopagite Atheniensis episcopi ad Timotheum Ephesie ciuitatis episcopum de celesti ierarchia liber explicit feliciter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b
