\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Eiusdem ad Timotheum Ephesi episcopum de mistica theologia liber incipit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  Kapitelverzeichnis. \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Comprespitero Timotheo Dionisius presbiter. Que nam sit diuina caligo. Capitulum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Trinitas supersubstantialis deitate ac bonitate superior \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 qui simpliciter absolutus ab omnibus et vltra omnia est. Deo gratias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dyonisij Areopagite de mistica theologia liber explicit feliciter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ambrosius ille generalis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 fuit ordinis Camaldunensium florentinus qui anno 1440 decessit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Absolui Ambrosius peccator Dionisij opuscula in monasterio Fontis Boni xv kalendas Aprilis anno Dominice Incarnationis millesimo quadringentesimo tricesimo sexto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 indictione xv, emendaui et cum greco contuli in heremo III idus aprilis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1436 April 11]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . Laus deo sit semper Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b 
