\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Reuerendi patris Casparis Sasgeri minorite conuentus monacensis guardiani quondam per superiorem Germaniam ministri prouincialis directio salubris pro omnibus monasticis personis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Monasticus super omnia instituta scopum principalem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quod ipse misericordia et pietate sua nobis concedere dignetur amen. 1526 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  52v-53v leer.
