\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 165va-188vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Nicolaus Kempf}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 De discretione}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Optimus tractatus cuidam doctissimi Cartusiensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (nachtr\u228 \'e4glich erg\u228 \'e4nzt:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Nicolai Kempff nuncupati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 de religiosorum profectibus et perfectione diligenter legendus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quod sola discrecio religiosis summa necessaria perducit sine errore ad perfeccionem et finem bonum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Capitulum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Bonum est sal\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . (Lc 14,34) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sal discrecionem significat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 de qua tamen posterius latius dicetur. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash   \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit per me fratrem Oswaldum Nott monachum in Tegernsee\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  Notiz: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Primas duas partes huius tractatus quere in libello de reformatione status cenobiticj magistri Johannis Nyder. Omnes vero partes tres huius tractatus habentur in meliori littera in codice H45\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: Bernhard Pez, Bibliotheca ascetica antiquo-nova, Bd. IX, Regensburg 1726, S. 379\endash 532. \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 VL Bd. 4, Sp. 1117-1124, Nr. 6 (Hs. genannt). Literatur: Dennis D. Martin, Fifteenth-century Carthusian reform: the world of Nicholas Kempf, Leiden 1992 (Hs. genannt, S. 280-281, 283-284).}

