\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (4ra) Prol.: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Iordanis ripas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Jos 3,15)\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Josue 3\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . Sic dicit beatus Augustinus de consensu ewangelistarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash   6vb leer.  \endash   \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (7ra) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit prima pars principalis huius operis videlicet pars hyemalis sermonum Jordani, et finitur prima pars ibi: Nupcie facte sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominica I aduentus. Sermo misticus seu allegoricus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Erunt signa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Luc 21,25) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Verba ista licet ad litteram dicta sint de secundo aduentu \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (9ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Allegoricus de sole ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Erunt signa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Luc 21,25) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Viso supra de personarum ad incarnationis preconium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash   \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (10vb)  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Mystice sermo tercius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Erunt signa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Luc 21,25) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Viso de signis que apparuerunt in sole\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 107\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (229va)  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Mystice sermo secundus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cum inducerent puerum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Luc. 2,27)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Expositis hiis verbis supra de templo virginali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 108\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (230vb)  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tropoloyce sermo tertius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cum inducerent puerum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Luc. 2,27) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nunc tercio superest secundum divisionem sermonis 106 verba ista exponere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... (232rb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 in pace quietis eterne. Ad quam nos perducere dignetur qui viuit. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: Hain, RB, Nr. *9438.  \endash   Schneyer, RLS 3, S. 803-808 (Aufteilung und Abfolge der Predigten abweichend). Zumkeller, Manuskripte, Nr. 648 (Hs. genannt).}

