\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 1ra-98va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Johannes Herolt}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Sermones discipuli de sanctis}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipiunt sermones discipuli de sanctis per circulum anni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (1ra)\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Laudate dominuim\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (Ps 150,1) Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Rogatus sum ut post collecturam sermonum discipuli de tempore \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (1rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo primus discipuli de sanctis et communis de quolibet sancto applicabilis ut patet?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Unde in promptuario sermonum discipuli de sanctis primo intendo communem sermonem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (3ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo primus de sancto Andrea apostolo\u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9bUenite post me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...\u8249 \'8b (Mt 4,19;  Mc 1,17) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Verba hec originaliter scribuntur Mathei primo et Luce secundo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85  \endash  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (4va) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo secundus de sancto Andrea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b  \endash  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9bRelictis rethibus ...\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (Mt 4,20) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ex hijs verbis ostenditur quod conversio sancti Andree\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85  \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 47\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (91vb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de sancta Elizabeth\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b (92ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ora pro nobis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\u8249 \'8b  (Jdt 8, 29) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Verba ista dicta sunt a filiis Israel cum essent in magnis tribulacionibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 48 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (94rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de sancta Katherina uirgine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9bAdamavit eam rex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\u8249 \'8b (Est 2,7) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ista verba que leguntur de Hester regina\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...   \endash \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (98va) \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 beate Katherine omnibus diebus vite sue et post hanc vitam migrauerunt ad vitam eternam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Expliciunt\plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sermones discipuli de sanctis feria secunda post Tyburcij\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs16\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Anno domini 69 etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . [1469 Apr 19] \endash  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 98vb leer.
