\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 135va-221vb  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Thomas Ebendorfer de Haselbach}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et al.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Sermones de festivitatibus Beatae Mariae Virginis}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (135va) Nachgetragene \u220 \'dcberschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de anunciacione sancte Marie fratris Francisci de ordine predicatotum et in theologia doctoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash   \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Aue Maria. Luce primo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (Lc 1,28). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nondum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  pro introductione que mater sancta ecclesia hodie colit et celebrat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85  \endash   \u8230 \'85 (139rb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Igitur ad eam eamus et eam cum Deo plenam gra[t]ia inueniemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen. Laus deo. 1468\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (139ba) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo primus de natiuitate Marie magistri Thome de Haselbach doctoris theologie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In me gracia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 (Sir 24,25) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hec verba sapiens loquitur de sapiencia incarnata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (144va) Nachgetragene \u220 \'dcberschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo secundus eiusdem vnde supra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Liber generacionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...\u8249 \'8b (Mt 1,1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hodie nobis illuxit, diletissimi, iocunda festiuitas et omni suauitate plena\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (159va) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de festo purificacionis beate Marie Virginis magistri Petri Pirewart professoris sacre theologie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Lumen ad revelacionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 (Lc 2, 32) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Et in presentis festiuitatis ewangelio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash   \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 17\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (208ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de Assumpcione beatissime virginis Marie magistri Thome de Haselpach\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Maria optimam partem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85  (Lc 10,42) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sicut mater Ecclesia in exultacione et gaudio consueuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 18\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (214vb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo magistri Thome de Haselbach de Assumptione beate Marie Virginis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Intravit Ihesus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Lc 10,38) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Et in hodierma festiuitate in ewangelio per totum annum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  \u8230 \'85 (221vb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 semper nobis esto semper aput filium tuum Dominum et saluatorum nostrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u220 \'dcber Thomas Ebendorfer de Haselbach siehe\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 VL 2, Sp. 253-266; zu Predigt 6: Petrus Pirwart, wohl Petrus Reicher de Pirchenwart, Sch\u252 \'fcler und Freund von Nikolaus von Dinkelsb\u252 \'fchl, vgl. \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 VL 11, Sp. 1293. }

