\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (302ra)\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de omnibus  sanctis anno 1487\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Beati qui habitant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Ps 83,5) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quia sanctorum omnium festiua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [m] ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (308va) \u220 \'dcberschrift, tw. von Hand Schwerzenbecks (am Rand) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Scriptum notabile sancti Augustini de eo quis vere dicitur beatus ex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Pantheologia \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9bOmnes cupimus cum omnibus sanctis esse beati ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Beatus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Augustinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 cum causa infirmitatis esset in aquis balneis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (309va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Alius sermo de sancto Castorio et sociis eius. Sancti per fidem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Hebr 11,30)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  In verbis thematis commendantur beati martyres\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (310ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de sanctis martyribus Castorio et socijs eius, factus anno Domni 148\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 7\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Beati qui persecucionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Mt 5,10) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Et in hodierno euangelio, pro quo sciendum, quod multa sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 10\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (330ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de Assumpcione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Intrauit Ihesus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Lc 10,38) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Secundum ordinem littere duas constat fuisse sorores\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash    \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 11\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (331ra) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de sanctis martyribus Castorio et socijs eius\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Beati qui persecucionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Mt 5,10) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Et in hodierno euangelio. Notandum quod in presenti themate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...\endash ... (331rb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Alia est tristitia seculi etc. Requirantur reliquo in tractatu magistri Nicolai de Dincklspuchl de 8\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  beatitidinibus in 8\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ua\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  beatitudine folio 171\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  per 7\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 tem\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  folia usque ad sermonem de oratione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . 
