\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (2ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermones magistri Pauli Wann de Khemn\u228 \'e4ten de sanctis per circulum anni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1  1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De sancto Andrea sermo primus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9bRabi, ubi habitas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Joh 1,38-39) \u8249 \'8b  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ista verba\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ad litteram intelliguntur de beato Andrea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (5rb)  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De sancto Andrea sermo 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 us\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cristo crucifixus sum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (Gal 2,19)\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quamuis apostolus de seipso verba thematis dixerit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (6vb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De sancta Barbara virgine et martire\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b  \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Uigilate quia nescitis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Mt 24,42)\u8249 \'8b  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In hijs\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 verbis themate Saluator noster omnes homines auisat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 44\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (225rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In festo sancti Martini confessoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nudus eram \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Mt 25,35)\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominus noster Ihesus Christus rex regum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash   \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 45\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (230va) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De sancta Katherina\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ueni, sponsa mea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Ct 4,8) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Verba ista ad litteram dicta sunt de beata Virgine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... (235vb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et sibi associatos conformet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Finis sermonum de sanctis magistri Pauli Wann sacre theologie professoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1474.
