\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (1ra) Widmung: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Illustrissimi principis regis francorum deuotissimo confessori domino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Michaeli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b ... \endash  (1ra) Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sacri eloquii dogmata nuper cum cernerem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  Text: (1vb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In principio creavit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  .. (Gn 1,1)\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Pretermissis prologorum exposicionibus sciendum quod liber primus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... (207rb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 tam literali quam mistica libri Genesis Dei munere completa cui laus et gloria \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Iste liber attinet monasterio Tegernsee quem reuerendus in Christo pater et dominus Conradus abbas ibidem comparauit anno m\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 cccc\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 septuagesimo septimo. Et est finitus ante Georij martyris festum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [Apr. 23] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 anno ut supra. Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (207va-217vb) Alphabetisches Register (Tabula) ... (217vb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Finis adest huius tabule\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Orate pro scriptore. Anno 1477\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b
