\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 1ra-127va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Hilarius Pictaviensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 De Trinitate}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (1ra-1va) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Prologus sancti Hilarij agit de laude et commendacione ipsius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  Prolog (Ex epistolis sancti Hieronymi excerpta): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quantus inter ecclesiasticos scriptores catholicos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (1va) Venantius Fortunatus, Versus de sancto Hilario: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Si Hylarium queris quis sit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (1vb-2vb) Ps. Hilarius Pictaviensis, Epistola ad Abram filiam\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : Dilectissime filie Affre Hylarius in Domino salutem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (2vb) Ps. Hilarius Pictaviensis, Hymnus spurius I: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ymnus matutinus Affre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Lucis largitor optime\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (AH 51, Nr. 6) \endash  (2vb-3ra) Ps. Hilarius Pictaviensis, De spiritali prato: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quid per pratum bonum curatum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...  \endash  (3ra) Ps. Hilarius Pictaviensis, De balteo castitatis: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Prima margarita est paciencia stabilis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  (3ra-127va) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit liber sancti Hilarij episcopi Pictauiensis de sancta Trinitate et duiditur in xii libros\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...\u8249 \'8b \endash  (3rb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Circumspecti michi proprium vite humane ac religiosum officium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... (127va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 manens in te et ex te et aput te semper Deus qui est benedictus ... Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1466\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Iste liber attinet monasterio Tergernsee quem reuerendus in Christo pater et domnus Conradus abbas ibidem comparauit anno m\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  quadringintesimo sexagesimo sexto Aue Maria dicatis mente benigna pro scriptore presencium laudabili ore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  127b-128v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ed.: Versus de sancto Hilario: PL 88, 109\endash 110 und PL 88, 369\endash 370; Epistola ad Abram filiam: CSEL 65, S. 237-244; De spiritali prato: Alfred Feder: Studien zu Hilarius von Poitiers III, Wien 1912, S. 100-101; De balteo castitatis: Alfred Feder: Studien zu Hilarius von Poitiers III, S. 101; De Trinitate: CCSL 62-62A, 1-627. \endash  Vgl. Melk, Benediktinerstift, Cod. 162 (156, C 34).}

