\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 (1ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In hoc libro vnum ewangelium ex quatuor seu concordia ewangelistarum continetur et desuper exposicio continua exactissima diligencia edita a Zacharia Crisopolitano\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De excellencia ewangelij et differencia ipsius \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (14r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit prefacio vna ex quatuor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (hinzugef\u252 \'fcgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 prefacionibus sancti Ieronymi super ewangelia excerpta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) ... \endash  (15ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit prefacio Zacharie Crisopolitani in vnum ex quatuor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Unum ex quatuor ewangelistarum dictis ewangelium claro studio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (15vb-18rb) Kapitelverzeichnis \endash  (18rb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Notum facimus lectori\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (19rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit liber primus explanacionis Zacharie Crisopolitani in vnum euangelium ex quatuor compilatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In principio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... (368ra) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 parvum tempus ascensionis etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Finis 72\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  386rb-368v leer. 
