\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 1ra-89va  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Ps.-Johannes Chrysostomus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Sermones in Job de patientia}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (1ra-9vb) Tabula: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sequuntur alique auctoritates extracte ex sermonibus sancti Johannis Crisostomi sequentibus ex primo sermone\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Job gesta officij plena omnem humanam sapientiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (9vb-10rb) Widmung des \u220 \'dcbersetzers an Papst Nicolaus V.: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sanctissimo et clementissimo domino Nicolao diuina providencia pape quinto sancte romane ac vniuersalis ecclesie summo pontifici Lilij Tifernatis vltimi suorum seruorum prologus in sermones sancti Johannis Crisostomi ut clare pateat debite intuenti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Consueuerunt, pater beatissime, qui sub ceteris predecessoribus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  Text: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (10rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sancti Johannis Crisostomi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (10va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 de penitencia sermo primus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b (hinzugef\u252 \'fcgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In iustum et beatum Job pacientemque\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Annus ad nos hodierna die\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (13va) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Eiusdem sancti Johannis Crisostomi de paciencia in Job sermo secundus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Magnum rerum pondus magnarum narracionum dignitatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (16ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Eiusdem in beatum Job de paciencia sermo tercius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (16rb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Jam et nos promissionem nosque auditum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 15\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (81ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Eiusdem sancti Johannis Crisostomi de paciencia sermo quindecimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ergo nouistis vnde nobis hesternus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 16\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (85ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Eiusdem sancti Johannis Crisostomi de paciencia sermo sedecimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Eya num recordacio nostri vos vlla tenuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... (89va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cuius omnes nos participes fieri contingat gracia et clemencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Domini nostri \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Expliciunt sermones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (hinzugef\u252 \'fcgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 aliquot\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 de\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 penitencia in Job ac\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (hinzugef\u252 \'fcgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 aliquot\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vero de penitencia conscripti per beatum Johannem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Crisostomum ac traducti de greco in latinum per spectabilem et eloquentem virum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Lilium Tifernatis. Corrigatur ob laudem Dei quia exemplar nullius correcture fuit uti patet perlegenti. Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Orate pro scriptore propter Deum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  89vb-95v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u220 \'dcbersetzung des Laelius Tifernas. Drucke (lat.): Hain 5024-5027 (Hain 5024 anweichend). S. auch Stegm\u252 \'fcller, RB, Nr. 4332 und Nr. 4317 (Tabula).}

