\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\cbpat8\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 37r-50v  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Johannes Keck}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  : \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tractatus de sacro Basiliensis concilio
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa30\cbpat8\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (37r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Prologus fratris Johannis Keck in Tractatum eiusdem de sacro Basiliensi concilio si in facto deposicionis olim Eugenii potuit errare\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Widmung:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Reuerendissimo in Christo patri et domino, domino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Johanni tituli sancti Martini in montibus, sancte romane Ecclesie cardinali presbitero de Bauaria \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  37v leer \endash  (38r) Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tractatus fratris Johannis Keck de Tegernsee in theologia magistri de sacro Basiliensi concilio si in facto depositionis olim Eugenii potuit errare. Feliciter incipit. Prohemium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .\u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Pre ebrietate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Is 28,7) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 inquit eximius Ysaias ille \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (38r) Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9bSi concilium Basilee fuit legitime congregatrum. Capitulum primum\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sacrum Basiliensem concilium legitimum habuisse inicium \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (49v) ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  finem vite que ex parte est euacuata et illo quod perfectum est adueniente. Sue me beatitudinis participem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 etc. \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Deo laus. Per me fratrem Johannem Keck. Explicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .\u8249 \'8b \endash  (50r-50v) Alphabetisches Sachregister.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa30\cbpat8\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \~
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Autograph. Verfasst auf Dr\u228 \'e4ngen des Abtes Kaspar Andorfer; gewidmet dem Kardinal Johannes Gr\u252 \'fcnwald (von Bayern). Lit.:\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20  2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 VL4, a.a.O., Sp. 1093, Nr. 6. \endash  Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Clm. 3076, Clm 18519b; Clm 1157; Melk, Stiftsbibl. cod. 751,1; Wien, \u214 \'d6NB, Cod. 3473, Cod. 4957, Cod. 5253.}

