\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa30\cbpat8\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (64r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Prefatio in introductorium musice fratris Iohannis Keck magistri in Theologia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .\u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Exultabunt labia ..\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . (Ps 118,171) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Inquit egregius ille musicus regiu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 s ... \endash  (64v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit Prologus. Incipit argumentum\u8249 \'8b Introductorius in musicam liber appellatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (64v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit argumentum. Sequitur capitula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b Kapitelverzeichnis. \endash  (64v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Expliciunt capitula. Incipit liber introductorius in musicam fratris Iohannis Keck monachi in Tegernsee et in theologia magistri. De musice inuentione. Capitulum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .\u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Mvsicam triplicem esse ferunt sapientes \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (68r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 elicere valebis si diligentiam adhibere minime pigriteris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Fratris Johannis Keck in musicam introductorius liber explicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .\u8249 \'8b \endash  (68v-69v) Musiktheoretische Tabellen. \endash  70r-71v leer. 
