\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\cbpat8\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2r Notiz zur Summa virtutum: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Commendat admodum hanc Summam de vicijs et virtutibus cristianissimus ille sacre theologie doctor Johannes Gerson\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  2v leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\cbpat8\itap0 3ra-323vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Guilelmus Peraldus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (GND 118719351 http://d-nb.info/gnd/118719351): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Summa de virtutibus}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\cbpat8\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3ra Kapitelverzeichnis: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipiunt distinctiones capitulorum in Summam virtutum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Presens opus habet quinque partes principales\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (6rb) Prologus: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit prologus in summam virtutum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cum circa singula utilia studere debeamus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (6vb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Et quinto de beatitudinibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit prologus in summam virtutum anno 1466\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Jhesu saluator adiuua me. Maria Virgo ora pro me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In die Gregorii pape sancti. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1466 M\u228 \'e4rz 12] \endash  (7ra) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit summa virtutum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 fratris Guilhelmi episcopi de ordine predicatorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : erg\u228 \'e4nzt Schwerzenbeck) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et pars prima operis de virtute in communi. Quod oporteat virtutem commendari. Capitulum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .\u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Si separaueris ... (Jr 15,19) Preciosa est anima. Prov. vi\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : Mulier animam viri preciosam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1   ... \endash  ... (315vb)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 obligauerunt parentes nostri celestem herreditatem. Ad quam nos perducere dignetur \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1   Amen. \u8250 \'9bDeo gratias\u8249 \'8b \endash  316r-317v leer. \endash  (318ra) Alphabetisches Sachregister : \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit tabula in Summam virtutum secundum ordinem alphabetum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Abrenunciatio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (323vb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Zizania\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... . Kolophon? Datierung? radiert. 
