\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (1ra) Sermones de tempore. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ecce rex tuus venit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Za 9,2, Mt 21,5) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Eggregius doctor noster sanctus Thomas de Acquino dicit quod nulla accio sit perfecta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (3rb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hora iam est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Rom 13,11) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Boecius de consolacione philosophie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Vnicuique viro bono\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (5ra) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Erunt signa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  (Luc 21,25) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Aristoteles 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Thopi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [corum]: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Inest dei iustitiam facere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  117v leer \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 72\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (163rb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Spirituts meus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Sir 24,27) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ex quo Spiritus Sanctus est fons tocius dulcedinis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... (164vb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sentire illam dulcedinem tunc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  // Text bricht ab. \endash  (165ra-172ra) Alphabetisches Themenregister (A-P).  \endash   172rb-172dv leer.  \endash  (173ra) Sermones de sanctis. \u220 \'dcberschrift:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  De apostolis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1  1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Posui vo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 s ... (Jo 15,16)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Quantum ad 2am partem precedentis sermonis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash   \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (183ra) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Estote parati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Lc 12,40) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In verbis premissis monemur ad penitentiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 mansiones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  etc.\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  De hoc quere ante sermone 205\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  (185ra) Sermones de tempore. \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Postquam locutus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Mc 16,19) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sciendum quod ab origine mundi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash    \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1  5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (191va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Spiritus meus dulcis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Sir 24,27) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ex quo Spiritus Sanctus est fons tocius dulcedinis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1  6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (193va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Repleti sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Act 2,4) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ex quo iam illis diebus peragitur missio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... (195vb)\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 si carnali delectacione cor maculas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash   I\lquote rv, 195a-rv leer.
