\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (2ra-b) Prothema: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Postquam impleti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Lc 2,23) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et in ewangelio hodierno ac pro introduccione nostri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 preiacentis materie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 premissa videlicet qualiter ex presenti solempnitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (2rb-6ra) Sermo: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Postquam impleti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Lc 2,23) (2va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 quia in presentiarum habeo ad honorem Virginis gloriose\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (6ra-b) Prothema: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Simile est regnum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Mt 20,1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et in ewangelio hodierno ipsius introduccione ac nostre preiacentis materie prosecucione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (6rb-10ra) Sermo: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Simile est regnum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Mt 20,1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Karissimi, quia in presenti sermone vestram caritatem informare habeo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (10ra-10va) Prothema: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Domine, nonne bonum semen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Mt 13,27) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et in ewangelio hodierno pro ipsius introduccione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (10va-13va) Sermo: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Domine, nonne bonum semen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Mt 13,27) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ut secundum conformitatem ewangelij cum nostra preiacente materia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 169\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (324vb-328va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Impleti sunt dies\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Marie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Lc 2,6) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et in ewangelio concurrentis solempnitatis dominice natiuitatis tam festi quam precepti ... quomodo 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  impleti sunt dies ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 170\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (328vb-331vb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Impleti sunt dies\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Marie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Lc 2,6) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et in ewangelio concurrentis solempnitatis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 quomodo 3\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  impleti sunt dies ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash   ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 mendacium in hoc mandato prohibitum etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  332r-333r leer.
