\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (1ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Summa Heinrici de Gorichem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Questio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ad laudem et gloriam benedicte trinitatis glorioseque semper virginis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Utrum preter philosophicas disciplinas sit alia doctrina\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \u8249 \'8b \endash  ... (282va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cujus consortes per suam pijssimam matrem nos facere dignetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen etc. Laus Deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .  \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Deo gratias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Finitus est iste liber in die sancti Vdalrici episcopi quasi hora duodecima diei anno lij etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . [1452 Juli 4] \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sit laus Deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (282va-283vb) Nachtrag: fr\u252 \'fchneuzeitliches Verzeichnis der Quaestiones mit Folioangaben. \endash  284r-286v leer.
