\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (1ra) \u220 \'dcberschrift: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Liber primus sententiarum. Assit in principio sancta Maria meo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b  Prologus: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cupientes aliquid de penuria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...  \endash  (1va) Kapitelverzeichnis Liber primus. \endash  (4va) Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Veteris ac noue legis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ...  \endash  (76vb) Kapitelverzeichnis Liber secundus. \endash  (79va) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Unum esse rerum principium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Creationem rerum insinuans\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  (140va) Kapitelverzeichnis Liber tertius. \endash  (142rb) Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cvm venerit igitur plenitud\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 o ... \endash  (190ra) Kapitelverzeichnis Liber quartus. \endash  (192vb) Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Samaritanus enim v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [o]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 lnerato\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...  \endash  ... (264vb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ad pedes usque via duce pervenit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash   \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit quartus liber sententiarum 1431\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (265ra) Notiz (von Hand Kecks?): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hec de pedibus. Magister epilogando imponens finem operi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  265v-268r leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: Petrus Lombardus, Sententiae in IV libris distinctae, Hrsg. von Ignatius Brady, Grottaferrata (Romae), 1971-1981.}

