\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 1r-498r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Nicolaus de Dinkelspuhel}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 :\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Quaestiones in tertium et quartum librum Sententiarum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 (1r) \u220 \'dcberschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Questiones communes in tercij sententiarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  Quaestiones in III Sententiarum: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Utrum propter humanum genus redimendum decuerit incarnari solum Dei filium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (212vb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Scripta est hec pars huius libri per me Stephanum Pauli monacensem in Fawchten\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [Feichten]\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 anno Domini m\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  etc. xxviij sabbato quatuor temporum quando cantatur in ecclesia Dei veni et ostende\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  nobis etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . [1428 Dez 18] \endash  Nachtr\u228 \'e4glich von einer anderen Hand: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Paulus magunus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (vielmehr: magnus) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 doctor olei filius hodie fessus stetit in templo infulatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b (Vgl. Isidorus Hispalensis: Etymologiae II 26,11) \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Omnem patrem reor \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (vielmehr: rerum)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  invocandum quo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 pretermisso nullius rite fundatur exordium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b (Boethius, Consolatio Philosophiae, 3, Caput 9 P, 33) \endash  (214ra) Quaestiones in IV Sententiarum: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Utrum pro omni hominum statu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... (458va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 disiderant impleri de illo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  Unmittelbar anschlie\u223 \'dfend: Quaestiones (Nicolai?) septem in IV Sententiarum: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Utrum omnes homines tam boni quam mali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... (476ra) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vite habebunt amissionem et carenciam glorie Amen. Et sic est finis. Laudetur deus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 trinus et vnus etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Assunte sunt hee due partes presencium librorum magistri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ?\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Sententiarum in die sancti Thyburci et Valeriani rescripte per Stephanum Sellenawer monacensem tunc temporis scribentem in\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Fawchten\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [Feichten] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 venerabili viro magistro Petro de Hawsen. Laudate Christum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Anno Dmini m\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  cccc xxviiij\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [1429 Apr 14]\endash  (477r-489r) Ausz\u252 \'fcge aus der Lectura Mellicensus (de impedimentis matrimonii) mit Schemata und Tabellen (Arbores consanguinitatis bzw. affinitatis) 213rv, 476rb-476v, 489v-491v leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\u252 \'fcller, RS, 561; Madre, S. 76-78 (Nr. 1-44), 115 (Nr. 15). Vgl. M\u252 \'fcnchen, UB, 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Cod. ms. 88.}

