\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 VS Besitz- und Inhaltsvermerk von Hand Schwerzenbecks. \endash  Ir leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\cbpat8\itap0 Iv-193rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Augustinus Ayrmschmalz de Weilheim}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Lectura super tertium Sententiarum}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (Iv) Inhaltsbeschreibung: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In isto 3\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  libro Sententiarum agit magister de misterio nostre reparacionis..\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash   (1r) \u8250 \'9bText: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit liber tercius de Incarnacione verbi Dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cum venit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  igitur plenitudo temporis ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hic incipit liber tercius Sententiarum in quo postquam in precedentibus libris \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 magister\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  determinauit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...  \endash   ... (186r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 in hoc pascali gaudio et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  semper gratiarum actio ac honor ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash   \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Finiui hunc 3\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 m\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  librorum Sententiarum legendo ego Augustinus Ayrmsmalcz de Weilhaim anno Domini 1449\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  in crastino sancti Johannis Baptiste \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1449 Juni 25]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  qui erat 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 us\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  liber in ordine quo legi. Et precedenti nocte in die scilicet sancti Johannis Baptiste sero hora nona tetigit fulmen turrim sancti Stephani in Wienna alciorem et preciosiorem et exussit eam penitus. Et ego vidi et interfui in loco vsque ad exustionem eius. Quod terminabatur infra horas primam et 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 am\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  post medium noctis. Quidam autem vir volens in ecclesia infra turrim eandem laborare pro bono ecclesie fuit interfectus per vnam porcionem seu vnum frustum vnius campane confracte etc. Item in vigilia precedenti Johannis Baptiste feci ego 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 m\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  principium in Sententias specialiter in 3\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 m\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  librorum Sententiarum. Quare sit nomen Domini benedictum Amen. Item die sequenti scilicet in festo sanctorum martyrum Johannis et Pauli \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [Juni 26]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  incepi legere 4m librorum Sententiarum in cuius complementum felix deposco michi presto diuinum auxilium, et fiat fiat.  Et finiui autem ego prememoratum librum 44 lectionibus quem legere incepi in crastino sancte Gerdrudis virginis que erat 18\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  dies mensis marcij.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b   \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Laus Marie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b  \endash  (186va-188rb) Kapitelverzeichnis. \endash   (188va-190rb) Inhaltsbeschreibung des 3. Buches der Sentenzen: [L]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 iber tercius Sentenciarum est de Christi verbi Dei incarnacione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash   (190va-193rb) Alphabetisches Sachregister. \endash  193v-235v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Buch 3.\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Repertorium commentariorum in sententias Petri Lombardi, 1, Nr. 82 (Hs. genannt). Zum Autor: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Redlich\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Tegernsee, S. 30, Anm. 111. Augustinus Ayrmschmalz (\u8224 \'86 um 1489) war Baccalaureus an der Universit\u228 \'e4t zu Wien und las dort 1448-1449 die Sentenzen. Sein Bruder Konrad war von 1461-1492 Abt des  Klosters Tegernsee.}

