\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Johannes de Tambaco}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 De consolatione theologiae}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (1ra) Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Prologus \endash   Incipit prologus in librum de consolacione theologie fratris Johannis de Tambaco ordinis predicatorum prouincie Theutonie sacre theologie professoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quecumque scripta sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...\u8249 \'8b (Rom 15,4) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quoniam autem secundum hoc ipse apostolus nobis insinuat doctrinam scriptam ... \endash   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (3vb) Praefatio: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit prologus. Incipit cum quadam adhuc prefacione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Cum humanum genus post lapsum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (4va) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Capitulum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Primo itaque principaliter  quatuor tristibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...\endash ... (338rb)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  imperium cum omnipotencia honorque et gloria eius tam sublimis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .  \endash   (338va)  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit liber de consolacione theologie ... 1470\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (338va) Inhaltsverzeichnis: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hic ponuntur loco tabule libri parciales\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...\u8249 \'8b \endash  (345va) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit hec ordinacio loco tabule. Et nota quod liber iste ... editus et confirmatus anno Domini tricentesimo sexagesimo sexto in die beati Ambrosii episcopi etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [1366 Dez 7]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  1470\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b   \endash  (345vb) Erkl\u228 \'e4rung zum Register: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Uoluntas dei fuit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Gn 27,20) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hanc auctoritatem pro se potest assumere \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...   \endash   (346r) Stichwortregister: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Abdicacio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  (361v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ydeoma \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1470.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: Hain 15235-15238. Vgl. Kaeppeli, Nr. 2256; \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 VL 4, Sp. 575-576.}

