\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (13ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominica prima in aduentu Domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ecce rex tuus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Mt 21,5) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Adventus Saluatoris ab antiquo fuit prenuntiatus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 genesi vltimo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash   (14va) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominica secunda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Erunt signa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Lc 21, 25) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dicit enim apostolus: nos sumus quos fines seculi devenerunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (15vb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominica tercia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash   \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cum audisset Iohannes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Mt 11,2)\u8249 \'8b  (16ra) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dicit enim Salomon: propter peccatum terre multi principes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (97vb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominica xxiiij\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Loquente Ihesu ad turbas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (9,18) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Legitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1   \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Iohannnis 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 quod Cristus filium reguli infirmum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...   \endash   (99va) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominica vicesima quinta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Abiit Ihesus trans mare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Jo 6,1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quia penitentes et obseruantes quadragesimam affliguntur in ieiunio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... (101vb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vix stetissent in duodecim canistris. Et sic est finis hius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  Versus:  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dic michi quot caude celos tangunt ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Auxiulium meum a Domino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Anno 1431\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash   102r-109v leer.}

