\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 (110ra) Notiz von Hand Schwerzenbecks:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Quidam Thomas nomine Dornberg doctor egregius studij Tholesani de ordine predicatorum de Anglia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash   \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit prologus in summam theologice veritatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ueritatis theologice sublimitas cum superni splendoris radijs\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... (222va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 quisque beatus secundum merita recipiet sine fine. Amen. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Et finitum est presens compendium sub anno incarnacionis Domini millesimo quadringesimo vicesimo octauo, in vigilia beati Valentini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b [1428 Feb. 13?]  \endash  (223ra-225ra) Kapitelverzeichnis: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipiunt capitula operis precedentis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...\u8249 \'8b  \endash   222vb, 225rb-228v leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ed.: Alberti Magni opera XXXIV, Paris 1895, S. 1-270.  \endash  Lit.  Kaeppeli, Nr. 1982; Bloomfield, Incipits, Nr. 6399.}

