\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (2r) Kapitelverzeichnis: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tabula contentorum in libro de perseuerantia religionis edito per oratorem egregium Matheum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (korrigiert in: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Mapheum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Vegij Laudensem ad sorores eius Elizabeth et Monicam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (3r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Mathei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (korrigiert in: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Maphei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Uegij Laudensis de perseuerancia religionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 incipit feliciter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Ihesus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Prologus in librum de perseuerantia religionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cvm graues sepe ut fit in rebus humanis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (5r) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit liber primus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...\u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Gaudeo iure merito, carissime sorores \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... (105r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 conserendum pastinandumque ueniemus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 laus Deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 aug\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ?\u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 finis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1   \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Mathei Uegij Laudensis de perseuerancia religionis ad Elisabeth et \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [...] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Monicam sorores septem librorum. Anno lvij\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  105v-106v leer.
