\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 Vermerk von Hand Schwerzenbecks: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Excerptus est ex tractatu magistri Johannis de Gersona\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit tractatulus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (hinzugef\u252 \'fcgt:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Gersonis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 de bono modo viuendi secundum Deum ad omnes fere status hominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ordintatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (!)... \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ne potentes per potenciam suam subditos suos opprimant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 premia paradisi et tormenta inferni cogitent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .
