\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (2ra-2rb)\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Johannes Raithenus, Epistola ad Johannem Climacum: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit epistola abbatis Johannis ducis Raithy ad mirabilem Johannem abbatem cognominatum scalasticum nouissime vero conscriptione nominatum Climacum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Svpermirabili equali angelo patri \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  (2rb-2vb )\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Johannes Climacus, Epistola ad Johannem Raithenum: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Responsiua epistola Johannis scalastici dicti Climaci abbatis montis Synai ad Johannem Raithy abbatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Iohannes Iohanni gaudere. Suscepi ita conuenientem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash   (2vb-3ra) Inhaltsverzeichnis: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Gradus xxx\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 us\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  de fide, spe et caritate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (3ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Prologus sermonis cuius nominatio tabule spirituales\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hijs qui in libro vite in celis describi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  (3rb) Text:  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit sermo excitativus abbatis Johannis ducis monachorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dividitur capitulis 30\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  gradibus scale similibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  propter quid et liber scala vocatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b   \endash   \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De abrenunciacione terrenorum et uane vitae abdicacione et abnegacione uanitatis. Gradus primus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 A bono et superbono et toto Deo ac rege nostro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 fortitudo cui omnium bonorum causabilitas inest\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .  \endash    \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Finis tricesimi gradus celestis huius intellectualis scale Johannis scalastici abbatis montis Synai a libro cognominati Climaci. Climax grece latine dicitur scala. Hinc liber appellatur climacus id est scalaris.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: Dionysius Carthusianus, Opera omnia. Bd. 28. Tournai 1905, S. 13-497. Griechischer Text: PG 88, Sp. 632-1164.  Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung, u.a.: Melk, Benediktinerstift, Cod. 306 (84, B 51), 247ra-305ra.}

