\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (80ra) \u220 \'dcberschrift von Hand Schwerzenbecks: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Prologus hic infra in librum de sensibilibus delicijs paradisi magistri Johannis de Tambaco doctoris in theologia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit prohemium in librum de sensibilibus delicijs paradisi editum a fratre Johanne de Tambaco ordinis predicatorum prouincie theutonice, sacre theologie professore etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .\u8249 \'8b \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  In delicijs paradisi Dei fuisti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (Ez 28,13). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sicut Ezechielis xxviij scribitur. Sed si queritur, cui hoc verbum dicitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash   (80vb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit prohemium. Incipit prima pars\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...\u8249 \'8b Kapitelverzeichnis.  \endash   (81ra) Text:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Primo itaque sciendum quod eterna Dei sapientia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  ... (193ra)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  impediunt ascensum eius sursum secundum Aristotelem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Et sic est finis etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit liber de sensualibus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 delitijs paradisi celestis in curia romana per venerabilem patrem fratrem Guillelmum magistrum sacri palacij examinatus et per fratrem Johannem de Tambaco ordinis predicatorum libri compilatorem sanctissimo patri domino Clementi pape vj\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  presentatus anno Christi etc m\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ccc l\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . Est autem liber iste rescriptus pro monasterio Tegernsee anno Domini etc. 1454\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  193ab-194r leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Kaeppeli Nr. 2257 (Hs. genannt). Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung, u.a.: Melk, aaO, 139ra-246ra.}

