\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (2ra)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Beatus Augustinus cum de aliquibus peruersis suis reprehenderetur fratribus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit prefacio in Breuiloquium animi cuiuslibet religiosi reformativum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominus regnavit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 (Ps 92,1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 scilicet tamquam gygas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (2va) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit prologus in Breuiloquium animi cuiuslibet \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Iocunditas cordis hec est vita hominis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 \endash  (3rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit Breuiloquium animi \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Prima regula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  est in tumultibus et accidencijs exterioribus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (10ra) pars secunda   \u8230 \'85 (60va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 exilium nobis perpetuum tribuat gaudium Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit Breuiloquim animi \u8230 \'85 a quodam deuoto ordinis sacri cartusiensis compilatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  60vb leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: Pez, Bibliotheca Ascetica 7, S. 113-350 dort als Verfasser Johannes Institor de Buxheim  o.Cart. genannt. Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung Clm 18424 (f. 2ra-60rb), 27412 (f. 86r-88v).}

