\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (61ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In nomine Ihesu crucifixi amen. Incipit prologus in librum vite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Liber iste intitulatur liber vite quia eius materia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (61va) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipiunt preambula quedam in librum hunc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\u8249 \'8b  \endash  Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quociens Christus nudatus seu exutus sit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Considera primo nuditatem Christi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 (73rb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ciuitatem Ierusalem celestem vbi ipse daturus est regnum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit Liber vite cum quibusdam aliis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7\cf1 
