\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 165rb-172va  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Jacobus de J\u252 \'fcterbog seu de Paradiso}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Sermones in depositione unius defuncti}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (165rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo in deposicione vnius defuncti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Melior est mors \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Sir 30,17)\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Consideranti michi vite presentis miserias, consolaciones transitorias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash   (168ra)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Explicit sermo de animabus fidelium defunctorum scriptus per me fratrem Oswaldum Nott de Tittmaning monachum et professum in Tegernsee. 1470\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (168rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Alius sermo in deposicione vnius defuncti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b  \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sancta et salubris ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (2Mcc 12:46)\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Condicio hominis benigni et pij est vt quando videt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash   (172va)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  eiusdem vnigeniti pater et amborum nexus spiritus almus Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1    \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit sermo per me fratrem Oswaldum Nott de Tittmaning monachum et professum in Tegernsee 1470\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  172vb leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 S. Opuscula inedita, a.a.O., S.119. 2) Meier, a.a.O. Nr. 94,  S. 81.}

