\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tractatus de etatibus mundi magistri Iacobi Cartusiensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Organo apostolice vocis suo iudicio inter apostolos \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...\u8249 \'8b \endash  ...  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 exhibeat devotum oratorem vt in omnibus trinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .  \endash   \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Compositum anno Domini m\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  cccc\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  xlvij\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  rescripto vero anno 1470 feria tercia post festum exaltacionis sancte crucis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1470 Sept. 18]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  per me fratrem Oswaldum Nott monachum et peofessum in Tegernsee\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b
