\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit tractatus magistri Iacobi Carthusiensis de statu securiori incedendi in hac vita. Capitulum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Istis nostris infaustis diebus, in quibus heu habundauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sanius senserit huic non scripsi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash   \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Anno Domini currente 1450 domino Nicolao papa quinto auctorizante\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit tractatus de statu securiori incedendi in hac vita scriptum per me fratrem Oswaldum Nott de Tittmamnig monachum et professum in Tegernsee. Anno Domini m cccc lxx\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b
