\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit tractatus magistri Iacobi Cartusiensis de satatu ecclesiasticarum personarum. Capitulum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Iosias rex sanctus Iuda, divine legis feruentissimus emulator ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 que omnia non decent beniuolum predicatorem. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit tracatus per me fratrem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Oswaldum Nott de Tittmaning monachum et peofessum in Tegernsee anno Domini m cccc lxx\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  in die vndecim milium virginum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1470 Okt 21]\u8249 \'8b  
