\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (146ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Prologus magistri Johannis Nyder ordinis fratris predicatorum in tractatum eiusdem qui Consolatorium timorate conscientie intitulatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Apud disciplinas reperimus phisicas diuersis morbis corporum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (146vb) Kapitelverzeichnis. \endash   (147va) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit Consolatorium timorate consciencie per magistrum Johannem Nyder ordinis predicarotum compilatum. Quod consiencia primo modo capitur pro spe et ponuntur septem fructus bone consciencie. Capitulum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Primo igitur animaduertendum est quod consciencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (218vb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 nichil aut modicum auctori manebit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 etc.  Explicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9bExplicit\plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1   \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 219rv leer.
