\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9bBeati Ieronymi presbiteri ad Pammachium et Marcellam pro se contra Ruphinum liber primus hic incipit. Liber uero 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 us\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  pro defensione sua contra Ruphinum ad Pammachium et Marcellam habetur in libro B. 33 cuius principium est Huc usque de criminibus etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Ex  vestris et multorum litteris didici\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 iam corruit in eternum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Deo gratias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ed.: PL 23, Sp. 397-492A.}

