\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 246r-262r  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Michael Francisci de Insulis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Determinatio de tempore adventus antichristi
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (246r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Determinacio fratris Miachaelis Francisci de Insulis sacre theologie professoris ac regentis predicatorum in Colonia de tempore aduentus antichristi ac de eius ingressu, progressu et egressu in mundum atque de nouitatibus que iam de eo currunt. In aula fratris Mathie de Aquis anno millesimo cccc 78 pronuntiata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (246v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Utrum Christi et Antichristi ingressus, progressus, egressus sint\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... (262r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et aureolam ei configuremus. Quod nobis prestare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hec sunt que de antichristo tam in scriptura sacra quam in sacris doctoribus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  262v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: GW 10256-57.  \endash  Stephanus G. Axters, Bibliotheca Dominicana Neerlandica Manuscripta 1224-1500, Louvain 1970, S. 72 (Hs. genannt).}

