\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (263r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dyalogus inter Hugonem, Chathonem et Oliuerium super libertate ecclesiastica luculentissime elaboratus feliciter incipit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hugo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dic michi, Oliueri, verum est quod audio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... (281v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 celeriter legato presenti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .  \endash  (282r)  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dyalogus super libertate eccelsiastica nouiter compositus feliciter finit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Omnia consilio prius experire\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \u8249 \'8b  \endash  282v-287v leer.
