\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1r-215r  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Michael Pregler}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Flammarius divinae dilectionis}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (1r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Auctor huius Flamarii fuit pater Michael dictus Pregler prius in Castellensi monasterio professus, sed postea anno Domini 1463 hic in Tegernsee stabilitus. Obiit anno Domini 1511 9 Cal. aprilis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .   \endash   Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit prologus in opusculum sequens quod intitulatum vocitatur Flammarius diuine dilectionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In nomine sanctissime ac indiuidue Trinitatis amen. Cum post adeptum sacerdotalis dignitatis gradum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (f. 3r)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  de missis obligatorij\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 s ...  die gesamte Seite durchgestrichen.  \endash   (3v) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ad laudem gloriamque Domini nostri Ihesu Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sequitur quidam modus preparandi se ad sacre misse celebrationem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quod sola humilitas disponit ad dignam sacramenti eucharistie susceptionem. Particula Ia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .\u8249 \'8b  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Sicut dicit egregius doctor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Johannes de Gersona\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 precipue ex diuino munere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1   ...  \endash  (63v) Text durchgestrichen. Notiz (2 Mal): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hic nullus est defectus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .    \endash  (64r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 que sine peccato vitari non possit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash   ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 omnes angelos et sanctos me secum collaudare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (206r) Explicit rot durchgestrichen. \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Item dixit Dominus ad beatam Methildem (!)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b ... \endash   (215r)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  sed ipse constitutus est meum iudex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sic de nobis fieri optamus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .  \endash   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit collectura fratris simpliciani pauperisque ingenii que vocata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Flamarius diuine dilectionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vna cum additionibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .  \endash  Ir-IVv, 215v, I\lquote r-III\lquote v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Bis Particula XLVI f. (1r-140r)  \u252 \'fcbereinstimmend mit {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Clm 18604}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , f. (f.3r-101r) (Flammarius divinae dilectionis).}

