\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (3r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tabula in sequentem tractatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b Kapitelverzeichnis. \endash  (6v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Prologus in \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [add. in marg. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Alias Trilogium euangelice perfectionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 formulam perfecte vite patris Caspar Schaczgeyer de ordine minorum quondam guardiani in conuentu monacensi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .\u8249 \'8b \endash  Nachtrag in marg. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Scribit ad reuerendum patrem et dominum dominum (sic!) Henricum pro tunc abbatem monasterii sancti Quirini in Tegernsee. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Heinrich Kunzer, Abt von Tegernsee, s. o. \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Postulauit, reuerende pater, charitas vestra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 \endash  (8v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De via purgatiua, In nullo proprium commodum querere. Directio prima.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Prima purgatio est a priuato amore sui ipsius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sed et curras per viam perfectionis ad brauim superne retributionis. Ad quod nos perducat qui sine fine viuit et regnat. Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  57v leer
