\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (1v) Notizen zum Text: Nota. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sequens tractatus de sacramento Euckaristie valde egregius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... Von Hand Schwerzenbecks:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Preparatoria plurima collecta ex diuersis per patrem Benedictum priorem nostrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (2r) \u220 \'dcberschrift von Hand Schwerzenbecks: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ordinarium practicum misse compilatum per venerabilem priorem Bernardum in Tegernsee ad episcopum Johannem Eystetensem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  Widmung: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Reuerendissimo in Christo patri michique singulariter gracioso \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (3r) Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Prefaciuncula deprecatoria \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Jhesu magister optime fili Dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (3v) Text (Teil 1.):  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De quibusdam generalibus ad missam dispositivis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Igitur priusquam ad practicam eorum que in misse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash   (39r) Teil 2.:  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Formula communis pro simplicibus ad celebrandum sew communicandum se disponendi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ad formacionem quorundam simplicium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash   (78r) Teil 3. \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit prologus in ordinarium misse cum practica in eo seruanda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quoniam non omnes eodem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash   ... (100r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 diutius suspendere et affligere volens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  38v, 76v-77v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 VL Bd.1 Sp. 779-789, hier Sp. 783, Nr. 12 (Werner H\u246 \'f6ver), Hs. genannt. Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung, u.a. Augsburg, SuStB, 8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Cod. 34, f. 1r-218r.}

