\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 114r-130v  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Guilelmus Tornacensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : \~\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Flores sancti Bernardi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Excerpta)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De intemperancia monachorum in Apollogetico sancti Bernhardi abbatis Clarevallensis, capitulo quarto decimo etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Am Rand von\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hand Schwerzenbecks nachgetragen:\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Exerpta ex epistolis et sermonibus aliquibus sancti Bernardi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nvllus ordo quippiam recipit inordinatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  (120v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quis sit dignus prelacione. In epistola quadam in tercio libro. Capitulum primum etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Si rebus raritas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash   (121r ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In omelia super Ecce nos relinquimus omnia et secuti sumus te etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Speret ergo gradum minister\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ...  (129v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quod non sit vnius meriti socialiter viuere et utliter preesse. Sermones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [in] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cantica canticorum sermo xxiii, capitulum xiii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Non paris facilitatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  (130r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quod prelatus invitatur a Deo instruendum animas. Secundum? sermonem lix cap. xiii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b  \endash  (130v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ad animas revisandas \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (!), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 corrigendas \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  ... (130v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 tu qui alios doces\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  etc.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: GW 3928-3930. Bloomfield, Incipits, 1155. Lit.: M. Bernards, Flores sancti Bernardi, in: Bernhard von Clairvaux, M\u246 \'f6nch und Mystiker. Internationaler Bernhardkongress Mainz 1953. Hrsg. v. J. Lortz, Ver\u246 \'f6ffentlichungen des Instituts f\u252 \'fcr Europ\u228 \'e4ische Geschichte Mainz 6, Wiesbaden 1955, 192-210.}

