\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (3r-4v) Kapitelverzeichnis: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tabula in opusculum sequentis deuotionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (4v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In nomine Domini nostri Ihesu Christi sequitur quidam modus preparandi se ad sacre misse celebrationem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Et vocatur Flamarius diuine dilectionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b  \endash   (6r)  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quod sola humilitas disponit ad dignam sacramenti eucharistie susceptionem. Paticula Ia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .\u8249 \'8b  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Sicut dicit egregius doctor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Johannes de Gersona\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 precipue ex diuino munere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1   ...  \endash   ... (176r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 corpore multipliciter retrahente\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 perfecte facere non vales Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash   176v -176k-v leer.   \endash  f. 177 s. Einbandmakulatur.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Vgl. Bis Particula XLVI (f.3r-101r) \u252 \'fcbereinstimmend mit {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Clm 18603}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , f. 1r-140r (Flammarius divinae delectionis, Michael Pregler zugeschrieben).}

