\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (2r) Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit prologus in passionem sancti Pauli apostoli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Paulus hebrayce mirabilis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (3r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit prologus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (durchgestrichenen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 in Christi nomine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Incipit passio sancti Pauli apostoli a Lino episcopo romane Eccelsie greca lingua conscripta et ecclesijs orientalibus destinata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cum uenissent Romam Lucas a Galatia, Tytus a Dalmacia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash   ... (13v)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  baptizati sunt in nomine Domini nostri Iesu Christi cui cum Patre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .
