\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 VS: Vermerk zur Bindung u. Besitzvermerk von Hand Schwerzenbecks.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 2r-273r  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Raphael Neup\u246 \'f6ck}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , abbas Oberaltacensis: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Venenum desperationis sive Dialogus inter poenitentem et confessorem }}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (2r)  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Jesus Maria.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipiunt capitula prime partis huius tractatus domini Raplhaelis abbatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b Nachtr\u228 \'e4glich hinzugef\u252 \'fcgt:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  olim monachi hic professi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . Kapitelverzeichnis, tw. von Hand Schwerzenbecks.  \endash  (6v) Besitzvermerk, Angaben zum Werk u. Verfasser von Hand Schwerzenbecks: ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 cuius libri autor fuit et collector dominus Raphael abbas Althee Superioris et olim istius monasterii Tegernsee professus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cuius anima et omnium fidelium requiescant in sancta pace. Amen. Obiit in die sancti Brittij episcopi in pestilencia anno Domini m\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  cccc\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  lxxxiiii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (vielmehr lxxxiii\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , s. Lindner, Familia) [1483 Nov 13] \endash   \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit prologus in tractatum qui intitulatur Venenum desperationis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b folgt durchgestrichen :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Consolatur peccator\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...  Schwerzenbeck erg\u228 \'e4nzt:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Domini Raphaelis abbatis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...   \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In nomine beatissime et indiuidue Trinitatis amen. Scribere aliquid ad laudem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dei omipotentis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (7r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit tractatus qui intitulatur Venenum desperationis pars prima. Consolatur peccator animo deiectus ne de misericordia Dei vllo modo desperet. Capitulum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b  \endash  Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Uenit igitur peccator ad confessorem spinis peccatorum obsitus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (128r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit pars secunda. De triplici remedio contra desperationem in genere et specialiter de Christi passione qualiter accendat in Dei amore. Capitulum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Penitens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hactenus, pater, me plurima interrogante\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  ... (273v)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  id Virgo sapienter reuelet et ordinet ad nostram salutem eternam.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Penitens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  1rv, 274r-279v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung Clm 19840.}

