\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 (IIIr) Inhaltsverzeichnis. \endash  (IVr) Register der Meditationes: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Particulares meditaciones de Christi passione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b von Schwerzenbeck erg\u228 \'e4nzt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 magistri Jordani\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (IVv) Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Uidens vidisti Domine afflictionem populi tui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash  (3v) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De septem horis canonicis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 meditationes bis ponendo completis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1. Meditation: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Septem sunt hore diei, in quibus singulis diebus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  (134v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in vase luteo mellitum poculum valeat inuenire \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit tractatus de passione Domini nostri Ihesu Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b
