\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (1r) Nachgetragene \u220 \'dcberschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo egregius de tota passione Domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1   \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dilectissimi, hodie fideles et sancta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 mater ecclesia lugubri ac deuoto animo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (17r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Karissimi, quia tempus passionis Christi iam ab ecclesia celebratur et licet in die parasceues \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (21v)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Qvia hodie, ut scitis, non habemus breue ewangelium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 cum omni perseuerancia tolerare. Ista pro nunc sufficiant. Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .
