\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit multum deuotus dyalogus seu amorosa confabulacio inter sponsum videlicet Christum eternam sapientiam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [et]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  sponsam videlicet fidelem animam. Sponsus alloquitur sponsam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 scilicet animam tali modo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In caritate perpetua dilecta es a me, angeloru\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 m dominus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (vielmehr domino) ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sequi ac collaudare digna inueniar laude et gratiarum actione perpetua Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .
