\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (162r) Kapitelverzeichnis.  \endash   (162r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sequitur capitulum primum de imitacione Christi et contemptu omnium vanitatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Qvi sequitur me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  (Io 8,12). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hec sunt verba Christi quibus admonemur quatenus vitam eius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  tantum proficies quantum tibi ipsi vim intuleris. Cum autem Domine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [...] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 finis huius tractatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . (Schluss unleserlich). \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Viri egregiij Thome monasterii sancte Agnetis in Traiecto regularis canonici libri de imitatione Christi numero quatuor finiunt feliciter. Et hic \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [premissus?] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 est primis eius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  176r-181r leer \endash  181v Besitzvermerke, Federprobe.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Lib. I. Ed.: Michael Iosephus Pohl (Hrsg.), Thomae Hemerken a Kempis [...] Opera omnia [...],  Freiburg i. Br. 1904,  Bd. II, 5-263.}

