\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hand Schwerzenbecks:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Collatio magistri Judoci de Haylprun in conuentu scotorum Wienne in cena Domini \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (10r)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [E]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 wangelium quod iam lectum est scilicet ante diem festum Pasche\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sicut et totus sermo domini qui habetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 in Johannis ewangelio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (17v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In die cene 1441 in monasterio beate Virginis alias Scotorum Wyenne. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hand Schwerzenbecks: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Collatio magistri Judoci de Haylprunn\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (18r)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [S]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ermo dominicus qui in parte lectus est in mandatoria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (28r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Pronunciatus anno Domini 1442 ipsa die cene in monasterio ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 etc.  Hand Schwerzenbecks: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 per magistrum Judocum de Haylprun\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (28v) Hand Schwerzenbecks:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Collatio magistri Judoci de Haylprun in cena Domini in conuentu scotorum Wienne. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  [H]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ec locutus sum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Jo 16,33) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et habentur in sermone post cenam facto. Reuerendi honorandique patres\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  (43r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Anno domini 1445\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  pronunciatus in monasterio ..\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Hand Schwerzenbecks: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 per magistrum Judocum de Haylprunn. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (43v) Hand Schwerzenbecks: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Collatio magistri Judici (!) in cena Domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1   \endash  [E]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 wangelium quod iam lectus est ...  habetur in sermone Domini secundum Johannem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 13\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , in quo sermone\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  spirituali in celestibus, ad\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ephes. primo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (Eph 1,3) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cui cum patre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Anno Domini 1444 pronunciatus in monasterio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  Hand Schwerzenbecks: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 per magistrum Judocum de Haylprunn\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .
