\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (77r) \u220 \'dcberschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De materia ieiunij\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . Hand Schwerzenbecks: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Scripta optima per tres sexternos de jeiunio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Utrum jeiunium cadat sub precepto. Pro illa questione primo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 premitenda sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  (113v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De materia ieiunii queritur vtrum quodlibet ieiunium ecclesie sit obseruandum sub pena peccati mortalis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  am Rand:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Anno 46 secunda responsio mea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 in vigilia assumpcionis Marie in prioratu magistri Conradi de Nurnberga\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .  \endash  (120v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De voto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Vtrum quis grauius excedat frangendo votum quam committendo periurium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (127r) Hand Schwerzenbecks: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De diuina voluntate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Responsio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 mea 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ta\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  17 die mensis julij que erat die sancti Alexij anno Domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1450\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 in prioratu magistri Conradi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 S\u228 \'e4ldner\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 de Rotenacher \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (Professor in Wien, \u8224 \'86 1471) \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Vtrum quilibet homo habens vsum liberi arbitrij\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 de illa voluntate est difficultas presentis questionis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [...]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  diliguntur. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  112v, 133v, 133ar-133bv leer.
