\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (184r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Primum principium in cursus biblie specialiter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 in Deuteronomium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 in crastino sancti Luce anno 1446 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  Hand Schwerzenbeck:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  magistri Augustini Ayrmschmalcz de Weylhaim \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In nomine sanctissime Trinitatis in eternumque benedictissime\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vnitatis ... Primo namque diuinam omni laude dignissimam theologiam ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  (192r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Principium in 2m cursum scilicet in Epistolam beati Pauli apostoli ad Hebreos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b Hand Schwerzenbeck:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  magistri Augustini Ayrmschmalcz de Weylhaim \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  196v leer, au\u223 \'dfer \u220 \'dcberschrift von Hand Schwerzenbecks: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Primum principium in Sententias specialiter in 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 m\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  librum Sententiarum magistri Augustini de Weylha\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [i]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 m sequitur in\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sequenti folio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  (197r) \u8250 \'9bI\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 n nomine creatoris mei altissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Primum principium in Sententias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 specialiter in 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sententiarum Augustini de Weill\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [heim] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 pronunciatum in crastino sancti Galli anno 1448 etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Prout altissimus sua dederit exuberantissima misericordia... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  (226r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Articulus primus collativus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \u8249 \'8b (cum Johanne de Lambaco et Andrea de Potenprun) \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nunc ad secundum principale in quo conferre habeo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... (238v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 me crebrius eorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [...]  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 commendando\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .
