\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (11r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Uocatus est nomen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Jo 2,21)\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hodie, dilectissimi, in officio misse legimus breuissimum ewangelium, secundum verba profundum tamen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (13v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Apertis thesauris ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (Mt 2,11)\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Am Rand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De epiphania Domini. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Omnipotens Deus volens filij sui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (16v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De nouo anno\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quoniam dies hodiernus est anni principium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash   \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 66\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (219r)  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Si quis sitit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Jo 7, 31)\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Prestantissimi patres etc., in quibusdam, vt scitis, ciuitatibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 67\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (223r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Venite ad cenam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Apoc 19, 17-18)\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Spectabiles omniumque reuerencia supereminentes patres\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash   ... (226r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 se in premium largitatur Ihesus Christus Dominus noster in secula benedictus Amen etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .  \endash  22v, 58v, 130v, 154v, 165v-166v, 226v leer.
