\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (2r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Moguntie in die Penthecosten 1446\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cusa \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sedete quousque\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Lc 24,49) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Non enim ad motum spiritualem apti esse possumus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash   \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (8v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Feria secunda post Penthecosten, Moguntie 1446\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Sedete quoadusque etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .  (Lc 24,49)  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Heri descensum virtutis ex alto in ecclesiam catholicam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (15v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Feria tertia Moguntie post Penthecosten 1466\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sedete quousque\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Lc 24,49)  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sedimus duobus diebus contemplantes hanc virtutem ex alto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (18r)  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1446 feria 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ta\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  post Penthecosten Moguntie in festo sancti Bonifacij\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ego resuscitabo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  (Joh 6,44)  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Locuti sumus hijs diebus de Spiritu Sancto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash   \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (21r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1451 Magdeburgi feria iii post Penthecosten in legatione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ueni ut vitam habeant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Jo 10,10)  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Exemplum premittitur quomodo pater dat vitam animalem filio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... (22r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 infirmitatis et confortationem spiritus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  22v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ed. Nicolai de Cusa Opera omnia...:  Sermones II (1443-1452), Fasz. 4 u. 6 (Leipzig 2001, 2007). \endash  Lit.: Rudolf Haubst, Zu den f\u252 \'fcr die kritische Edition der Cusanus-Predigten noch offenen Datierungsproblemen, in: Mitteilungen und Forschungsbeitr\u228 \'e4ge der Cusanus-Gesellschaft Bd. 17 (1986) S. 57-88 (Hs. genannt); Schneyer/H\u246 \'f6dl.}

