mptionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cusa \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash    \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Maria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 optimam partem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  (Lc 10,42)  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Agimus diem festum qua super choros angelorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 11\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (97r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo domini cardinalis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (Schwerzenbeck korrigiert und f\u252 \'fcgt hinzu: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nicolai de Cusa de passione Domini nostri Ihesu Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 )  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Agnus in crucis leuatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Hymnus)  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Primo de causa passionis, de acerbitate passionis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ad illam claram visionem venturi sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  73ar-73bv, 103a -rv leer.
