\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (1r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Si consurrexistis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Col 3,1-4) cum glossa interlinearia.  \endash   \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Epistola in vigilia Pasce. Ihesus Christus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Presens lectio scribitur in epistola ad Colonicenses\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  et legitur sabbato in vigilia Pasche\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In hoc solo sabbato\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (8v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Epistola in die sancto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b  \endash   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Expurgate uetus fermentum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (1Cor 5,7-9) cum glossa interlinearia.  \endash   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hec leccio scribitur in epistola prima ad Corinthios 5\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  et legitur in die Pasche. In qua solempnissima die\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (19v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Karissimi, omne quod natum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (1 Joh 5,4-10) cum glossa interlinearia. \endash   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Leccio ista scribitur in canonica prima Johannis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Et legitur in dominica prima post festum Pasche\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Pro cuius intellectu \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 35\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (306v) [I]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 taque, fratres mei karissimi, desiratissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Phil 4, 1-3) cum glossa interlinearia. \endash  (307r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Itaque, fratres mei karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (I Cor 15,58?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 O Paule, Paule\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Mt 12,34) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Apostolus ergo monet nos generaliter omnes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 36\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (309r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Fratres, non cessamus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  (Col 1,9-14) cum Glossa interlinearia. \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De quanto enim aliquis actus est nobilior et excellentior\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  ... (314v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 misericorditer, medio et fini liberaliter in secula seculorum Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit postilla epistolarum dominicalium per circulum anni compilata per venerabilem magistrum Mathiam de Legnicz sacre theologie professorem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Scripta per me Ercardum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Oll\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [f] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 de Sa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [...] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Pataviensis diocesis oriundus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  tunc temporis in Muldorf\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Anno domini m\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  cccc xxxi in die sancti Remigii confessoris etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . [1431 Okt 1]
