\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Circumfulsit eum lux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Act 9,3) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Scribuntur hec verba Actum nono\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Digni ac dilecti discipuli, quamquam singuli sancti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (9r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Fratres, scientes quia hora est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Rom 13, 11-14)  cum Glossa interlinearia.  \endash  (9v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hec leccio scribitur in epistola ad Romanos xiii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  in qua apostolus commendat nobis caritatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (23v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Fratres, quecumque scripta sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Rom 15, 4-13) cum Glossa interlinearia. \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hec leccio scribitur in epistola ad Romanos xv\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 mo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Et leccio dominica secunda in aduentum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...   \endash   \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 23\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (235r)  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9bSequitur epistola que legitur in die Palmarum ad Philippenses secundo. Fratres\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 hoc sentite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Phil 2,5-11) \endash  (235v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hec leccio scribitur in epistola ad Philippenses secundo ... in qua simplices pueri hebreorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...   \endash   \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 24\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (246v)  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9bSequitur epistola que legitur in cena domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Fratres, convenientibus uobis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  (1Cor 11,20-32) \endash  (248r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Illa leccio scribitur in episola prima ad Chorinthios ...  que dies est solempnissima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash   ... (266r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cenantibus autem accepit Ihesus panem etc. et etiam circa ewangelium Luce quod legitur in cena Domini. Et sic habetur pars yemalis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .  \endash  266v-266m-v leer.
