\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 25r-269r  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Sermones}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (25r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de diuinissimo sacramento altaris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b   \endash   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Iste est panis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Ex 16,15) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Verba sunt Moysi ad filios Israhel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Manducauerunt patres\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  (39r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de assumptione beate Marie virginis de verbis euangelii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b  \endash   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Intrauit Ihesus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Lc 10,38) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cum presens ewangelium totum ad litteram scriptum sit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (45r) Nachtrag von Hand Schwerzenbecks: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tractatulus est quasi sancti Augustini de assumcione beate Virginis in corpore et anima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash    \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit prefacio beati Augustini in sermonem de assumpcione gloriose uirginis Marie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (nachgetragen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 in coprore et anima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 )\u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ad interrogata de uirginis et matris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  Henricus de Langestein (128r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de assumcione beatissime Marie uirginis ex longo sermone magistri Henrici de Hassia collectus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quasi cedrus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Sir 24,17)\u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 scribitur Ecclesiastici 24\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 to\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  capitulo et legitur communiter in ecclesia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...   \endash  (139r)  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de nativitate beatissime Marie virginis ex longo sermone magistri Henrici de Hassia excerptus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ipse fundauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Ps 86,5) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Patres et fratres in Christo venerabilies magne vtique et gloriose\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  (151r)  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de annunciatione beatissime Marie virginis ex longo sermone magistri Henrici de Hassia collectus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dixit Maria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Lc 1,34) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Scripta sunt verba hec originaliter Luce primo capitulo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (257r)  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de festo visitacionis beate Marie Virginis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Exurgens Maria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Lc 2,39) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In presenti festivitate visitationis beate Virginis Marie spirituali debemus gaudio letari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  (259r)  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de sancto Benedicto abbate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Benedicam tibi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Gn 22,17)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Racio et experiencia docent quod inter cetera de quibus bonus pater\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (269r) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 quam benedictionem nobis concedat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \u8250 \'9b1468\u8249 \'8b  \endash  174bv,185v-186v, 198v, 246rv leer\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ca. 30 Predigten verschiedener Autoren, darunter Henricus de Langenstein (f.128ff).  \endash  Thomas Hohmann, \u8222 \'84Initienregister der Werke Heinrichs von Langenstein\ldblquote  in Traditio 32 (1976), S. 399-426, Nr. 170.}

