\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 1r-118v  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Marquardus Sprenger}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 :\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Elucidatorium mysticae theologiae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 cum apologiis
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (1r) Prolog:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Qui me elucidant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Sir 24,31) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 dicit diuina sapientia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Vtinam tantam gratiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  (1r) Kapitelverzeichnis.  \endash   (1v) Text:  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Capitulum primum ponit quasdam generales distinctiones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Procedendo igitur ad primam partem sit hec prima distinctio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash   (30v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit per me fratrerm Oswaldum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b  \endash   \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Et sic fit finis huius secunde partis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  Notiz: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Requisitus super huius tractatus veritate reverendissimus pater dominus Nicolaus cardinalis ecclesie Romane et episcopus Brixiensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [Nicolaus de Cusa] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 quid sentiret, respondit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  30ar-30bv leer.  \endash   ... (48v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vitam et hauriamus salutem a Domino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ista sequentia scripta vsque ad finem debent poni immediate post finem prime partis huius tractatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .  \endash  ... (53v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 cherubin cum sex alis quod ad cognicionem pertinet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .  \endash  53a-rv leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Lit.:\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20  2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 VL.  9, Sp.  161, Nr. 1  (H. Rossmann. Hs. genannt). Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Clm 18600, f. 359r-407v, aus Tegernsee; Melk, Benediktinerstift, Cod. 618 (1064, O 25 [2]), f. 1v-35v.}

