\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Salutet et saluet vos Ihesus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Religiose pater, presentata est michi quedam cedula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 quia deficit luc Dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .  \endash  (139v) Johannes Schlitpacher ad Marquardum Sprenger: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Suo magistro Marquardo Sprenger\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash   ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sed paratus sum emendare. Valete\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  (139v-144v)  Idem ad eundem: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dirige me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Ps 24,5) \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Venerabili viro magistro Marquardo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash    ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit in monasterio mee professionis 25 septembris \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1460 Sep 25, vgl.  Melk, Cod. 1767]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . Valete. Directorium scilicet collatiuum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .  \endash  Nachtrag (143v-144v): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Accepta fiducia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...   \endash   ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  me trahit fiducia erga vestram caritatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash   \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Lit.:\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20  2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  VL 9, Sp. 162, Nr. 5 (Hs. genannt). Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung Melk, Benediktinerstift, Cod. 1767 (426, H 45 [1]), p. 273-318. Regest: Franz Hubalek, Aus dem Briefwechsel des Johannes Schlitpacher von Weilheim (Der Kodex 1767 der Stiftsbibliothek Melk), Diss. Wien 1963, 179 Nr. 36.}

