\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 (12v) Nachgetragene \u220 \'dcberschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominica prima post Penthecostes. Sermo de duplici iudicio proximi videlicet et sui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nolite iudicare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Lc 6,37)  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Saluator noster in presenti ewangelio declarat quibus modis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash   (23r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominica 3\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  post Epiphaniam. Sermo de verbis euangelii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ascendente Jesu etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et est de religiosis et regulari obseruancia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ascendente Jesu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Mt 8,23) \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Considerandi venit, fratres dilectissimi, quod religio siue status religiosorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (32v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominica vltima post Epiphaniam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b Am Rand: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo iste tractat de peccatis lingue\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sinite vtraque\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Mt 13,30) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sciendum est quod in celo sunt solummodo boni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash   (357v)  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de verbis ewangelij quod legitur dominica quinta post Penthecosten de reconciliacione mutua inter fratres facienda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Si offers munus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (Mt 5,23)\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  In hijs verbis solicite considerare debemus quantum Deus ipse in nobis fraternum amorem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (362r)  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de sanctis Angelis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Angelis suis mandavit ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (Ps 90,11)\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Venerabiles in Christo patres, quamuis precepto psalmiste\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash   ... (365r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 lucis principem, leticie largitorem. Qui cum Deo ... Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  171v, 199v, 270v, 322v, 327v-328r, 334rv, 352r, 365v leer.}

