\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 7va-48rb  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Matthaeus de Cracovia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Rationale divinorum operum
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (7va) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit prologus in sequens opusculum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (Schwerzenbeck f\u252 \'fcgt hinzu: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Mathei de Cracouia doctoris egregii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  quod compilatum est more dyalogi de rationali diuinorum operum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (7vb) Widmungsbrief: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Reuerendo in Christo patri domino Hijnrico episcopo Warmiensi suus Matheus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Magni sudoris plenam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...  \endash  (8rb-9vb) Kapitelverzeichnis.   \endash  (9vb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tractatus primus ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Pater\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Uellem declarari quomodo Deus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... (48rb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 paterna dignetur recipere pietate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit dyalogus de rationali diuinorum operum et continet 7\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 tem\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  tractatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Iste dyalogus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (48v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 oblatus est monasterio sancti Quirini Tegernseensis per dominum decanum atque plebanum in Ursinperg doctorem Johannem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Empel confratrem nostrum anno Domini etc. 73\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  mense iulij\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Franz Francke, Math\u228 \'e4us von Krakau. Sein Leben, Charakter und seine Schriften zur Kirchenreform, Diss. Greifswald 1910, s. 123, Nr. 7.}

