\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (49r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ad quemdam doctorem congratulato iam de religionis ingressu \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Noue conuersationem uite laudabilem peseuerantiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (49r)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Ad eundem ad quem supra in abbaten electo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1   \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Subiecto gregi secundum doctrinam apostoli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (50r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Scribit amicus amico qui speret se non minus diligi ab eo ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Vigilanti animo vicinum expectare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (64v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hortatur nouicius quidam ad perseuerandum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Desiderium iugiter tendendi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash   (65v)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Humili premissa salutacione etc. Vestra presentibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ? \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 noscat karitas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  (66r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 salutate omnes amicos et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [...] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 omnes religiosos datum anno etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .
