\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 103r-108r  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Henricus de Langenstein}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Regula sacerdotum saecularium
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nachtrag von Hand Schwerzenbecks: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Aut Henricus de Hassia scribit aut quidam magister Jacobus bohemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 de Garrlandia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Regula de vita sacerdotum secularium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  Multi sunt sacerdotes religiosorum regulas deridentes ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  ... post hanc miseriam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (am Rand):\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  coronari corona immarcessibili in eternum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Schluss rot durchgestrichen. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1473 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Presens tractatulus in exemplari fuit magistro Hainrico de Hassia attitulatus, sed eius an sit non est michi certitudo. In alij reperitur editus a magistro Iacobo bohemo de Kalandria doctore egregio... Finis 1486\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Lit: Thomas Hohmann, Initienregister der Werke Heinrichs von Langenstein, Traditio 32 (1976), S. 399-426, Nr. 128.}

