\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 108v-147r  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermones de tempore
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (108v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de sancto Andrea apostolo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Christo affixus sum .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .. (Gal 2,19)\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Fidelis miles et sapiens in omnibus quantum potest se suo regi ... \endash   \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (113r)  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de sancto Johanne apostolo et euangelista\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Ad sumenda virtutum exempla haud dubium sanctorum festa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (119r)  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de concepcione beate Marie virginis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Liber generacionis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...  (Mt 1,1,)\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Liber multifariam accipitur: veritas eterna\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (140v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de sancta cruce in eius exaltacione \endash  Uerbum crucis pereuntibus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (1 Cor 1,18) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Fratres karissimi, quia fidelibus locuturi de mysterio crucis sumus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (143r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Alius sermo de sancta cruce\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  Scire Deum summa sciencia est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (147r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 aliam gloriam quam Christi Domini crucifixi \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nachtrag: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dubitatur circa dictam ex quo dictum est ... \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 116v-118v, 147v-148v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 7) Gaufridus Babion, Sermo de cruce Domini, Schneyer, Repertorium, Bd. 2; S. 152, Nr. 28; 8) Bernardus Claravallensis, Sententiae, series 3, sententia 74.}

