\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Epistola religiosorum inuectiva a quodam curato cuidam religioso patri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash   Honorande frater, noueritis me fabulas michi pridem presentatas auscultasse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  ... sed ut predixi proprias custodire animas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Rogo queso ... reprehendere alios non ad religiosos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hanc epistolam cum a quibusdam oblatam alius quidam legisset ad eorundem instanciam zelo motus respondit ut infr\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a\u8249 \'8b
