\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 186r-187v  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Commentum super epistolam invectivam religiosorum
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Qvidam monachus scriptum de periculosa beneficiorum pluralitate cuius inicium. Volo ut quicumque hoc legerit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Quo lecto idem presbyter rescripsit epistolam in aperta carta cuius tenor subsequitur. Honorande frater\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  ... Sed nil horum ad manus eius peruenit quia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ?\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  abiuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sciendum quod epistola prefati presbyteri curati exhibita est cuidam viro religioso\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  147\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 4}

