\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 188r-193v  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Johannes Schlitpacher}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : Epistula ad quendam curatum cum declaratione epistulae suae invectivae
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u220 \'dcberschrift von Hand Schwerzenbecks: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hec infra patris Johannis Schlippacher scripta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  Uenerabili viro domino N. ... Domine mi, fauorose precedenti anno sub Domini aduentu uestre honorabilitati  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  ... amicicia prisca sine mutua offensione. Et hec ad presens sufficiant sub breuitate. In Domino valete. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit anno 1474\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 192v leer au\u223 \'dfer Notiz:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hic nullus est defectus sed vicium papiri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b, 194r-198v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Lit.: zu Johannes Schlitpacher \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 VL, Bd 8, Sp. 727-748 (Franz Josef Worstbrock)}

