\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 203r-226r  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Homiliae et sermones
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (203r)  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Feria vi\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ante dominicam quadragesime. Secundum Matheum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  In illo tempore ... Audistis quia dictum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (Mt 5,43)  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Omelia Origenis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sicut illa alia precepta data eis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (204r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Feria secunda post dominicam primam quadragesime. Secundum Matheum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  In illo tempore ... Cum venerit filius ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (M\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 t 25,31) (204v)  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Omelia sancti Augustini episcopi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  Cvm venerit filius ... ubi lumen idificiens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (205v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Feria tercia Secundum Matheum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9bIn illo tempre. Cum intrasset\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Mt 21,10)\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Omelia sancti Augustini episcopi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Et veniunt Ierosolimam, et cum introisset templum ... \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (221r)  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominica quarta in Quadragesima. Sermo sancti Iohannis episcopi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Stabat Moyses in monte non armis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (224r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominica 18 post Pentecosten. Secundum Matheum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In illo tempore ascendens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (9,1)\u8249 \'8b  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Omelia sancti Johannis episcopi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Christum in humanis actibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (226r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 iudicare perfidie iam m\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 oreris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1   \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 214v, 226v-229v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Homilien verschiedener Autoren, u.a. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ps. Origenes, Hom. 3 in Mt 5, 43; CPL 670 (203r-204r); \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Augustinus, Sermo XCI De judicio extremo, Operum Supplementum, continens sermones ineditos extractos ex archivio Montis-Cassini, 1863, S. 145-146 (f.204r-205v). Ausz\u252 \'fcge aus Homliarium Karls des Grossen, s. Friedrich Wiegand, Das Homiliarium Karls des Grossen auf seine urspr\u252 \'fcngliche Gestalt hin untersucht, Alen 1972, S. 81.}

