\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ex libro soliloquiorum beati Augustini episcopi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Qvod non possit creatura subsistere nisi regat eam qui creauit eam. Sequitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ego autem creatura tua sub vmbra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash   ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 oculos iudicis cuncta cernentis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .  \endash   11r-v leer.
