\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De vestimentis missalibus quid representant singillatim\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b  \endash   \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nota quod sacerdos stans in vestimentis missalibus representat Christum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  quia alia peccaret\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .}

