\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 48r-68v  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Excerpta, notae et quaestiones variae
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (48r)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Queritur quid est detraccio. Respondeo se\plain \f2\i\lang1049\fs24\cf1 \u1089 \'f1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 undum doctores quod detraccio id est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 schenter vel lestrer \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [sch\u228 \'e4nder vel l\u228 \'e4sterer (scheuchen oder l\u228 \'e4stern/kritisieren)] ... \endash  (51r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Inuidia secundum Damascenum est tristicia de alienis bonis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (52r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Irrisio propter se dupliciter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (57r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De horis canonicis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Queritur utrum clericus non dicendo horas suas peccat mortaliter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... (60r)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Ex sermone magistri Jordani de corpore Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Item ad digne suscipiendum diuinissimi sacramenti requiritur dimissio iniurie illate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash   (64r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ex 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  parte Thesauri pauperum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Queritur utrum illi consecuntur remissionem et veniam peccatorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  (68r) Innocentius III papa, Abbati et conventui Sublacensibus: \u220 \'dcberschrift\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : De proprietate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Rubrica ex tercio decretalium de statu monachorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et canonicorum. Innocencius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 39 de habitu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cum ad monasterium Sublacensem et infra firmiter inhibemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  ... (68v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 uel priori uel cellerario assignetur etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  59v leer
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (60r) Sermo magistri Jordani [de Saxonia?] nicht identifiziert; (64r) Thesaurus pauperum, a.a.O.; (68r) Decretales Gregorii IX, lib. III, tit. 35, cap. 6. Ed: Corpus iuris canonici, Bd. 2, Leipzig 1879, Sp. 599f.}

