\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1r-265rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Missale Frisingense ad usum monasterii Tegernseensis}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (1r) Kalendar f\u252 \'fcr Tegernsee (mit Calendarium Missalis Frisingensis \u252 \'fcbereinstimmend).  \endash  (4ra) Proprium de tempore, pars hiemalis: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9bIn nomine Ihesu Christi Domini nostri incipit missale monasterij sancti Quirini in Tegernsee secundum consuetudinem sancte Romane ecclesie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominica prima in Aduentu Domini ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (91va) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Gloria in excelsis Deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b mit Hufnagelnotation. \endash  (92ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Simbolum nicenum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b mit Hugnagelnotation. \endash  (92va) Missae, orationes, tractus, sequentiae: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tempore pascali oratio de Beata Virgine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (102ra-113v) Praefationes, canon missae, nachtr\u228 \'e4glich eingeschoben: (102ra) Praefationes.  \endash  (105r) Canon missae: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Te, igitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  (113v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De conceptione beatissime Virginis prefatio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Per quam maiestatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... // Text bricht ab. \endash  (114ra) Missae votivae et diversae: Anfang fehlt.  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 //cidiua et hac virginea forte claruit Vrsula sancta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash    ... (120vb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 O Virgo, o domina, o mater, o regina sancta Maria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .  \endash    \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1532\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .  \endash  (121ra) Proprium de tempore, pars aestivalis. \endash   ... (153v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit missale de tempore anno 1467\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (154ra) Proprium de sanctis, von Andreas bis Katharina. \endash  (247ra) Commune sanctorum.  \endash  (248ra) Missae votivae et de sanctis. \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Missa de quatuordecim priuilegiatis auxilatoribus...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (253ra) Sequentiae et prosae. \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sequentia de apostolis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b (AH 55,4) ... \endash  ... (255ra) illi sperantes in te Amen (AH 54, 92).  \endash  (255va) Officia de parentibus B. Virginis Mariae \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De sanctissima Anna matre Marie ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (258va) Missae votivae et diversae: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1517. Officium misse de immaculata concepcione beatissime Virginis Marie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...\u8249 \'8b \endash  (261va-262va) Register der collectae, missae, sequentiae.   \endash  (263ra) Missae votivae et diversae \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9bMissa de mortalitate hominum ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash   ... (265rb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 mereatur protectione defendi. Per Dominum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  252vb, 255rb, 262vb, 263vb, 265v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: Missale Frisingense : mit dem Mandat von Sixtus von Tannberg, Bischof von Freising, Freising 31. 8. 1487; Sequentiae: AH,  u.a.: AH IX, Nr. 332;  44, Nr. 258;  54, Nr. 182.}

