\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\cbpat8\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (IIr) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nota de purgatorio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Quanta sit pena purgatorij\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (IIv) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1474 vigilia fuit in dominica\plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Beatus venter \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Lc 11,12)\u8249 \'8b \endash  (IIIr) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De ascensione 1459\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hodie Dominus nomen tuum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  (Jdt 13,25)\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hec verba\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [litteraliter?]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  scribuntur de Judith que cum vicisset\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (IVr) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De dileccione Dei et maximo mandato ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Interrogavit Ihesum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (Mt 22,35)\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Postquam Ihesus soluit hanc questionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (Vr) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De sancto Martino nudum operire\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash   \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cum videris nudum .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .. (Is 58,7)\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Hoc adimplevit beatus Martinus de necessario sibi pallio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et non superfluo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash   (XIVra-XXv)  Alphabetisches Sachregister \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tabula pro materijs sequentibus secundum alpabetum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (XXIVv-XXXIIv) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Certa puncta ex decretis Gratiani per alphabetum collecta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1460\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (273v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Anno 1472 in dedicatione ecclesie beatissime virginis Marie in Schongau\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ingressus Ihesus perambulabat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Lc 19,1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Egressus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [...] ingressus \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 locales \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...   \endash   (274v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9bAnno 1472 In dedicacione Rattenpuch\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b (Rottenbuch ?) \endash  [...]  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hodie huic domui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Lc 19,9)\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hec sunt verba Ihesu qui est salus iuxta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (275r) Notae (dt., unleserlich) \endash  Schemata zu \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 infernus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 purgatorium \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 etc.  \endash  Dt. Worterkl\u228 \'e4rungen zu synderesis, intellectus, voluntas, memoria ...   \endash  (275v)  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Abusiones nunc in mundo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Olim ecclesie basse et tenebrose\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ciuis quidam inter duo castra in agro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ? \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 audivit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  276rv leer.
