\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 3r-67v  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Petrus de Rosenheim}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Roseum memoriale divinorum eloquiorum}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (3r-8v) Prologe: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Reuerendissimo in Christo patri et domino domino Brande\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Multi conati sunt sacre scripture textum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash   (6r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit prologus prosaicus. Incipit prologus metricus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \u8249 \'8b (6v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Rore tuo, Christe, riga mentem michi lustra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  (8v-14r) Canones: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Canon primus declarat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \u8249 \'8b (9r)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Sicut ex iniuncto accepi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash   (14v-15v) Epilog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Astra polum iuncta terra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (16r) nachgetragene \u220 \'dcberschrift:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Tetrasticon operis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Non possum, ut absentibus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash   (16v) nachgetragene \u220 \'dcberschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ordo librorum biblie.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ex omnibus predictis colligitur alia tabula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  (17r-67r) Text. Nachgetragene \u220 \'dcberschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Liber genesis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Astripotens genesi celum terram ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 angelus ostendit se nec adoret, ait\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash   (67r) Schlussverse: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ecce Ihesu domini claudo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sacre scripture cui sit bene scribere cure. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  (67v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Finito libro sit laus et gloria Christo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  [D]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 e petra suxi petrus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ...  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sacre scripture cui sit bene scribere cure. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit roseum memoriale diuinorum eloquiorum compilatum per fratrem Petrum de Rosenhaim monachum mellicensem ordinis sancti Benedicti. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  69r-70v leer\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Im Auftrag des Kardinals Giulio Brandi di Castiglione 1423/26 verfasst. Druck: Hain 13988-91. Vgl. Stegm\u252 \'fcller, RB 4, Nr. 6836; Walther, Initia carminum, 1648. \endash  \u220 \'dcber Petrus de Rosenheim:  2VL 7, Sp. 518-521; Franz Xaver Thoma, Petrus von Rosenheim. O.S.B., in: Studien und Mitteilungen zur Geschichte des Benediktinerordens 45 (1927), S. 94-222 (Hs. genannt S. 123, Anm. 3)}

