\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (71r) Canon (Akrostichon): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Canon sequentis carminis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Lege metri memoranda dedi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (71v) Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In regulam sancti Benedicti memoriale capitulorum mente tenendorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash   (71v-74r) Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit memoriale capitulorum regule sancti Benedicti per fratrem P\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [etrum] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 editus monachis de Medlicensi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 monasterio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1   \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Abbati monachos Benedictus dans heremitas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 qui maiora cupis perfice facta patrum Amen. \endash  Explicit regula.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  74ar-v: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nota de humilitate, 12 gradus humilitatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (Verse): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Iustorum graduum primus timet \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... . \endash  74v-75v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Thoma, wie oben; Die gelehrte Korrespondenz der Br\u252 \'fcder Pez. Text, Regesten, Kommentare Band 1: 1709\endash 1715, Brief 288 (Hs. genannt S. 479); Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Clm 4423,121r-122v, Clm 20203,114r-151v. Melk, Benediktinerstift, Cod. 88 (119, B 89), 64-171. Walther, Initia 156.  \endash  Zu den 12 gradus humilitatis: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Suppl. n\u176 \'b0 2882a, p. 185. Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Clm 20203,151v-152r.}

