\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (6r-63v) Liber ordinarius von 1. Januar bis 31 Dezember:  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Januarius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Circumcisio Domini nostri nostri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Jesu Christi. Duplex maius. Officium abbatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (14r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9bPassio sancti Quirini martyris. Duplex minus. Officium prioris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b  \endash  (47r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Translatio sancti Quirini regis et martyris. Duplex maius. Officium abbatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (62rv) Schaltzettel: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Infra quamlibet octauam  habetur suffragium sic\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  ... (63v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Et de sancta Martina virgine et martyre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .   \endash  (64r-132v) Regeln: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9bRegule generalis huius breviarii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In predicto calendario et regulis sequentibus reperitur quintuplex differentia festorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (71v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tabula sequens est pro inventione regule in vnoquoque anno\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \u8249 \'8b \endash   (72rv) Tabelle f\u252 \'fcr Januar und Februar. \endash  (73r) Weitere Regeln 1-36 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Regula prima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b  \endash  (107a) Schaltzettel: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Anno Domini 1530 in die Cinerum non venerunt vetuli? de parrochijs propter cinerationem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (132v)\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 concordat omnia cum precedent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 i\u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b1525\u8249 \'8b  \endash  133rv leer.  \endash  (134r-138r) Rubriken \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Rubrice generales\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b  \endash   \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In primis vesperis festorum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...\u8249 \'8b  \endash  ... (138r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nisi alii assignentur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \u8250 \'9b1525\u8249 \'8b \endash  1r-5v, 138v-143v leer. \endash  HS: Vermerk zur Foliierung, datiert 8.7.56.}

