\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 (172r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Flores edificatorij ex scriptis domini Petri de Aylliaco episcopi Cameracensis ecclesie doctoris egregii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Fides\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 est directio cognicionis in\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rationali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  (173v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Augustinus de vera et falsa penitentia dicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Qui peccat et gratiam suam recuperare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (174r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Prouerbium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Pist der teufel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  (184v)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Verse (dt.) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ach lieber gott von himel reich\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  (187r) Sprichw\u246 \'f6rter (lat. und dt.): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sola miseria ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (Walther, Proverbia, Nr, 29931) \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 War gott lends ends\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Wiltu nix meiden ... (H\u246 \'f6ver, S. 29, Nr. 174) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  (188v) Verse (dt.) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Recht thon hat mich betrogen \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (198r-199r) Schemata zu den Begriffen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 amor, anima, animus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  usw. \endash  (202v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quidam doctor predicat in Augusta sic\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Du solt dein zungen pinden\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (H\u246 \'f6ver, S. 18, Nr. 25) \endash  (204v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Die siben gab des heiligen geist\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (Schema) \endash  175r, 200rv, 202r, 205v-222v leer.
