\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [53]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (2ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Die festo penthecostes postilla sermo primus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b (nachtr\u228 \'e4glich hinzugef\u252 \'fcgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 magistri Jordani\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Si quis diligit me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Jo 14,23) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Imperator cum sollempnitate processurus vexillum suo signo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2[54]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (5ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Postilla sermo secundus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Paraclitus autem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 spiritus sanctus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Jo 14,26) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Secunda pars principalis sermonis precedentis. In qua postquam posuit effectus spiritus sancti \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3[55]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (7va) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Postilla sermo tercius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Jam non multa loquar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b ... (Jo 14,30) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tercia pars principalis iuxta divisione sermonis supra 53. In qua saluator noster apostolos contra hostem roborat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (18vb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sequitur quarta pars principalis tocius operis. Prima enim tractat de Christi incarnacione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quarta de nostra erudicione usque ad finem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (18vb-20ra) Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Expeditus cum Dei adiutorio tribus partibus operis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 198\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (211va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9bMoraliter sermo secundus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tunc qui in iudea sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Lc 21,21) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In verbis istis saluator docet quibus remedijs et cautelis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... (213rb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ecce quod erit in fino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sine fine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . Quo nos perducere dignetur ... Amen. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 199\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (213rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De sancta trinitate sermo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [vt] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 supra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 O alcitudo diviciarum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Rom 11,33) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quamvis apostolus raptus fuerit in tercium celum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 200\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (214va) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Homo quidam fecit ce\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 nam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Lc 14,16) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Homo iste Ihesus Christus est qui ex magna dileccione quam ad homines habuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash ... (215va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et abiens laqueo se suspendit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  216rv leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Hier von Pfingsten bis 25. Sonntag (s. Anmerkung auf f. 209va) nach Pfingsten (= Pars IV), Nr. 199-200 wohl sp\u228 \'e4ter nachgetragen. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , RLS, Bd. 3, S. 816-824, Nr. 79-134 (hier 1-198) \endash   Druck: GW M15120 \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Zumkeller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , Manuskripte Nr. 648, S. 302-310, Hs. genannt.}

