\par \pard\sl252\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa165\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u220 \'dc (nachtr\u228 \'e4glich von Schreiberhand): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hanc questionem dictauit honorabilis relligiosus pater Iohannes dictus de Spira monachus ordinis beati Benedicti professus monasterii Mellicensis diocesis Pataviensis ad instanciam venerabilis in Christo patris domini Johannis abbatis Monasterii beate virginis Marie scotorum Wyennensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Utrum Monachus qui contra preceptum sui prelati comedit carnes peccet mortaliter. Pro huius questionis solucione noto primo, quod secundum magistrum Johannem Gerson \u8230 \'85 alicui voluntas sui superioris nec per illam velit ligare non consurgit obligacio etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .
