\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hand Schwerzenbecks: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Responsio cuiusdam docti virj super quedam argumenta contra aliqua dicta in questione de esu carnium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Honorabilis ac religiose pater, aliquamdiu est quod misistis michi quedam argumenta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Argumenta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Primo sic arguitis. In probacione tercie conclusionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Scripta quoque vestra quia iam habeo rescripta vestre caritati cum magna graciarum accione remitto. Valete etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .
