\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1ra-71vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Thomas Vercellensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 :  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Extractio in libros Ps.-Dionysii Areopagitae}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (1ra) Prolog. \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Prefatio abbatis Vercellensis super extracciones 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 or\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  librorum Dionisij magni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quin in libris magni Dyo[nis]ij Ariopagite geminam experirer difficultatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (1rb) Text.   \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit extractio verzellensis super iiii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 or\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  libros Dyonisii. Capitulum i\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 m\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . ... \u8249 \'8b De caelesti hierarchia: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Omne bonum datum naturalium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  (19ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Signa reuerendorum sanctorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ecclesiastice ierarchie traditio et que eius intentio. Capitulum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b De ecclesiastica hierarchia: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 O Thymothee qui pluribus iustis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  (34ra)  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit ierarchia ecclesiastica. Incipit de diuinis nominibus. Capitulum i\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 m\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De divinis nominibus: Post librum de diuinis caracteribus ... \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (65rb)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1   \u8250 \'9bExplicit de diuinis nominibus. Tractatus seu translatio abbatis vercellensis super misticam theologiam Dyonisij ad Thimotheum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b (65va) De mystica theologia: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Trinitas supersubstantialis superdea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit tractatus verzellensis de mistica theologia Dyonisij\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit translatio abbatis verzellensis in epistolam Dyonisij ad Tytum pontificem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b  (67vb) Epistula ad Titum: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 O Tyte, tot a me didicit Thimotheus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  ... (71vb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 iuxta consonanciam scripturarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Druck: Exposi\u231 \'e7\u227 \'e3o sobre os livros do Beato Dionisio Areopagita, Hrsg. von Manuel Alonso, Lissabon 1957, S. 509-671 (ohne den Brief an Titus). \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \endash  Brief an\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Titus: Dionysiaca I, S. 713-717. Literatur zur Text\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Gabriel Th\u233 \'e9ry, s.o.}

