\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (71vb) Kommentar zu De caelesti hierarchia (Auszug):  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Excerpta de Lynconiensi super angelica ierarchia\u8249 \'8b  \u8250 \'9bLinconiensis\u8249 \'8b  angelice ierarchie 1\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Non est enim possibile c\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Thearchicus radius nobis adhuc infirmis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \endash   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (82ra) \u220 \'dcbersetzung des Robertus Grosseteste:  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit commentum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (korrigiert in \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 translacio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Linconiensis de mistica theologia Dyonisii.  Capitulum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8249 \'8b  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Trinitas supersubstantialis superdea ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \endash  (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 83va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 )\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Kommentar zu De mystica theologia \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit commentum Hugonis de S Victore super translationem Iohannis Scoti in misticam theologiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (korrigiert in:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Incipit commentum Linconiensis de mistica theologia. Capitilum i\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 m\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Trinitas supersubstantialis ... Mistica theologia est secretissima et non iam per speculum ...  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \endash   ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (94va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a perfectis beneuole suppleri etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Druck: De caelesti hierarchia: Candice Taylor Hogan, Robert Grosseteste, Pseudo-Dionysius and Hierarchy: A Medieval Trinity, PhD diss., Cornell University 1991, \u220 \'dcbersetzung: Dionysiaca I, S. 565-602; De mystica theologia: Mystical theology: The Glosses by Thomas Gallus and the Commentary of Robert Grosseteste on De mystica theologia, hrsg. von James McEvoy, Paris 2003, S. 64-120. Literatur zur Text\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Th\u233 \'e9ry\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20\cf1 ,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  s. o.}

