\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 94va-184vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Hugo de Sancto Victore}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Commentarii in libros Ps.-Dionysii Areopagitae}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (94va) Kommentar zu De mystica theologia: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In nomine Domini incipit commentum domini magistri Hugonis de Sancto Victore super translationem Iohannis Scoti in misticam theologiam sancti Dyonisij episcopi ad Thymotheum cum textu interlineariter glozato\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b (94vb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quid diuina caligo. Capitulum I\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Trinitas superessencialis et superdeus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  S\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 uperessentialis natura causa est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (103ra) Kommentar zu De caelesti hierarchia. \u220 \'dcberschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hugo de S. Victore super angelica ierarchia Dyonisij magnj\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De differentia mundane theologie atque diuine et demonstracionibus earum\u8249 \'8b Iudei signa querunt et greci sapienciam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... (184vb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sapientia transcendit, sanctitas condescendit. Deo gratias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  185rv leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Druck: De mystica theologia: Verfasserschaft unsicher. Nicht ediert. De caelesti hierachia: PL 175, Sp. 923\endash 1154.}

