\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1 (223r) \u220 \'dcberschrift von Hand Schwerzenbecks: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Omelia beati Augustini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In principio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  (Joh 1,1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nos diximus uerba cum loqueremur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 qui  manducare  non  poteras\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (224r) \u220 \'dcberschrift von Hand Schwerzenbecks:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Omelia beati Gregorii pape\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  In illo tempore dixit Ihesus Homo quidam peregre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Mt 25,14) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Leccio sancti ewangelij, fratres karissimi, solicite nos admonet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (225v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Audi qui negas Deum genuisse filium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (226r)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Deus noster Ihesus Christus et venit ad homines\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (227v)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  redde quod promisisti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Druck: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Augustinus (GND 118505114 http://d-nb.info/gnd/118505114), In Ioannis evangelium tractatus CXXIV, I, 8-13 (Auszug), CCSL 36, S. 4-8. \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Gregorius Magnus (GND 118541838\~http://d-nb.info/gnd/118541838),  Homiliae in Evangelia, 9, CCSL 141, S. 58-64. \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Quodvultdeus \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs20\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 (GDN 118968289 http://d-nb.info/gnd/118968289), Adversus quinque haereses, IV-V, C\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 CSL 60 (Auszug), S. 275-279. \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Augustinus (GDN 118968289 http://d-nb.info/gnd/118968289), Sermones de Scripturis, 108, PL 38, Sp. 632-635.}

