\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit optimus tractatus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (radiert:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  cuiusdam doctissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 magistri Nicolai Khempf ordinis cartusiensium i\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [d est?] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 de religiosorum profectibus et perfectione diligenter legendus etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quod sola discrecio religiosis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Capitulum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Bonum est sal\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (Lc 14,34). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sal discrecionem significat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...\endash ... \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 de qua tamen posterius lacius dicetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  bone Ihesu. Explicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash   \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1458\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sanctissime et individue Trinitatis ... Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Anno domini 1458 in vigilia sancti Johannis Baptiste \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1458 Juni 23]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  per manus peripsimatis omnium in patria exulantis et in exilio patriantis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [...]\u8249 \'8b
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: Pez, Bibliotheca ascetica, IX, 380-532. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 VL 4, wie oben, Nr. 6 (Hs. genannt); Martin, Fifteenth-century Carthusian reform, wie oben: S. 283-284 (Hs. genannt).}

