\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hand Schwerzenbecks: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tabula seu registrum in Manipulum curatorum domini Guidonis de Monte Rocherii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  (27ra) Inhaltsverzeichnis: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In isto libello sunt tres particule\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (27vb) Hand Schwerzenbecks: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Manipulus curatorum domini Guidonis de septem sacramentis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  Widmung: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Reuerendo in Christo patri ac domino domino Raymundo diuina prouidencia sancte sedis Valencie episcopo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (28ra) Prologus: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quoniam secundum quod dicit propheta Malachias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (28vb) Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sciendum ergo quod omnia sacramenta noue legis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... (95rb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et pro me peccatore ad Deum preces fundat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit Guido de sacramentis. >Tegernsee\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 < \endash  95v-97v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\cbpat8\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: GW 11716-11834. Guido of Monte Rochen. Handbook for Curates. A Late Medieval Manual on Pastoral Ministry. With an introduction by Anne T. Thayer and Katharine J. Lualdi. Washington (D.C.) 2011 (Medieval Texts in Translation).}

