\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\cbpat8\itap0 1ra-193ra {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Clemens VI papa}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Sermones de tempore et de sanctis
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa30\cbpat8\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (1ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 pape Clementis 6\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ti\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 erg\u228 \'e4nzt Schwerzenbeck) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 quando fuit passagium concessum coram prelatis Parisius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .\u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Deum timete\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (1Petr 2,17) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In quibus verbis beatus Petrus duo nobis ostendit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (5vb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo in die Natiuitatis Domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ortus est sol\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Ps 103,22) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Videtis ad sensum quod sol super omnes planetas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (7vb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de circumcisione Domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Vestitus erat veste\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Apoc. 19,3) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Proposituri verbum Dei de verbo Dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (44r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Item sermo tercius de purificatione gloriose Virginis Marie etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Illa venit ad eum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Gn 8,11) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sicut sapientis est veritatem non deserere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (66va) Interpolation einer Predigt von Arnestus de Pardubice \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Collatio facta per archiepiscopum Pragensem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In te oculi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (1Reg 1,20\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Verba sunt Bersabee ad regem Dauid postulantis regnum filio suo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (169ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de sancto Johanne Baptista\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quis putas puer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Lc 1,66) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Videtur michi quod sapientes et prudentes consueuerunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (176vb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de sancto Johanne Ewangelista\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Testimonium perhibuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Apoc 1,2) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sicut innuunt verba predicta proposituri sumus verbum Dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... (193ra) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 unus et verus deus per omnia secula seculorum amen. Explicit etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  193rb leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\cbpat8\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , RLS 4, S. 758-768 (Hs. genannt). Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung der Predigt Arnestus\lquote  de Pardubice: Krakau, BJ 1235, f.93v-97r (pro Carolo IV in regem Romanorum eligendo, a. 1346). Diana \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Wood\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , The Sermon Literature of Pope Clement VI. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Studies in Church History\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  11 (1975), S. 163-172.}

