\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u220 \'dcberschrift von Hand Schwerzenbecks: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Questiones super 4to Sententiarum magistri Johannis Herrer de Haylprunn\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Circa quartum librum Sententiarum queritur vtrum in quolibet hominum statu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...\u8249 \'8b \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Honor, virtus et fortitudi per infinita secula seculorum amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Hec dubia quarti libri Sententiarum sunt magistri Johannis Harrer de Hailprunna collecta per eundem ac lecta ab eodem in alma vniuersitate studij Wiennensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash   \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Finita in profesto santi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Gregorii sub anno Domini etc. 59 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1459 Apr. 22] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 in eis quoque studentes orent pro collectore ac scriptore eorundem, videlicet magistro Johanne Harrer in sacre theologie baccalaureo formato\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  368rv leer.
