\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (96r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit Cronica pontificum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ihesus Christus altissimi Dei filius ante secula in deitate \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... (128v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ecclesieque katholice cui presidet pacem nobisque cum ipso vitam ac requiem sempiternam Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Finitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  hec pagina pontificum ... Rescribendo finitur in Purkhausen castro penultima die Januarij \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 anno domini m\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  cccc\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  lxvi\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . In quo yems precedente incensione februarij fuit  frigidissima, scilicet vsque ad octavam epiphanie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [13. Jan.] ...  \endash  (129ra-130va)  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Registrum summorum pontificum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (131r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hic iam de presulibus ecclesie Ratisponensis annotabitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In Cronica magistri Conradi de monte Puelle\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  ... (136v)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Dominus Fridericus Parsperg decretorum licenciatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  130vb-130ar leer. \endash   (130ab) Notiz zur Edition (Bleistift) \endash  136ar-fv leer.
