\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 S. 1a-50b   \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Durandus: Quaestiones in Artem veterem
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (S. 1a) Super Porphirium: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quia \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [...] (Tinte stark abgerieben, unleserlich) \endash  (S.1b) Quaestio 2.: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Consequenter queritur utrum de universali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (S. 10a) Super librum Praedicamentorum: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Equivoca dicuntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . Circa librum Predicamentorum primo queritur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (S. 29b) Quaestiones super librum Perihermenias: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Primum oportet. Queritur utrum enuntiatio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash   (S. 41a) Quaestiones super librum VI Principiorum:  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Circa librum sex principiorum queritur utrum de eis possit esse scientia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 elencum quare etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [...] \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Finis adest operis, mercedem posco laboris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Expliciunt questiones Durandi etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .\u8249 \'8b
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Charles Lohr, Medieval Latin Aristotle Commentaries. Authors A-F, Traditio 23 (1967), S. 313-413, hier S. 401-402 (Hs. genannt).}

