\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (2r-11v) Alphabetisches Sachregister. \endash  11ar-11bv leer. \endash  (12r) Besitzvermerk u. Inhaltsverzeichnis, tw. von Hand Schwerzenbecks, Notiz. \endash  12v-12av leer.  \endash  (13ra) \u220 \'dcberschrift:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Apiarius Thome Brabantini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit prologus in librum de apibus quem bonum vniuersale uocat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Reuerendo in Christo patri, fratri Humberto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Rogatus instantissime a quibusdam familiaribus meis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (13rb)  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit prologus. Incipit prefatio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Unum caput Christum in vnitate ecclesie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash   (13va) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De bono prelato capitulum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 m\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Rex, inquit, apum mellei coloris est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...\endash ... (134ra)  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 illum tamquam me participem faciat Ihesus Christus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit liber vocatus bonum vniuersale anno ab incarnacione Domini millesimo cccc\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  quinquagesimo quinto feria quarta proxima ante Nativitatis gloriose Virginis Marie \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1455 Sept 4]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  per fratrem Johannem professum in Tegernsee\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Deo gratias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  1rv leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: Julia Burkhardt, Von Bienen lernen. Das Bonum universale de apibus des Thomas von Cantimpr\u233 \'e9 als Gemeinschaftsentwurf (Analyse, Edition, \u220 \'dcbersetzung, Kommentar), 2 Bde., Regensburg 2020.}

