\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u220 \'dcberschrift von Hand Schwerzenbeck: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Communiloquium Johannis Galensis de ordine Fratrum minorum vel Summa collectionum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1   \endash  (135ra) Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cum collacionis huius que potest dici summa collacionum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (137rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit prefacio in summam collacionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cum doctor \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 durchgestrichen] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 siue predicator\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (139ra) Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Et quoniam res publica, ut dictum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...\endash ... (231rb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 qua illuminante studeant adinvenire\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit summa colleccionum Johannis Galensis scripta per me fratrem Oswaldum Nott professum in Tegernsee\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  231v-233v leer.
