\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 2r-121v  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Gerardus de Fracheto}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Vitae fratrum ordinis praedicatorum}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (2r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit prologus in vitas fratrum ordinis predicatorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  Epistula: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dilectis in dilecto Dei filio fratribus predicatoribus viniuersis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (2v-3r) \u220 \'dcbersicht der Distinctionen und Kapitel \endash  (3r) Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b Quod domina nostra ordinem fratrum predicatorum impetravit a filio. Capitulum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Fuit ante institucionem ordinis predicatorum monachus quidam vitam ducens honestam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... (117v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 multum est oblacionum proventibus augmentata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  Kanonisationsbulle v. Innozenz IV des hl. Petrus Martyr (24./25. M\u228 \'e4rz 1253): \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit littera canonisacionis beati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (118r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Petri martiris de ordine fratrum predicatorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Innocencius episcopus seruus seruorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Magnis et crebris declarata prodigiis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  ... (121v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Finis fratrum predicatorum vitas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Rescriptum 1470\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b  \endash  121a-v \endash  121c-v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ed.: Benedikt Maria Reichert, Fratris Gerardi de Fracheto O.P. Vitae fratrum ordinis praedicatorum ..., Rom 1897 (Monumenta Ordinis Fratrum Praedicatorum Historica, 1). \endash  Kaeppeli Nr. 1282 (Hs genannt). \endash  Kanonisationsbulle:  BHL 6722}

