\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Von Schwerzenbeck erg\u228 \'e4nzt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Sequens dyalogus diuiditur in sex partiales libros\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Incipit liber dyalogorum sancti Johannis Crisostomi constantinopolitani episcopi et sancti Basilij Cesariensis episcopi college beati Gregorij Nazaneni de dignitate sacerdocij\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Johannes \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Michi quidem multi fuerunt amici certim\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (lies \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 certi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8230 \'85  \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 in eternum tuum recipias tabernaculum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b   \endash   \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Explicit liber dyalogorum Johannis Crisostomi et Basilij beatissimorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b
