\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Oben nachgetragen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Autor videtur beatus Bernhardinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Donatus de octo partibus orationis spiritualibus siue diuinalibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b (161vb) Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Ewangelica clamat historia: Sine intermissione \u8230 \'85  \endash   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 (162vb) Kapitelverzeichnis. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 (163ra) Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Partes orationis quot sunt? Octo. Que? Deuocio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \endash   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8230 \'85 (201va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 quam cognicionem eternaliter nobis concedat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8250 \'9b1477. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Explicunt octo partes orationis diuinales. Et uidetur autor esse sanctus Bernhardinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  
