\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u220 \'dcberschrift von Hand Schwerzenbecks: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Consilium datum et responsio data facultatis juris canonici vniuersitatis studii wienensis domino reuerendissimo archiepiscopo Saltzpurgensi editus per magistrem Narcissum Hertz de Perching doctorem in theologia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash   Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Diuersis in diuina ac humana lege peritis super modis tollendi scisma \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85  \endash   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 pace et vnione obtinenda. Explicit.  \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Notiz zum Verfasser: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nota quod presentis scripti notula maior est consilium siue responsio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 editum est per olim egregium virum magistrum Narcissum Hertz de Perching\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 facultate (!) theologie professorem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85  \endash  77rb leer.
