\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u220 \'dcberschrift: 1498. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Bulla suspensionis indulgentiarum propter futurum annum iubilei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Text. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Alexander episcopus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Consueverunt romani pontifices predecessores nostri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  Datiert: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Rome\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 nno incarnationis dominice m\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  cccc 98 pridie idus aprilis pontificatus nostri anno 6\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 to \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1498 Apr. 12]  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Anno a nativitate domini m\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ccc  98\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 littere affixe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 notificate ac publicate fuerunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 per me Bartholomeum Peroz sanctissimi domini nostri pape cursoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . Nachtr\u228 \'e4glich korrigiert: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ita est Petrus Melleye sanctissimi domini nostri pape cursor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 215v-219v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: GW 899.}

