\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (2a-r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Oracio valde deuota et compunctoria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Domine Deus meus da cordi meo desiderare te ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  (26r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipiunt orationes per totam ebdomadam distinctas secundum ferias ebdomade videlicet ad patrem, filium, spiritum sanctum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...\u8249 \'8b  \endash  (40r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Oratio preambula ad canonicum servicium septem horarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \u8249 \'8b \endash  (59r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Refertur quod quicumque sequentem orationem quottidie dixerit trecentos dies indulgenciarum obtinebit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \u8249 \'8b \endash  (71v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 subuenite apud Deum et Dominum nostrum Ihesum Christum qui viuit et r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [egnat] \endash  72rv leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Gebete zu Heiligen und Engeln, zum Schutzengel, sowie (41r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 contra immundas cogitaciones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , (46r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 pro expellendo tedio et acquirendo sensu spirituali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  usw.}

