\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 IIvr-95r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Ps.-Augustinus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : Ad fratres in eremo commorantes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 IIvr-95r \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ps.-Augustinus: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Ad fratres in eremo commorantes}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (IIv) Verzeichnis der Predigten von Hand Schwerzenbecks. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (1r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipiunt sermones sancti Augustini episcopi ad fratres heremitas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De superbia et humilitate. Sermo sancti Augustini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Fratres mei karissimi, vbi superbia fuerit, ibi contumelia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (2r)  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo sancti Augustini de obedientia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Fratres mei dilectissimi, obedire oportet Deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (3r)  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo sancti Augustini de fortitudine \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (durchgestrichen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et caritate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 )\u8249 \'8b \endash   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Qvia in hac vasta solitudine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 30\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (84v)  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de filio prodigo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Pax uobis, dilectissimi fratres, qui optimam partem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 31\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (87v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo in cena Domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b  \endash  (88r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Avdiuimus, fratres karissimi, quod cum Dominus intinxisset \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...   \endash  ... (95r)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  in vera pace faciat perseurare \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash   \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Expliciunt sermones \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [hinzugef\u252 \'fcgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 31\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  beatissimi Augustini de vita heremitica et solitaria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Inuenti per venerabilem patrem et dominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (hinzugef\u252 \'fcgt:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Robertum de Vardicz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (Robert de Bardis))\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  cancellarium parisiensem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (hinzugef\u252 \'fcgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Anno domini m\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ccc\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  lxxxvi\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 )\u8249 \'8b \endash  95v leer.
