\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (9r) \u220 \'dcberschrift von Hand Schwerzenbecks:  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Egloga episcopi Theodoli Atheniensis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash  Text:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ethiopum terras iam feruida\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... Glosse: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Illorum hominum mansiones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...  (20r) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cunctos tibi sterne superbos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (21r) \u220 \'dcberschrift von Hand Schwerzenbecks: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Commentum et declaratio Theodoli. Et fabule super Theodolum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Scribit philosophus primo elencorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 gloriosum est enim\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...   \endash  ... (57r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sicut lesit Cain et Iudam. Pro cuius complemento gloria laus et honor sit omnipotenti Deo ... Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Finit fauste fabule super Theodolum 1474\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  20v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ed. der Ecloga: Osternacher 1902, 30-54. \endash  Bloomfield, Incipits, Nr. 334. Catalogus Translationum Et Commentariorum, Bd. 2: Theodulus, S. 400 (Hs. genannt).}

