\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (130ra-172ra) In Oseam: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explanacio Jeronimi presbiteri in Osee prophetam libri tres. Incipit prologus libri primi ad Pammachium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Si in explanationibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 omnium prophetarum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (172ra-189vb) In Ioelem: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit prologus Jeronimi in Johel prophetam ad Pammachium\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Non idem ordo est xii prophetarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (189vb-227ra) In Amos: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit prologus Jeronimi in Amos prophetam ad Pammachium, ut patet intuenti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amos propheta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 qui sequitur Johelem et est tercius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (227ra-236ra) In Abdiam: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit prologus Jeronimi in Abdiam prophetam ad Pammachium ut patet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cum essem par\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 uulus, ut paruulus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (236ra-249va) In Ionam:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8250 \'9bIncipit prologus Jeronimi in Jonam prophetam ad Cromacium papam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Triennivm circiter flvxit\u8249 \'8b postquam quinque prophetas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (249va-279vb) In Michaeam: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit prologus Jeronimi in Micheam prophetam ad Paulam et Eustochium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Micheas in qvem nvnc\u8249 \'8b commentarios dictare cupio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... (279vb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et paleis egipcias extruat ciuitates. Deo gracias. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Laus tibi Christe qui liber explicit iste\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...\u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Iste liber attinet monasterio Tegernsee quem reuerendus in Christo pater et dominus Conradus abbas ibidem comparauit anno millesimo quadringintesimo septuagesimo primo. Et est finitum in viglia Martini \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1471 Nov 10] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  280rv leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ed.: CCSL 76. \endash  CPL 589.}

