\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 Ir Besitzvermerk und Inhaltsverzeichnis von Hand Schwerzenbecks  \endash  Iv leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 1ra-185rb  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Beda Venerabilis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 In Lucae evangelium expositio}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (1ra) Epistola Accae episcopi ad Bedam: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Reverendissimi in Christo fratri et\u8249 \'8b consacerdoti Bede presbitero \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Acca\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b ... \endash  (1vb) Epistola responsoria: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Domino beatissimo et nimium desiderantissimo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Acca\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b ... \endash  (3ra) Inhaltsverzeichnis \endash  (6ra) Verzeichnis der lukanischen Perikopen: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipiunt tytuli evangelij Luce ut patet intuenti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (8rb) Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Beatus euangelista\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Lucas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 de omnibus que cepit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ihesus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 facere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (8va) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quoniam quidem multi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 conati sunt ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  ... (185rb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sed in laude Dei et benediccione concludit. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cristus scriptorem saluet per matris amorem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Mente tamen pia vnum petit aue Maria 1477\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Iste liber attinet monasterio Tegernsee quem reuerendus in Christo pater et dominus Conradus abbas ibidem comparauit anno millesimo quadringentesimo septuagesimo septimo et est finitus in die Oswaldi regis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b [1477 Aug 5]
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ed.: CCSL 120 \endash  CPL 1356; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , RB Nr. 1614.}

