\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (30ra) Nachtr\u228 \'e4gliche \u220 \'dcberschrift: Epistola \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit epistola Innocencij pape tercij ad Arnaldum Cisterciensem abbatem super sermones directa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Innocencius episcopus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Prophetica docet auctoritas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (30rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In aduentu domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b (hinzugef\u252 \'fcgt: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo Innocencij pape\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cvm venit plenitudo temporis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Gal 4,4) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In propositis verbis apostoli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (32ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominica prima de aduentu domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hora est \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Rom 3,11) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Significacio sompni multifarie spargitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1  3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (32vb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominica secunda in aduentu\u8249 \'8b Ecce veniet propheta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Deut. 18,18) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Propheta magnus intelligitur Christus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 67\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (99rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Item consecracionis romani pontificis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Qui habet sponsam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Joh. 3,29) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Paranimphus ait ista de sponso\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 68\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (100va) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In anniuersario Romani pontificis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Vos estis sal terre etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . (Mat. 5,13) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Veritas que falli non potest\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (101va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ad profectum vniuersalis ecclesie Jhesus Christus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Finis sub anno domini 1478\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  101vb-102v leer.
