\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 103ra-231va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Johannes Chrysostomus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Homiliae in epistulam Pauli ad Hebraeos}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (103ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In hoc corpore continetur commentum sancti Johannis episcopi Constantinopolitani in Epistola as Hebreos ex notis editum post eius obitum a Constantino prespitero Antioceno et translatum de greco in latinum a Muciano scolastico. Sermo primus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (103ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Multifarie multisque modis ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b (Hebr. 1,1-2) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Vere vbi habundauit delictum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Rom. 5,20) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hoc eciam in ipso exordio scribens ad Hebreos beatus Paulus insinuat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1  2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (106ra) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Qui est splendor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Hebr. 1,3) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Vbique quidem religioso nobis opus est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (110rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit sermo secundus. Incipit sermo tercius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Et cum iterum introducit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Hebr. 1,6-8) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Deus quidem noster\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 33\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (224vb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit sermo tricesimus secundus. Incipit tricesimus tercius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (225va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Proptera regnum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Hebr. 12,28-29) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Et inde sumpsit exoracionis et consolacionis argumentum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 34\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (228rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit sermo tricesimus tercius. Incipit sermo tricesimus quartus et ultimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Obaudite prepositis vestris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Hebr 13,17) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Malum quidem est ubi nullus est principatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... (231va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 gloriam offerentes domino nostro Ihesu Christo cum quo patri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit commentum Johannis episcopi Constantinopolitani ... translatum de greco in latinum a Muciano scolastico\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Iste liber attinet monasterio Tegernsee quem reuerendus in Christo pater et dominus Conradus abbas ibidem comparauit anno millesimo quadringentesimo octogesimo. Et est finitus in die Kyliani et sociorum eius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [1480 Juli 7] \endash  231vb leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ed.: PG 63, Sp. 237\endash 456 \endash  CPG 4440; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , RB, Nr. 4397.}

