\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (Iv) Nachtrag: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit dyalogus qui vocatur Scrutinium scripturarum ex libro uno impresso\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (1ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Scrutinium diuinarum scripturarum Pauli Burgensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b (von Hand Schwerzenbecks nachgetragen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Habens duas partes: prima pars est per modum dyalogi inter Paulum et Saulum. 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  pars dydascolica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  inter discipulum et magistrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Scrutamini scripturas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Jo 5,39)\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Christus volens Judeos instruere circa ipsius cognicionem in qua vita eterna consistit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (115rb) Secunda pars. \endash  ... (180rb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 homo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Christus Ihesus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 veritas est sine fallacia, bonitas sine malicia, felicitas sine miseria, cui honor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit tractatus domini Burgensis de fide katholica et perfidia iudeorum anno domini 1440\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 mo\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  die Veneris 13\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  mensis Maji etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .\u8249 \'8b \endash  180v-190v leer.
