\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Genesis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  Hand Schwerzenbeck: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Biblia beatissime virginis Marie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit biblia beate uirginis Marie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  Inhaltsverzeichnis \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Capitulum in libro Genesi. Maria est celum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In principio creauit deus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Genesis 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Celum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 scilicet enpireum per quod intelligitur domina mundi virgo Maria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et ad gloriam sempiternam me famulum tuum perducis Amen etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Conradus professus beate virginis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 in Rechenbach\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [Ratisbonensis] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 diocesis dictus Sweuus me scripsit cum fuit in\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Jo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [..]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u223 \'df\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 anno domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 m\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b ccc[c!] \u8250 \'9b38\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et compleuit in vigilia Michaelis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1438? Sept. 28]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . Attulit vero domino Ch\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [ristiano?] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 plebano sancti Georgij ad cuius peticionem et meritum precij subijt hunc laborem de dei gratia et compleuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 anno domini mo cccc\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  quinquagesimo quinto finitus et scriptus et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 iste libellus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  Nachtrag von Hand Schwerzenbecks: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sed nunc attinet monasterio sancti Quirini in Tegernsee\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .
