\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hand Schwerzenbecks: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Proprietates rerum naturalium adaptate sermonibus de tempore per totius anni circulum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  Auf oberem Rand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tria coegerunt Christum venire\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Avicenna dicit lapis intra aquam veniens quatuor in ea efficit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 non desinit auxiliari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .
