\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1ra-344rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Henricus de Langenstein}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Lectura super Genesim}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (1ra) Nachtrag: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit prologus magistri Hainrici de Hassia in lecturam super Genesim immo in tocius sacre scripture notificacionem atque eluccidacionem et protensus usque ad 12 folium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Lectura magistri Hainrici de Hassia super Genesim\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In principio creauit Deus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Gen 1,1)\u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hoc introducens beatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Augustinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 xj de Ciuitate dei capitulo tercio ita dicit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...  \endash  (12rb) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In principio creauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Gen 1,1)\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dimissis diuisionibus curiosis accipio illam diuisionem que magis consueta est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... (337ra) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sed et serpens erat callidior cunctis amantibus terre etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tibi Christe sit cum patre ayoque spiritu ympnus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit per me fratrem Oswaldum Nott de Tittmaning monachum et professum in Tegernsee. Anno domini m cccc lxvij\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  (337rb-344rb) Register der Rubriken mit Folioangaben: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Secuuntur rubrice istius libri cum quottis foliorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \u8249 \'8b \endash  (344rb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit per me fratrem Oswaldum Nott de Tittmaning monachum et professum in Tegernsee anno domini m cccc\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  lxvij\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  in die sancti Floriani\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [1467 Mai 4] \endash  177r, 241va, 344v-III\rquote  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Pars I. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , RB, Nr. 3188 iv-xi (Hs. genannt). \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 VL 3, Sp. 766-767 (Franz Joseph \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Worstbrock\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ).}

