\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 IIIr-193rb  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Vitae Patrum}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (IIIr) Alphabetisches Inhaltsverzeichnis: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Abstinencia miranda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (XIra) Heiligenverzeichnis: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Isti sancti descripti sunt de libro uitaspatrum qui subscribuntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (XIa-v) Schaltzettel: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Glosa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Fidelis lector, animaduerte, quia plures auctores apud latinos habuit vitaspatrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (1ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit prologus in primum librum vitaspatrum beati Jeronimi presbyteri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  Rufini Historia monachorum (=De vitis patrum liber II): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Benedictus dominus qui vvlt omnes homines saluos fieri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (2ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit prologus. Incipit primus liber vitaspatrum. De sancto Johanne\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (Hinzugef\u252 \'fcgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 egypcio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  heremita\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  Primum igitur tanquam vere fundamentum nostri operis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (45va) Verba Seniorum (=De vitis patrum liber III): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Uere mundum quis dubitet \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (45vb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Interrogauit quidam frater\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (146va) Verba Seniorum (=De vitis patrum liber IV): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ante hoc triennium quo tempore tibi Sulpici hinc abiens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (175va) Verba Seniorum (=De vitis patrum liber VII): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Omnino venerabili patri Martino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (175vb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quidam frater quemadmodum in cella propria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (188va) Aegyptiorum patrum sententiae: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Abbas Johannes dicebat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (193rb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sed esto pacificus cum omnibus et dabit tibi dominus requiem. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit quartus liber vitaspatrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b1471\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 I*r-III*v, Ir-IIv, Xv, XIv leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ed.: 1) Historia monachorum (BHL 6524): PL 21, 387-462; 2) De vitis patrum Lib. III (BHL 6525): PL 73, 739-753; 3) De vitis patrum Lib. IV (BHL 6526): PL 73, 813-848; 4) De vitis patrum liber VII (BHL 6531) PL 73, 1025-1062; 5) Aegyptiorum patrum sententiae (BHL 6535), PL 74, 381-392. Von der Edition tw. abweichend.}

