\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9bIncipit de Baronto monacho qui raptus fuit ad iudicium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  Memorare uobis volo, fratres karissimi, per ordinem quod moderno tempore ... \endash  ... Acta sunt hec omnia viii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ua\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Kalendas aprilis anno vi\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 to\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  regnante Theoderico rege francorum \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Gestrichen: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In die Egydij abbatis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1 Sept.] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1471\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b
