\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 202ra-228va  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Palladius Helenopolitanus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Historia Lausiaca}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (202ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit prologus Eraclidis viri religiosissimi discipuli sancti Anthonij ad Lausum episcopum in librum de conuersacione sanctorum patrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  Beatifico et admiror propositum tuum ... \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (202vb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cvm primum ad Allexandriam perrexissem ciuitatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (228va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 qui precesserunt dies paucos qui sequantur fore. \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit liber\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (hinzugef\u252 \'fcgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 excerpta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Heraclidis de conuersacione sanctorum patrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (hinzugef\u252 \'fcgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 qui eciam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ? \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Paradisus intitulatur alio nomine. 1472 in die sancti Marci euangeliste\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (25 Apr.)\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  228vb-235v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ed.: Die lateinische \u220 \'dcbersetzung der Historia Lausiaca des Palladius, Hrsg. Adelheid \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Wellhausen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Berlin 2003. Von der Edition tw. abweichend, Interpolationen, vgl. Commonitiones Sanctorum Patrum. Uma nova colec\u231 \'e7\u227 \'e3o de apotegmas, Hrsg. Jos\u233 \'e9 Geraldes \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Freire\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Coimbra, 1974.}

