\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (3r) Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit prohemium in fasciculum mirre passionis dominice alias in Soliloquium docens modum se disponendi digne ad colligendum hunc preciosum mirreum fasciculum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Fasciculus mirre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Ct 1,12)\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quamquam pater clementissimus misericordiarum et deus tocius consolacionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (12r) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit fasciculus mirre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \u8249 \'8b (13r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Primo die azimorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Mt 26,17)\u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Graciarum acciones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 tibi abo, o mi Domine Ihesu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  (119v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vnanimiter requirant, apprehendant, videant et benedicant hic et in eterna secula seculorum Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Et finit fasciculus dominice passionis collectus ex quodam deserto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 heremitico anno Domini m\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  cccc\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  octogesimo septimo. Commendat se collector huius in Domino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 O Ihesu Christe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b
