\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (222r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Adam creatus est 8 Kalendas aprilis feria 6\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  (222v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Da asija maiore et eius regionibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Asija maijor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 in tercia orbis parte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (233r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cronica regum persarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b[3]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cyrus regnavit 30 annos \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (236v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Rufinus Festus consul ad Ualentinianum imperatorem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Regnauerunt Rome per annos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (241r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ex secundo libro Honorij de ymagine mundi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Differentia est inter tempus et euum ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  (246r) De terra sancta: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ierusalem metropolis ciuitatum iuda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (257ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Regnum latinorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ortum est anno 687...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (bis zum 1452, f. 260va)  \endash  Liste der K\u246 \'f6nige und P\u228 \'e4pste (261ra-271v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Regum francie cathalogus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Priamus 5 annis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (264r, Schaltzettel) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Bela fuit rex ongarorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... (271v) \u8250 \'9b1471\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sixtus 4us de ordine fratrum minorum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  (272r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Post troiane ciuitatis excidium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (275ra) Am Rand: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ex libro ethimologiarum sancti Ysidori hispalensis archiepiscopi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Uascones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 dicuntur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (278r) Am Rand: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ex cronicis diuersis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Petrus apostolus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 constituit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 dici in missa pater noster\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... (282v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 annum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 expletum alteri si vult nubat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  256a-rv, 260b-rv, 262v leer, 264a-r\endash 264bv, 265v\endash 265a-v, 267v, 271a-r\endash 271f-v, 274a-rv, 277v\endash 277e-v, 282a-r\endash 282-ev leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ausz\u252 \'fcge, u.a. aus Rufus Festus, Breviarium historiae Romanae; Honorius Augustodunensis, De imagine mundi.
