\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (Iv) Verzeichnis der Themata mit Folioangaben. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (1ra) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Benedictus qui venit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Mt 21,9). Wiederholung der Bibelstelle. \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ewangelium hodiernum quod lectum est in officio misse de aduentu domini, legitur eciam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (3rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominica secunda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Erunt signa in sole\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 (Lc 21,25).\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Pro introductione ewangelij est notandum, quod postquam dominus Ihesus Christus feria tertia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (5vb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominica tercia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tu es qui venturus es\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 (Mt 11,3).\u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hoc presens ewangelium continet in se valde notabilia duo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1  63\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (170va) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominica 23\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b[A]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 beuntes Phariseij consilium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 inierunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 (Mt 22,15). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nuper sub cesare Augusto Iudea subiecta romanis, quando in toto orbe terrarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 64\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (173va) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominica vl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b[L]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 oquente Ihesu ad turbas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ecce princeps \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 (Mt 9,18). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Pro salute nostra saluator noster ad terras descendit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... (174rb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 infirmitates temporales et penas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (174va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 eternas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 quod nobis concedit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Benedictus Deus etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  151v, 152r, 175rv leer.
