ncta Katherina\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9b[D]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 omine deus meus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \u8249 \'8b(Sir 51,13). \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Consuetudo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  est enim regum et principum quod nobiles suos \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... (245va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 orationes ad Christum conuertit. Rogemus etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .
