\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (1ra) Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit prologus domini Wilhelmi doctoris parisiensis in explanacionem passionis dominice\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Passionem domini ac saluatoris nostri Ihesu Christi eo studiosiori\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (1vb) Inhaltsverzeichnis: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Partes autem presentis tractatus atque capitula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (3vb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit explanatio domini Wilhelmi episcopi parisiensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \u8249 \'8b \endash  (4ra) Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Admonemur in vndecimo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 capitulo Exodi caput agni cum intestinis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... (169rb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 partim exhortacionum sermonibus relinquentes. Sit per omnia benedictus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  169v leer.
