\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 219va-223va \tab {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Stephanus Tegliatius}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Sermo contra Turcorum persecutionem}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Stephani archiepiscopi Antibarensis sermo habitus in materia fidei contra turcorum persecucionem ex solemnitate gloriosi apostoli et euangeliste Johannis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Qui timet deum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Sir. 15,1)\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quamquam michi semper, beatissime pater, diuini sermonis explicacio hoc in loco amplissimo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 amplexari semper curabimus ipso largissimo donatore domino nostro Ihesu Christo prestante\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Habita fuit hec oratio Roma in ecclesia Lateranensi per reverendum patrem dominum Stephanum Tegliarium archiepiscopum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Antibarensem ut more est in celebracione misse pontificis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 in die solemnitatis gloriosi apostoli et euangeliste Johannis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 anno domini m\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  cccc\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  lxxx\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  pontificatus vero sanctissimi domini nostri Sixti pape quarti anno decimo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  224rv leer.
