\pard\fi0\li0\qc\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 II (Bl. 225-316)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 225ra-316vb  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Jordanus de Quedlinburgo (?)}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Sermones}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u220 \'dcberschrift von Hand Schwerzenbeks: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermones aliqui ex quadragesimali domini et magistri Jordani. In aduentu domini et in xlma\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  (225ra) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Penitentiam agite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Mt. 3,2) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quia vero\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 beato apostolo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 attestante in epistola dominice prime hodie currentis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (227rb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Penitentiam agite etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . (Mt. 3,2) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quia erunt signa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sic scribitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Luce 22\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Predilecti pueri, audistis precedenti dominica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (233ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tercia feria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b  \endash   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Penitentiam agite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Mt. 3,2) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dilectissimi, sicut priori in sermone audistis de signis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (298rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In parasceue\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Foderunt manus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Ps. 21, 17-18)\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quia ista sacra die passio christi est cuilibet fideli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (307vb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 perceptione dominici corporis et est per suam gratiam in nobis etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sit tibi laus et gloria domine Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Anno m\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  cccc\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  lviii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  infra octavam corporis christi finiti sunt sermones isti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (308r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ego sum lux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...\u8249 \'8b (Jo 8:12) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sicut videmus quod lux corporalis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  (314vb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Feria secunda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Si quis sitit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 (Jo 7:37) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Secundum glosam, sitis anime desiderium eius est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  (316va) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Alius sermo de eodem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Si quis sitit \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (Jo 7:37) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vbi supra. Sicut videmus in naturalibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... (316vb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 plenus tui sum, oneri michi sum. Rogemus etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  317r-318v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Verfasserschaft des Jordanus de Quedlinburg nur tw. beweisbar, s. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  RLS, Bd. 3, S. 834.  Sermo In parasceve (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Foderunt manus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ...) vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Zumkeller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Manuscripte, Nr. 415a (Jacobus OESA).}

