\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 143ra-183rb  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Boethius}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 De consolatione philosophiae}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Anicij Manlij Torquati Seuerini Boecij ordinarij patricij uiri ex consulis de consolacione philosophie liber primus. Incipit metrum primum eroicum elegiacum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Carmina qui quondam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (143ra am Rand) Notiz von Hand Schwerzenbecks: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quidam magnus et doctus vir, ut inuentum est in quadam epistola, scribit quod liber Consolationum Phylosophie insignitus sit xxvij metrorum generibus, sed Quirinalia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [des Metellus von Tegernsee?] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 lx\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1   \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 iudicis cuncta cernentis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit Bohecius de consolacione philosiophie secundum textum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b 1482 \endash  183v-183h-v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ed. CCSL 94.}

