\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 184ra-357vb  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Hieremias de Montagnone}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Compendium moralium notabilium \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 (184ra-187rb) Alphabetisches Register \endash  (188ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit compendium moralium notabilium compositum per Jeremiam judicem de Montegnone ciuem paduanum premissis infra scriptis prohemjis ad persciendam summariam intencionem tocius huius operis. Rubrica prima de nominibus auctorum ex quibus est compilatum hoc compendium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Utilimum et quasi necessarium fore existimandum est ad moralium notabilium scienciam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... (357vb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 carnalibus non ad oculum seruitutis quasi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  // Text bricht ab. \endash  187v, 357a-r\endash 357d-v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Druck: Venezia, Peter Liechtenstein, 1505. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , Incipits, Nr. 1434; Charles H. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Lohr\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , Medieval Latin Aristotle Commentaries, Traditio 24, 1968, p. 239\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .}

