\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Anno Domini m\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  cccc\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  71\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tituli speculi virtutum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (189ra-198ra) Inhaltsverzeichnis. \endash  (192ra) Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit epistola siue prologus super subsequens opus quod intitulatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Speculum virtutum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (192rb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Excellentibus et gloriosis principibus dominis Alberto et Ottoni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  (193ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit prologus. Incipit prima pars quod regimen vite humane versatur circa tria. Capitulum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (193rb\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Quia sicut dicit Seneca ad Tulium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (!) ... \endash  ... (343vb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et de ordinandis et dirigendis ipsis virtutibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (344ra) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 in finem humane felicitatis. Sit ergo laus precipua et graciarum accio soli Deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Anno Domini 1472\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  344rb-344v leer.
