\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (144r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Meditatio magistri Heinrici de Hassia super dominica oracione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Pater noster.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quia in exordio creature ex nichilo ad ymaginem suam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (148r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ipso amoueamus. Sequitur Aue Maria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (148r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Meditatio eiusdem magistri Heinrici super salutacione archangelica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  Spiritu sancto prouidente salubriter factum est ... Ave maria ... Hanc orationem in quatuor particulas diuidendam esse ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (153r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 mortalibus exhibite divine miseracionis etc.
