\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 168v-317v  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Nicolaus Kempf}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 De mystica theologia}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (168v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit tractatus magistri Nicolai Kempff de Argentina prioris Carthusiensis ordinis in Girigo de mistica theologia. Distinctus in quinque partes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (169r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Jesus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Mistica theologia que est finis tocius theologie ab ignorantibus vilipenditur. Capitulum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cvm scientia non habet inimicum nisi ignorantes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  am unteren Rand: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hunc librum perutilem compilauit dominus Nicolaus Kempf de Argentina prior in Girio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ordinis Carthusiensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (hinzugef\u252 \'fcgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 magister arcium Wienne\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 )\u8249 \'8b \endash  ... (317v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 in sciencia Dei et alijs virtutibus amplis et latis. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Laus Deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit tractatus magistri Nicolai Kempf de Argentina prioris Carthusiensis ordinis in Girigo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [Geirach (Steiermark)?] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 de mistica theologia distinctus in quinque partes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Finitus anno Domini 1479 in die sancte Agnetis virginis at martyris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [Jan. 21]\u8249 \'8b \endash  318r-323 leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ed.: Nicolas Kempf, Tractatus de mystica theologia. Rec. et notes du Karl Jellowschek, Salzburg 1973. (Hs. genannt S. iv)}

