\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (159v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Augustinus ad Valentinum philosophum de doctoribus katholicis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Kathedram sapientie ascendisti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (160r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Jeronimus de studio sacre scripture\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ita scripturas sanctas lege\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (160v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Effrem dyaconus ciuitatis Edissene\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Meminisse debemus, carissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 non concedat tibi ad momentum viuere nec esse super terram\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ? \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 etc. Hec ille\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  161r-166v leer.
