\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 171r-178r  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Commentum in Regulam sancti Benedicti
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Iuniores ergo priores suos. Et hec est secunda pars capituli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  p[rimi?] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vbj agitur de mutua honoratione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 quam nobis assequi concedat veritas via et vita Christus dominus qui cum patre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Facientibus hec regna patebunt superna\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1   \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hic sacros calamo scriptor sulcante libellos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Schaller/K\u246 \'f6nsgen, Inititia carminum Nr. 6695). \endash  178v leer.}

