\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (3r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tractatus de reformatione status cenobitici per magistrum Johannem Nyder sacre pagine professorem ordinis Fratrum predicatorum vtiliter comportatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In nomine Domini incipit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Rogatus sum a te, pater mi, qui reformationis officio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \endash  Capitulatio: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Prima pars que a conformitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash   Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nolite conformari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Rom 12,2)  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ecce triplex doctrina admodum necessaria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...\endash ...  (86v)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  sicuti Christus promisit, vite eterne dabitur possessio, ad quam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  Von Schwerzenbeck nachgetragen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit Tractatus de reformatione status cenobitici magistri Nyder\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  87rv leer.
