\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (1r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipiunt Synonima Ysydorj\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b (Nachtrag von Hand Schwerzenbecks: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 alius titulus sicut in impressura inuentum est Soliloquia Ysidorj\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In nomine sancte et indiuidue Trinitatis ... Pie et sancte recordacionis Ysidorus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...  \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit prologus. Homo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Anima mea in angustijs\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ...  (31r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 supra uitam meam places.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Expliciunt synonyma Ysidori archiepiscopi anno etc. 1425\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (31ra-31vb) Kapitelverzeichnis.
