\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (36r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Exposicio doctorum super Pater noster, Aue Maria et Credo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b (dar\u252 \'fcber am oberen Rand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Primo ponitur in ea captacio beniuolencie 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  subiunguntur peticiones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sancti doctores exponunt Pater noster sic. Pater noster. Super quo sanctus Thomas de Aquino dicit: Pater dicitur et non dominus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (41v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Aue Maria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Aue Maria, id est tu e\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [s] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 purissima quia aue\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (41v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Credo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Credo in deum, id est omnem vitam, spem atque fiduciam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... (44r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 in pleno gaudio absque defectu Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  44v-45v leer.
