\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 152r-159r \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Notabilia, Versus, Auctoritates
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (152r)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Qvatuor sunt genera auium que solem fugiunt ... \endash  \u8250 \'9bNotandum versifice que sit vera confessio\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , Proverbia, Nr. 29832)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  Sit simplex, humilis ... \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (152v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9bAugustinus\u8249 \'8b \endash  Usitata culpa sic obligat mentem ... \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (154r)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Est ergo confessio coram sacerdote ... \endash  \u8250 \'9bSecuntur decem precepta\u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (155r)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8250 \'9bSecuntur 7\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 tem\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  mortalia peccata. Primo superbia\u8249 \'8b \endash  (155v) De quinque sensibus \endash  (156r) Sex opera spiritualia ... \endash  Septem sacramenta \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (157r)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Nouem aliena peccata \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (157v)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8250 \'9bAlia confessio generalis\u8249 \'8b   \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (158v)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Am unteren Rand von der Hand Schwerzenbecks: Nota hic supra de horis beate virginis dicendis statutum Vrbani pape in concilio in Claro monte  \endash  Maria interpretatur dominatrix ... \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (159r)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Sicut dicit Raymundus: Hoc sacramentum corporis Christi ...  \endash  ... ad gaudium dono scilicet vitam eternam quam nobis prestare ... \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 156v gestrichen, 159v leer.}

