\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 (5v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Vnde quidam sapiens ait\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Mors nichil aliud est quam exitus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...\u8249 \'8b. \endash  (6r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Modus disponendi se ad mortem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ego frater N. confiteor tibi ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  (11v) Erkl\u228 \'e4rung zum Bild 11r: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hec crux ibi posita vicesies ducta representat veram longitudinem corporis domini nostri Ihesu Christi et qui eam deuote osculatus fuerit ea die non tangetur epilepsia nec subita morte morietur. Hec ex sacro specu fuit nobis missa anno domini 1457. Verte folium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (12r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sciendum quod morituri in extremis grauiores habent temptationes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De fide prima temptatio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  ... (18v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 portio mea in terra viuentium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .}

