\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In nomine domini Amen. Iohannes Gr\u252 \'fcnewalder decretorum doctor canonicus ... salutem in domino sempiternam. Ad vniuersorum noticiam deducimus per praesentes quod ad monasterium sancti Martini in Zell \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 datum in Raytenpuch \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Rottenbuch] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 anno millesimo quadrigentesimo vicesimo sexto die Saturnii decima nona mensis octobris \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [1426 Oktober 19]. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Zur Reform Dietramszells Edgar Krausen, Das Augustinerchorherrenstift Dietramszell. Berlin/New York 1988 (Germania sacra 24,1), S. 47-50, Hs. genannt S. 48.}

