\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u220 \'dcberschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipiunt reformationes et obseruationes breuiter totius regule.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In nomine domini Amen. Liebhardus praepositus huius ecclesie sancti Martini etc. In hiis scriptis excommunicamus et excommunicatos denunciamus omnes \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 omnia seruare sub pena regule et excommunicacionis etc. Orate pro scriptore etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash  52r-54v leer.
