\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u220 \'dcberschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Haec est copia litterarum apostolicarum de publicacione anni iubilei incarnacionis dominice M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cccc lxxv \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [1475]. \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Paulus episcopus seruuus seruorum dei \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ineffabilis providencia summi patris qui pro redempcione humani generis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 datum Rome apud sanctum Petrum anno ab incarnacionis dominice M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cccc\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  septuagesimo terciodecimo kalendis may \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [1470 April 19] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 pontificatus nostri anno sexto. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash  94r-96v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: GW M2990310. }

