\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (220ra) Inhalts\u252 \'fcbersicht: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In isto libro sunt tres particule\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  (220va-221ra) Widmungsbrief: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Reuerendo in Christo patri ac domino domino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Raymundo diuina prouidencia sancte sedis valencie episcopo ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  (221ra) Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Prologus in manipulum curatoris domini Gwidonis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quoniam sicut dicit propheta Malachias \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (221vb-318rb) Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quantum ad sacramentum in generali primo videndum est de eorum institucione \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...  \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 pro me peccatore ad dominum preces fundat. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit hic manipulus curatorum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 compilatus a domino Gwidone de monte Rotheri. Et sic est finis huius libelli in die translacionis sancti Arsacii \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [Juni 17] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sub publica missa hora quasi octaua anno domini m\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  cccc\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  xl \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1440] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 scriptus per Ieorum R\u228 \'e4mpfel cappellanum altaris Sancti Blasii in ecclesia beate virginis Marie Wasserburgensis.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 GW 11716-11834. \endash  Stegm\u252 \'fcller, RS 277. \endash  Bloomfield Nr. 5019.}

