\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Prohemium in exposicionem regule sancti patris nostri Benedicti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b (2ra) Epistola Arsenii: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Reuerendissimo in Christo patri ac domino domino Iohanni Cardinali sancti Sixti Arsenius monachus. Cum superioribus diebus reuerendissime pater reformationi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (2rb) Responsio ad Arsenum: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Accepi litteras tuas dilectissime frater domine Arseni quibus me hortatus es \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (2va-137vb) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Capitulum primum de recommendacione regule\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quoniam adiuuante domino nostri Ihesu Christo exposicionem regule beatissimi ac clarissimi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Deo protegente peruenies. Amen. Deo gracias. Explicit. Benedictus deus qui inter tot et varia impedimenta dedit nobis hoc opus perficere. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  (137va) Dedicatio: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Accipe dilectissime frater mi arseni opus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (138rb-140rb) Tabula capitulorum ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit tabula vna cum exposicione regule beatissimi patris sancti Benedicti compilata per reuerendissimum patrem ac dominum dominum et magistrum Iohannem de Turrecremata \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  scripta et completa anno domini millesimo quadringentesimo quinquagesimo tercio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1453] ... 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Druck: Hain 15734 u.\u246 \'f6. \endash  Lit.: Kaeppeli, Scriptores Nr. 2723, Hs. genannt. \endash  Horacio Santiago-Otero, Manuscritos de Autores Medievales Hispanos 1. Madrid 1987, S. 131-133, Hs. genannt.}

