\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Summula de continencia regule sancti Benedicti \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [Nachtrag Schwerzenbeck: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 compilata per venerabilem patrem Iohannem Schlippacher\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 )\u8249 \'8b (140va) Brief:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Epistola\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Patri suo Conrado de Geysenueldia frater Iohannes Slitpacher in Christo veram optat salutem. Desiderauisse aliquando te calamo recolens \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  Praefatio: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Praefacio in summulam de continencia regulari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Discernere ac noscere quid in regula sancti benedicti vim habeat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Prologus regule sancti benedicti exhorta tocius est \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 \endash  (140va-143rb) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Capitulum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Primum capitulum est nuda doctrina. Quatuor genera hominum nomine et habitu monachorum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ne quis mee insultet imperfectioni \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit in Iubileo sub quinto Nicolao \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1450]\u8249 \'8b 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Melk, Benediktinerstift, Cod. 959 (3, A 4), 182r-185v (https://manuscripta.at/?ID=40657), dort ohne den Brief an Konrad von Geisenfeld, mit Abweichungen. }

