\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 143va-144ra {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Iohannes Palomar}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Responsio super quaestione Iohannis de Ochsenhausen abbatis ad Scotos de excommunicatione monachorum }}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De excommunicacione regulari responsio domini Iohannis de palomer Hyspani auditoris apostolice camere ad consultationem domini Iohannis abbatis monasterii Scotorum Wyenne\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quesiuit a me paternitas vestra qualiter abbas posset et deberet in monachum suum ferre excommunicacionis sentenciam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 proferimus in hiis scriptis. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  Daran anschlie\u223 \'dfend Forma absolutionis: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De forma solemni absolucionis a sentencia excommunicacionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Qvm autem excommunicatus fuerit absoluendus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung u.a.: Clm 19823, 177v-180r. \endash  Melk, Benediktinerstift, Cod. 1916 (552, K 24 [2]), p. 205-207 (https://manuscripta.at/?ID=41509).}

