\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 144rb-145rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Quaestio super voto religionis}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Questio super voto religionis cuiusdam persone sepius emisso\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Uirgo quedam etatis adulte monasterium quoddam reformatum dominarum scilicet ordinis sancte clare ingrediens \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 cum dispensacione nubere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  (144rb-144va) Responsio: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Responsio magistri Leonardi doctoris sacre theologie ordinis Cisterciensium professi in monasterio Campo principum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Vt breuitate utar venio ad harum questionum aliqualem reuisionem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 elicere valet multa. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  (144vb-145rb) Responsio: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Alia responsio cuisdam viri iurisperiti et vere digni super eadem questione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Pro aliquali dubii intellectu videre primo quod illa protestacio a virgine facta non sit votum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 potest non proficere. Sic dicit canon 12 questio 1. Scimus. \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 145v-I\u180 \'b4v leer.}

