\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1r leer bis auf Besitzvermerk: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Iste liber attinet monasterio sancti Quirini in Tegernsee. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  1v-2r leer. \endash  2v Besitzvermerk (Schwerzenbeck): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Iste liber attinet venerabili cenobio sancti Quirini regis et martiris atque patroni nostri in Tegernsee \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 anschlie\u223 \'dfend Inhaltsverzeichnis.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 2v-24v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Regula Benedicti (cum glossis)}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (2v-4r) Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit prologus regule sancti Benedicti abbatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ausculta o fili precepta magistri \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 \endash  (4r-24v) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De genibus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (! vielm. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 generibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 monachorum capitulum 1\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 m\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Monachorum quatuor esse genera manifestum est \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 regna patebunt eterna. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit regula sancti Benedicti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (2v) Beginn Glossierung: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Reddit auditores beneuolos dociles attentos cum dicit fili pii patris \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Benedicti regula, hrsg. von Rudolf Hanslik. Wien \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 1977 (CSEL 75).}

