\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (221r) Hinweise von Iohannes Keck zur folgenden Tabula. \endash  221v leer. \endash  (222r-232v) Tabula materiarum: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Prologus seu sermo prohemialis praesentis operis has continet materias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cur prisci patres sancti Benedicti regulam exponere non curauerunt, prologus A \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Zelus bonus quomodo habeatur, G. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tractatus finalis de obseruantia statutorum regule ... 1448\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b. \endash  233r-v leer.}

