\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (2ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Prohemium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Viris inquam vite venerabilis gracia \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  benedictis et ordine patribus in Christo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (2rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Prologus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Aristotiles 7\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 politicorum asserit sine quatuor virtutibus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (3ra-229vb) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit regula beati Benedicti abbatis ut in rubrica liquet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Obsculta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 quidam enim habent hic ausculta quod est attende uel audi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 dic quis perfectus corrigas notando profectus.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  Darunter von sp\u228 \'e4terer Hand nachgetragen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hic abbas claruit anno domini millesimo trecentesimo quinquagesimo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1350]. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Edition: Petri Boherii in regulam sancti Benedicti commentarium, hrsg. von Leone Allodi. Subiaco 1908.}

