\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u220 \'dcberschrift Schwerzenbeck:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Textus regule sancti Benedicti abbatis. \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (230ra) Prolog:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit prohemium regule beati patris nostri Benedicti abbatis. Prologus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Obsculta o fili precepta magistri \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (230vb-231ra) Index capitulorum (mit Kapitelz\u228 \'e4hlung). \endash  (231ra-245ra) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit textus regule sancti Benedicti abbatis de generibus vel vita monachorum. Capitulum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Monachorum quatuor esse genera \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 hec regna patebunt superna. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  245rb-250v leer.
