\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 21ra-56vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Oglerius de Locedio}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : Sermones XV
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (21ra) Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit tractatus beati Bernhardi abbatis de cena domini. Prologus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Paschalibus dapibus esuriens saturari quicumque requiris \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (21ra) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ante diem festum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 (Io 13,1) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Verbum patris filius dei quod pro salute generis humani \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (22ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sermo secundus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sicut auris non potest saciari auditu \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (25rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sermo tercius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cum de iure condicionis humane omnem hominem oportet exire \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 14\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (53va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cum de redemptore nostro lingwa silere non debeat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  56rb-56v leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Hier Bernhard von Clairvaux zugeschrieben. \endash  Edition: PL 184, 879-950. \endash  Schneyer, RS 4, S. 520f. Nr. 1-16. \endash Der Beginn der 15. Predigt (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Proximos nostros tunc diligimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 schlie\u223 \'dft ab (54va) bruchlos an die 14. Predigt an. }

