\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 57ra-116rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Guilelmus Peraldus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : Liber de eruditione religiosorum
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (57ra-b) Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit liber de instructione alias eruditione \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [nachgetragen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 fratris Guilhelmi Peralt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 religiosorum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [getilgter Nachtrag: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 humberti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit prologus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Erudire Ierusalem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 (Ier 6,8). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In verbo isto religioni si erudiri noluerit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  Daran anschlie\u223 \'dfend (57rb-57va) Inhalts\u252 \'fcbersicht. \endash  (57va-116rb) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quod religiosus gratias agat ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Qui graciam acceptam non agnoscit de ea gratias non agit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 danti michi sapienciam dabo gloriam. Psalmus: Benedicam dominum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 (Ps 15,7). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Deo gracias. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit liber de instructione religiosorum anno domini m\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  cccc\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  xlvi\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in die sancti Theodori martiris \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [1446 November 9]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Pertinet autem liber iste ad monasterium sancti Quirini martiris in Tegernsee\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \endash  116v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: Maxima Bibliotheca veterum patrum et antiquorum scriptorum ecclesiasticorum XXV. Lyon 1677, S. 665-753. \endash  Lit.: Kaeppeli, Scriptores Nr. 1625, Initium und Explicit abweichend. Text bearbeitet und mit K\u252 \'fcrzungen.}

