\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 117ra-213va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 David de Augusta}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : De exterioris et interioris hominis compositione
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (117ra) Epistola: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Littera fratris Dauid \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [nachgetragen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de ordine fratrum minorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de Augusta professoris sacre theologie quam misit nouiciis Ratisponam pro eorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 informacione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dilectis in Christo Ihesu fratribus fratri Bertholdo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Unde proficere in uia dei et semper crescere in uirtutibus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  (118ra) Kapitelverzeichnis. \endash  (118rb) Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit formula nouiciorum fratris Dauid de Augusta ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dilecto in Christo fratri Bertholdo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Desiderasti a me frater carissime ut aliquid scriberem tibi ad edificacionem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  (118rb-213va) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Considera quare veneris ad religionem. Capitulum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Primo ergo semper considerare debes ad quid veneris \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 aut gracias agimus pro acceptis vel pro dimissis que nobis dominus concedat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit hoc volumen per me fratrem Oswaldum nott Monachum et orate pro me Aue Maria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b Darunter Nota. \endash  213vb und 214ra leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Edition: David ab Augusta, De exterioris et interioris hominis compositione secundum triplicem statum incipientium, proficientium et perfectorum libri tres, hrsg. von Collegium S. Bonaventurae. Quaracchi 1899, mit weiterer \u220 \'dcberlieferung, Hs. genannt S. XXVIII Nr. 205. }

