\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 229va-237rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Guilemus Durantus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : Rationale divinorum officiorum (Exz.)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (229va) Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit liber octauus seu pars octaua racionalis de computo et kalendario et de pertinentibus ad illa. 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 m\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  prohemium octaui libri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quoniam sicut ait Augustinus beatus sacerdotes computum scire tenentur alioquin vix in eis sacerdotis nomen constabit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  (229va) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit prima pars de anno solari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In hac prima huius operis parte de anno solari tractatur que in quatuor subdiuiditur particulas \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sumptibus vrbem lustrabant.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Liber VIII, pars 1 und 2. \endash  Edition: Rationale divinorum officiorum a reverendo domino Gulielmo Durando, hrsg. von Johannes Belethus. Neapel 1859, hier Liber VIII, pars 1 und 2, S. 725-752.}

