\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1ra-11rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Thomas de Aquino}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : Collatio de decem praeceptis
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ihesus. Sanctus Thomas de decem preceptis decalogi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tria sunt homini necessaria ad salutem videlicet scientia creditorum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (! vielm. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 credendorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 non concupisces non desiderabis. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit sanctus Thomas de decem praeceptis decalogi in die s. Agnetis 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  anno 1455\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [1455 Januar 21]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Laus deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Edition: Jean-Pierre Torrell, Les Collationes in decem praeceptis de saint Thomas d\rquote Aquin. \u201 \'c9dition critique avec introduction et notes, in: Ders., Recherches thomasiennes. \u201 \'c9tudes revues et augment\u233 \'e9es. Paris 2000 (Biblioth\u232 \'e8que Thomiste 52), S. 65-117.}

