\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Maria. Explanacio salutacionis angelice\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ave Maria ... In salutacione ista tria continentur: vnam partem fecit angelus usque in mulieribus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et fructus eius magis benedictus qui et nos benedicat. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Deo gracias. Explicit. Ihesus Maria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b
