\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Iesus. Incipit tractatus sancti Thome de rationibus fidei factus ad cantorem Anthyochenum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Beatus Petrus apostolus qui repromissionem accepit ut super eius confessionem fundaretur ecclesia \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 conscribenda cum alibi diligencius pertractata sint. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit. Ihesus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Edition: S. Thomae Aquinatis Opera omnia III, hrsg. von Roberto Busa. Stuttgart 1980, S. 509-513.}

