\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 34ra-38rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Thomas de Aquino}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : De articulis fidei et ecclesiae sacramentis
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Maria. Tractatus eiusdem sancti Thome de articulis fidei et ecclesie sacramentis ad archiepiscopum Panormitanum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Postulat a me uestra dileccio ut de articulis fidei et ecclesie sacramentis aliqua verba compendiosius pro memoriali transcriberem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 surget corpus spirituale. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit. Anno 1455\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \endash  38v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Edition: S. Thomae Aquinatis Opera omnia III, hrsg. von Roberto Busa. Stuttgart 1980, S. 634-636.}

