\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 39ra-79va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Innocentius III papa}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : De missarum mysteriis
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit tractatus Innocencii pape tercii de misteriis rituum cerimoniarum et officii misse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tria sunt in quibus praecipue lex diuinia consistit mandata pro missa et sacramenta \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dominum nostrum supplices rogamus etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit tractatus de mysteriis ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 anno 1455\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  finitus in die sancti Mauri abbatis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [1455 Januar 15]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  per fratrem L. E. de Monaco. Maria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Edition: Innocenzo III: Il sacrosanto mistero dell\rquote altare (De sacro altaris mysterio). Romani pontificis mysteriorum evangelicae legis et sacramenti eucharistiae libri sex, hrsg. von Stanislao Fioramonti. Citt\u224 \'e0 del Vaticano 2002 (Monumenta, studia, instrumenta liturgica 15), S. 2-419. }

