\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ihesus. Tractatus qui dicitur directorium confessorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (79vb) Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In dei tabernaculo id est in sancta ecclesia positus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash  (80ra-80va) Index capitulorum. \endash  (80va-94vb) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De loco materiali confessionis capitulum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Qui facit veritatem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (Io 3,21). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ex hoc verbo sacerdos qui Malachi 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  angelus domini exercituum dicitur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 perducat nos bonitas infinita pater et filius \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit directorium confessorum per fratrem L. E. de Monaco 1455\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Ihesus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \endash  95r-96v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: GW 4648. \endash  Distelbrink, Bonaventura Nr. 77. \endash  Bloomfield Nr. 2537. }

