\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 97vb-110ra {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes von Kastl}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : De fine religiosae perfectionis
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit tractatus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Nachtrag Schwerzenbeck: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 magistri Iohannis Castellensis monachi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  de fine religiose perfectionis et de modo fruendi deo in praesenti vita. Finis christiane perfectionis est deo caritate adherere. Capitulum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cogitanti michi aliquid vltimate in quantum possibile est in huius exilii \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 videbis ac habebis in te quod optes in Ihesu Christo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit tractatus ... compilatus a fratre Iohanne baccalario monacho et professo monasterii Castellensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 GW 582 (dort Albertus Magnus zugeschrieben). \endash  Edition: Alberti Magni opera omnia, Bd. 37, hrsg. von Auguste Borgnet. Paris 1898, S. 523-542. \endash  Sudbrack, Johannes von Kastl, Bd. 1, S. 25-36, 49-58, Bd. 2, S. 196-202.}

