\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 110rb-125va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes von Kastl}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : Spiritualis philosophia
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (110rb) Index capitulorum. \endash  (110rb-125va) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Spiritualis philosophia super necessaria ac salutari sui ipsius cognicione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b (110va) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Qualiter perfecta et humilis sui ipsius noticia ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cogitanti michi philosophari de et super vera et profunda ac salubri sui ipsius perfecta cognicione \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in se Ihesu Christo iaciat fundamentum. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit tractatus spiritualis philosophie ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Edition: Unpublished Theological Writings of Johannes Castellensis, hrsg. von Clemens Stroick. Ottawa 1964, S. 147-194. \endash  Lit.: Sudbrack, Johannes von Kastl, Bd. 2, S. 203-207.}

