\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 138ra-151vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes von Kastl}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : Tractatus de lumine increato
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (138ra) Nachtrag Schwerzenbeck: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Prologus magistri Iohannis Castellensis in tractatum de lumine increato. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cogitanti michi ac aliquamdiu penes me deliberanti qualiter tandem aliquam vnam formulam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  (139va-b) Index capitulorum. \endash  (139vb-151vb) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Capitulum primum de ipso lumine increato et eius perfectione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b (140ra) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dominum deum patrem esse lumen et lucem patet \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 lumen in omni secula benedictum et gloriosum. Amen. Explicit tractatulus secundus de lumine increato ... compilatus a fratre Iohanne baccalario sacre pagine monacho et professo monasterio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Castallensis sub anno domini M. cccc 10 circa Iohannis baptiste \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [1410 ca. Juni 24]. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Unpublished Theological Writings of Johannes Castellensis, hrsg. von Clemens Stroick. Ottawa 1964, S. 25-68. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 VL 4 (1983), Sp. 652-658 Nr. II,2 (Josef Sudbrack, Hs. genannt).}

