\par \pard\fi0\li0\qc\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 I (1-216)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 1ra-89rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Ps.-Augustinus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Quaestiones super novum et vetus testamentum}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (1ra-87vb) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipiunt questiones sanctissimi patris nostri Augustini super nouum et vetus testamentum. Questio prima. Quid est deus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quid est deus? Deus hoc est quod nulla attingit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  ... \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Expliciunt questiones ... anno domini 1485 huc scripte ... Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \endash  (87vb-89rb) Index quaestionum ... \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit tabula ... huc scripta anno domini millesimo quadringentesimo octogesimo 5\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 to\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [1485] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 per fratrem Stephanum natum de Landaw que est in Bauaria sita indicione tercia \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \endash  89v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 PL 35, 2215-2252. \endash  Stegm\u252 \'fcller, RB 1484.}

