\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (89r) Sermo 1 (Aschermittwoch, fr\u252 \'fchestens 1443): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Conuertimini ad me \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (Ioel 2,12). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Reuerendissime ... omne ut dicit Plato in Thimeo in minimis rebus diuinum praesidium debeat implorari \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (92r) Sermo 2 (1442 Februar/M\u228 \'e4rz): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sermo in dominica lxx\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 me\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Quid hic statis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (Mt 20,6). ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Patres reuerendissimi ceterique hominum honore merito venerandi quam plurimos hoc in sacro concilio ociositate tempore longo permansisse \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Autograph (Abweichungen bei 90v-91r). \endash  Lit: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 VL 4 (1983) (Heribert Rossmann), Sp. 1100 Nr. VIII,49 (Sermo 2) und Sp. 1101 Nr. IX,55 (Sermo 1), Hs. jeweils genannt.}

