\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tractatus Iohannis de Gerson cancellarii Parisiensis de paruulis ad Christum trahendis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sinite parvulos venire \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (Mt 19,14). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Supremus legislator noster et doctor Christus sufficientem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 talium est enim regnum celorum. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash  106v-109v leer.
