\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 165r-168r \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Ludovicus de Lapalude: Collatio ad Eugenium papam IV (1432)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Collacio facta ad dominum nostrum dominum apostolicum Eugenium sanctissimum per ambasiatores concilii Basiliensis nominatim per dominum episcopum Lausamensem et decanum Traiectensem anno etc xxxii \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [1432]\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Beatissime pater antequam aliqua ex parte nos mittencium dicamus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quam felicem et incolomem sponse sue diucius tueri dignetur omnipotens ipse \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: Mansi 30, Sp. 92-98. }

