\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Collacio facta in oppido Egrensi ... per magistrum Heinricum Togke ambasiatorem sacri concilii Basiliensis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In nomine domini \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen. Duo sunt hic principaliter peragenda, primum est uerbum domini humiliter proponendum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... 
