\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 171v-174v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gerardus Landrianus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : Oratio ad regem Angliae in concilio Basiliensi
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Oracio Gherardi Laudriani episcopi Laudensis ... ad regem Anglie et reliquos patres conscriptos regni etc in parlamento publico. \endash  Facite quod dei est ... Paucis hiis antea more institutoque maiorum praemissis credimus serenissime et christianissime rex ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ad laudem et gloriam omnipotentis eterni dei et tocius curie triumphantis. Amen.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: Mansi 29, Sp. 463-468.}

