\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 12r-87v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Hermannus de Soest}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Evangelium unum ex quattuor}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (12r) Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit prologus in ewangelium ex quatuor vnum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b (von Schwerzenbeck nachgetragen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 quod composuit in concilio Basiliensi venerabilis pater Hermannus ordinis Cysterciensium \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sacrosancte generali synodo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [getilgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 concilio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Basiliensi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 frater Hermannus Zoest de Monasterio professus Monasterii Campi sancte Marie \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ezechiel propheta secretorum celestium contemplator \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 si quid corrigendum fuerit repertum. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Presens huic operi sit gracia pneumatis almi. Me iuuet et faciat complere quod utile fiat. Explicit prologus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b. \endash  Daran anschlie\u223 \'dfend vom Schreiber hinzugef\u252 \'fcgte Inhalts\u252 \'fcbersicht \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Scriptor adidit subsequencia ad maiorem intelligenciam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b. \endash  (13r-87v) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit ewangelium ex quatuor vnum. Capitulum primum de deitate verbi et ipsius eternitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In principio erat verbum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 (Io 1,1) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 quia Ihesus est filius dei et ut credentes uitam habeatis in nomine eius. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit ewangelium vnum ex quatuor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  Darunter Zusatz: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Graciarum accio laus et gloria sedenti super tronum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sponsus tuus Christus nunc et in eternum benedictus. Amen. Ecce finem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (gestrichen). \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Deo gracias. Anno 1451\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Parallelhss. u.a.: M\u252 \'fcnchen, UB, 8\u176 \'b0 Cod. Ms. 347, 2r-136v. \endash  Stegm\u252 \'fcller, RB 3247,1 (mit dem Zusatz), dort Hinweis auf weitere \u220 \'dcberlieferung.}

