\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 94r-189r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Guido de Monte Rocheri}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Manipulus curatorum}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u220 \'dcberschrift (von Schwerzenbeck nachgetragen): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Manipulus curatorum sacerdotum Guidonis de monte Rotherii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  (94r-95v) Inhalts\u252 \'fcbersicht. \endash  (96r) Widmungsbrief: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Reuerendo in Christo patri ac domino, domino Raymundo diuina prouidencia sancte sedis Ualencie episcopo suorum deuotorum minimus Gwido de monte Rotherii cum deuota et humili recommendacione \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 (96r-97r) Prolog: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit prologus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quoniam secundum quod dicit propheta Malachias \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ut uideant ea que circa suum officium sunt agenda. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  Anschlie\u223 \'dfend kurze Inhalts\u252 \'fcbersicht. \endash  (97r-189r) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit prima pars istius libelli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quantum ad primam partem primo uidebuntur alique de sacramentis in generali \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 pro me peccatore ad deum preces fundat. Ecce finem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (gestrichen und von Schwerzenbeck ersetzt durch: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit manipulus curatorum domini Guidonis archidyaconi et cardinalis de monte Rotherii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ). \endash  Kolophon: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Finitum in vigilia sancti Virgilii episcopi anno ab incarnacione domini Millesimo quadringentesimo quinquagesimo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1450 Sept. 23] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 feria quinta infra horam sextam et septimam post completorium per fratrem Leonardum Egr\u228 \'e4r de Monaco. Orate pro scriptore. Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Parallelhss. u.a.: Clm 18142. \endash  GW 11716-11834. \endash  Stegm\u252 \'fcller, RS 277. \endash  Bloomfield Nr. 5019.}

