\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (34r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De sancto Stephano sermo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Video celos appertos \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Act 7,55). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dicit Gregorius: Sacre scripture hystorie sic in veritate credantur facte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ut tamen per significacionem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (35r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de eodem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ecce relinquetur vobis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (! vielm. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 nobis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) ... (Mt 23,38). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dicit Gregorius: Quid prodest mala cognoscere si non contingat euadere \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (36v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De sancto Andrea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Andreas apostolus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b [Nachtrag Schwerzenbeck: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermones sacri de sanctis incipiunt hic\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ].\endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Venite post \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (Mt 4,19). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sanctus Gregorius exponens verbum propositum dicit per hec verba dominus omnes ad eternitatem vocat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash   ... \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 119\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (193v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sequitur sermo quintus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Edificate mihi domum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Agg 1,8). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Habita supra de domus distinccione pariter domus hic intente eleccione \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 120\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (195v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Libera me domine \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Ioel 3,16). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hec dies tanta erit prae omnibus aliis qui fuerunt sunt et erunt ab inicio mundi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 121\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (196v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de sancto Steffano prothomartyre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Iuda te laudabunt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Gn 49,8). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sanctus patriarcha Iacob cum benediceret filios suos hec verba in benediccione ac commendacione Iude protulit dicens \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...  Textabbruch nach 14 Zeilen.  \endash  (195r) Datierung: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1479\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b
