\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 7r-74rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Legendae sanctorum}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (7r) Prolog \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipiunt passiones sanctorum per circulum anni. Prologus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ferculum fecit sibi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Cant 3,9). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Statum vniuersalis ecclesie spiritus sanctus cordibus nostris quo ad membra \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (7va) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De aduentu domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Aduentus domini nostri Ihesu Christi per 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 or\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  dominicas celebratur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (7vb) Andreas: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Andreas decorus vel virilis interpretatur. A vico Bethsayda prouincie Galilee oriundus fuit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (8va) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De sancta Barbara virgine et martyre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Barbara virgo nobilis fuit cuius pater Dyoscorus fecit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (8v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De sancto Nicolao episcopo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nicolaus qui victoria populi interpretatur ex illustri prosapia Licie provincie \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 155\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (72vb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De sancta Otilia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Temporibus Childerici erat quidam dux nobilis nomine Adalricus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 156\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (73rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De sancta Clara\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ammirabilis femina Clara vocabulo et virtute de ciuitate Assisii \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  74v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Sammlung von 156 Heiligenlegenden, weitgehend \u252 \'fcbereinstimmend mit Karlsruhe, LB, St. Peter Perg. 23, 2ra-80vb.}

