\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 3r-162va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Nicolaus de Dinkelspuhel}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Sermones de tempore de dominicis et sanctis (pars hiemalis)}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermones magistri Nicolai de Dinckelspuhel de tempore et sanctis ab aduentu domini vsque in pentecosten\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (1r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominica 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  in adventu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Erunt signa ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (Lc 21,25). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Notandum primo quod mala que dominus hic enumerat ... \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (7rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominica tercia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Iohannes cum audisset \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Mt 11,2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Herodes Anthipas incarcerauit Iohannem propter hoc \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (8rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominica quarta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Miserunt a Ierosolimis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Io 1,19) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vbi notandum secundum magistrum Nicolaum de Lyra quod tempore praedicacionis Iohannis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... (155ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominica Vocem iocunditatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen amen dico vobis si quid petieritis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Io 16,23). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sanctus Thomas in 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 to\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  dis. 15 dicit quod opera nostra non sunt sufficiencia \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (157ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In ascensione domini sermo de euangelio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Recumbentibus illis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Mc 16,14). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominus noster resurgens a mortuis per xl dies moratus est in terra \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (161vb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominica infra octavam ascensionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cum venerit paraclitus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (Io 15,26)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Saluator noster volens predicere discipulis suis multa aduersa \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  127v, 161vb-162av leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Madre, S. 136-145, 205, 208-210, 212, 215, 217ff.}

