\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermones egregii doctoris Nicolai de Dinckelspuhel de sacramento eukaristie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (277r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Caro mea vera \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Io 6,56). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In textu hoc ewangelium praecedente dominus multa locutus fuit de ewkaristie sacramento \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (280r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ego sum panis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Io 6,41). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In priori sermone aggregatum ex fidelibus ad invicem caritate connexis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (283v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sacramentorum sancte ecclesie virtutem et admirabilem efficaciam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (287r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Probet autem se ipsum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (I Cor 11,28). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Probet id est secundum glossam examinet et purget se ipsum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (290v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hoc facite in meam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Lc 22,19). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Per illa verba dominus et saluator noster ordinavit apostolos \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... 
