\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (3ra)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de dominica 7o\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 me\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  factus anno 88\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 uo\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . Sermo de uerbis euangelii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Voca operarios \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Mt 20,8). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Mater ecclesia filios ad fletum inducere volens et in penitencie future praeparacionem transgressionem lamentabilem assumit prothoplastorum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (7vb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de purificacione beate Marie virginis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Postquam impleti sunt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Lc 2,22). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Beatus Bernhardus considerans huius sacratissime solemnitatis magnitudinem volensque nos spiritualiter ad dignam ipsius celebracionem inuitare \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (10ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Anno domini m\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 cccc\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  88 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1488] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 factus sermo de annunciacione dominica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Missus est ad Mariam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Lc 1,26). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quod ergo dicitur missus est ad Mariam virginem secundum Albertum potest intelligi de angelo et de spiritu sancto \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  Daran anschlie\u223 \'dfend (17ra-b) kurze Skizzen zu zwei weiteren Sermones. \endash  17v leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Im Inhaltsverzeichnis Udalricus Kaegerl de Landau zugeschrieben.}

