\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u220 \'dcberschrift Schwerzenbeck: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermones magistri Thome de Haselpach super dominica oracione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (18ra) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Orantes nolite multum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Mt 6,7). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quod multos vtiles fruitus afferat vigilans et deuota oracio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (22ra) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Pater noster \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Non ignorauit Christus multos futuros qui opera dei arguerent \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (27r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sanctificetur nomen tuum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quamuis quilibet hoc habeat liberum arbitrium per quod potest stare \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (61r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sed libera nos \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Mt 6,13). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Vnde malum in natura ex quo deus est summe bonus qui eam creauit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 10\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (65vb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen vbi supra. Oracio ad deum quam sit preciosa quam digna quam fructuosa docet Crisostomus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... 
