\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nachtrag: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de annunciacione christifere virginis Marie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b [Nachtrag Schwerzenbeck: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermones magistri Thome de Haselpach super Ave Maria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ]. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (69va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ave Maria \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quia virgo Maria tot laudibus extollitur a sanctis patribus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (75ra) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ave Maria \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In laudem beatissime virginis quid dicat antiquus doctor Origines audiamus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (79vb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ave Maria \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hodierna festiuitas expetit ut in laudem autem nostre patrone deducamus in medium \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  ... \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (111vb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Benedicta tu \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Si diligenter inspicimus in scripturis tripliciter inuenimus homines benedictos \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 10\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (119ra) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Te benedictus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ita prophetando dixit post eius salutacionem ad virginem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Parallel\u252 \'fcberl.. u.a. Clm 14130, 201ra-255rb. \endash  Lhotsky, Ebendorfer, S. 80 Nr. 81. }

