\pard\fi0\li0\qc\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 II (Bl. 118-264)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 118ra-242rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Iacobus de Voragine}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : Sermones quadragesimales
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In nomine patris \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...\u8249 \'8b \endash  \u220 \'dcberschrift (nachgetragen): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In capite ieiunii sermo primus. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  (118ra) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Filia populi mei \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 (Ier 6,26). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quamuis solempnitas quadragesimalis in sequenti dominica inchoetur ecclesia tamen \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 \endash  (119rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Feria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  de eodem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Comparatus sum luto \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 (Iob 30,19). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Miseriam condicionis humane describit sanctus Iob in verbis premissis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 \endash  (120va) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Feria 5\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cum Introisset Ihesus Capharnaum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 (Mt 8,5). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Iudea tunc temporis tributaria erat Romanis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 (241rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De eodem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Stetit Ihesus in medio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 (Lc 24,36). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ista eadem apparicio plenius ponitur Iohanne xx vbi dicitur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Expliciunt sermones quadragesimales fratris Iacobi de Voragine ordinis predicatorum et sunt finiti per Laurencium Czorn de Landishut \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [Landeshut, Preu\u223 \'dfen/Schlesien] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ciuitate terre Russye anno domini m\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  cccc\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 xxvi\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1426] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Edition: Iacopo da Varazze: Sermones Quadragesimales, hrsg. von Giovanni Paolo Maggioni. Florenz 2005, Hs. genannt S. 551 Nr. 150. \endash  Schneyer, RS 3, S. 238-244, die zitierten Sermones Nr. 196, 197, 198, 292. Hs. genannt S. 245. \endash  Kaeppeli, Scriptores Nr. 2157.}

