\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u220 \'dcberschrift Schwerzenbeck: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermones magistri Nycolai de Dinckelsp\u252 \'fchel de corpore Christi. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (2ra) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Caro mea \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Io 6,56). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In textu hoc ewangelium praecedens \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (! vielm.: praecedente) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 dominus multa locutus fuit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (7ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 us\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ego sum panis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Io 6,48). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In priori sermone aggregatum ex fidelibus ad invicem caritate connexis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (11ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sacramentorum sancte ecclesie virtutem et admirabilem efficaciam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (15va) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Alius sermo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Probet autem seipsum homo et sic de pane illo cedat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (20rb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hoc facite \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Lc 22,19). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Per illa verba dominus et saluator noster ordinavit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Madre, S. 245-249.}

