\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (22va) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Alius sermo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nunc 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 de hoc sacramento in quantum est spiritualis anime \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (24ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Alius sermo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quantum ad tercium principale est nunc videndum quomodo huius sacramenti consecracio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Expliciunt sermones reuerendi et eximii doctoris Nicolai Dinkelspuchel de corpore Christi ex anno etc lxxi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1471]\u8249 \'8b \endash  29rb-29v leer.
