\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 35ra-181va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Hieronymus Posser}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Rustilogus de tempore}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (35ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipiunt sermones magistri Ieronimi de Salczpurga\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Benedictus qui venit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Mt 21,9). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ewangelium hodiernum quod lectum est in officio misse de aduentu domini \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (37ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominica secunda aduentus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Erunt signa \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Lc 21,27). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Pro introduccione ewangelii est notandum quod postquam dominus Ihesus feria tercia post diem palmarum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (39vb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominica tercia aduentus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tu es qui venturus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Mt 11,3). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hoc praesens ewangelium continet in se valde notabilia duo id est gar nemlicher stuckel zwaii \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 63\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (176rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominica vicesima secunda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Simile est regnum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Mt 18,23). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hoc ewangelium est aliqualiter terribile et continet in se tres partes \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 64\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (178va) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominica vicesima tercia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Abeuntes Pharisei consilium \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Mt 22,15). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nuper sub cesare Augusto Iudea subiecta Romanis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 65\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (180vb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominica vicesima quarta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Loquente Hiesu \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ad turbas \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Mt 9,18). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quod pro salute nostra saluator noster ad turbas descendit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1471 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 per me h p de k\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  181vb leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Schneyer, Beobachtungen, zu dieser Hs. S. 30. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 VL 7 (1989), Sp. 792 (Gerold Hayer). }

