\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (85va) Index sermonum, Nachtrag: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermones xl\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 les\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Iohannis de deo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 finis xl\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 lis\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  1505\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (86ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit quadragesimale Iohannis de Deo in capite ieiunii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cum ieiunatis nolite fieri \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Mt 6,16). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Carissimi cum iam sit tempus tristicie et non leticie \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (88ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 fferia quinta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cum intrasset Ihesus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Mt 21,10). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sciendum quod mortuos suscitare et subito infirmos sanare \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (91rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 feria sexta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Audistis quia dictum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Mt 5,21). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sciendum quod tria mala videntur in hominibus habundare \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... (213ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Collacio passionis domini in die parasceues\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Omnis dolor irruit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Iob 20,22). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Karissimi in opere diuino ymo in omni opere inuenitur misericordia et iusticia \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  222v-222gv leer.
