\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Contemplatiuus magnus super passione domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b (271ra) Registrum capitulorum. \endash  (271vb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Prologus super passione domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Videns vidisti domine \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (Act 7,34). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nunc domine passionis tue dies vrgere nos magis deberent \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (273va-366vb) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Septem sunt hore diei secundum quas regiantur deo per septem horas canonicas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Septem sunt hore diei in quibus singulis diebus \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  cum plenitudine sensus mei transsire \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Finis huius opusculi contemplacionis passionis domini nostri Ihesu Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  367r-v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
