\pard\fi0\li0\qc\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 III (195-266)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 195ra-265rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Servasanctus Tuscus de Faenza}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : Summa de virtutibus et vitiis
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u220 \'dcberschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sancti spiritus assit nobis gracia. Summa praedicabilis de viciis et virtutibus cum exemplis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (195ra-261vb) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Capitulum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Omnis enim ut Boecius ait hominum cura mortalium quam multiplicium studiorum labor exercet \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ad omnium fidelium animarum salutem. Amen. Deo gracias. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Per me Ffridericum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [geschw\u228 \'e4rzt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Strawssen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  tunc cooperatorem diuinorum in Brutting \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 anno 1464\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  in quarta feria post diuisionem sanctorum apostolorum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1464 Juli]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  260v leer, kein Textverlust. \endash  (262ra-265rb) Index alphabeticus. \endash  265v-266v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Edition: Antonio del Castello, La tradizione del Liber de virtutibus et vitiis di Servasanto da Faenza. Edizione critica delle distinctiones I-IV. Diss. Neapel 2013, das Initium im Anhang S. 2 (online unter https://core.ac.uk/download/pdf/42948107.pdf)}

