\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (2ra) Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quia \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (! vielm.: Qui) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ad iusticiam erudiunt multos fulgebunt quasi stellae \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (3ra-6vb) Kapitel\u252 \'fcbersicht. \endash  (7r-102v) Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit speculum humane saluationis in quo patet casus hominis et modus redempcionis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 qui cum deo est in perpetuum benedictus. Anno sexagesimosexto \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1466]. \endash  102ar-102gv leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Edition: Speculum humanae salvationis, Bd. 1, hrsg. von Jules Lutz/Paul Perdrizet. Leipzig 1907, S. 2-99. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 VL 9 (1995), Sp. 52-65 (Hans-Walter Stork/Burghart Wachinger).}

