\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 43ra-121va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Iohannes de Spira et alii}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : Expositio in regula s. Benedicti
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (42ra) Capitulum 2: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Qualis debeat esse abbas. Capitulum 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 m\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Expositio capituli secundi regule sancti Benedicti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b [Nachtrag Schwerzenbeck: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 fratris Iohannis de Spira\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In praecedenti capitulo beatus Benedictus distinxit iiii \plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 or\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  genera monachorum quorum primum praeelegit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (71va) Capitulum 33: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Exposicio capituli 33\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ii\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  regule sancti Benedicti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Precipue hoc vicium radicitus amputandum est \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hoc est capitulum 33\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 m\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  regule beati Benedicti quod potest diuidi in 3\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 s \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 partes \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (91ra) Capitulum 5: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Expositurus per sequencia quintum capitulum regule sancti Benedicti secundum quam et ego professus sum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (103ra) Capitulum 23: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Capitulum xxiii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Si quis frater contumax \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sex genera peccatorum hic expressit beatus Benedictus scilicet contumacie \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (116ra) Capitulum 68: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Si fratri impossibilia iniunguntur. Capitulum 68\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Si cui fratri aliqua forte grauia \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In hoc capitulo beatus Benedictus agit de obediencia ad grauia et impossibilia et potest illud diuidi in tres partes \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  90vb, 111v-115v, 121va leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Auslegungen zu den c. 2, 33, 5, 23, 68 (in dieser Reihenfolge). Die Expositiones in c. 2, 33 und 68 stammen von Iohannes (Wischler) de Spira, Prior und Novizenmeister von Melk, die Expositiones in c. 5 und 23 sind anonym \u252 \'fcberliefert. \endash  Parallelhss.: Melk, Benediktinerstift, Cod. 1833 (67, B 32), 151r-160v (c. 2 und 68, https://manuscripta.at/?ID=41446). \endash  Melk, Benediktinerstift, Cod. 911 (841, P 31), 3r-32r (c. 33 https://manuscripta.at/?ID=40624). \endash  Melk, Benediktinerstift, Cod. 793 (737, N 14), 265r-293v (c. 33 https://manuscripta.at/?ID=40547). \endash  Melk, Benediktinerstift, Cod. 619 (2, A 3), 103r-108v (c. 23 https://manuscripta.at/?ID=40434). \endash  Zu Iohannes de Spira siehe \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 VL 4 (1981), Sp. 757-759 (Herbert Kraume).}

