\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Defensorium auctoritatis generalium conciliorum editum per magistrum Petrum de Colle ordinis minorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Pugnauit ecclesia multifarie prioribus temporibus aduersus leonem scilicet dyabolum. Imperium Romanum tunc paganum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 cum alio neccessario praesupponit illud etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit. Ihesus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b }

