\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit expugnatorium aduersariorum auctoritatis commissariorum immediatorum concilii generalis editum a magistro Petro de Colle \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cum spiritus immundus humane salutis aduersarius semel ab homine exierit vadit per loca inaquosa \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 potestate funguntur et non alterius. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen. Explicit anno 1454. Ihesus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b Darunter theologische Notiz. \endash  142rb-142v leer.}

