\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 143r-294ra {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Henricus de Coesveldia}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1   / {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Thomas Ebendorfer de Haselbach}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Sermones}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (143r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermones de festiuitatibus et primo de omnibus sanctis editi per magistrum Heinricum priorem domus Hollandie \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Beati pauperes \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Mt 5,3). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Patres ac fratres dilectissimi hodie ut nouit caritas uestra sancta mater ecclesia omnium sanctorum sub vna festiuitate commemoracionem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (152va) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Alius sermo de omnibus sanctis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ecce ego declino \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Is 66,12) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Patres ac fratres dilectissimi celebrantibus nobis hodierna solempnitate omnium sanctorum memoriam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (155ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Alius sermo de omnibus sanctis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Gloria hec est \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Ps 194,14) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Patres ac fratres dilectissimi hodie ut nouit caritas vestra omnium sanctorum iam cum Christo regnancium \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 49\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (286ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De angelis sermo secundus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 A voce angeli fugerunt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Is 33,3). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Patres ac fratres dilectissimi quamuis verba praemissa ad litteram scripta sunt de angelo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 50\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (288rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De angelis sermo tercius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Angeli eorum semper vident \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Mt 18,10) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Patres ac fratres dilectissimi cum ab eterno et ante secula summa illa maiestas \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 51\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (292rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De angelis sermo quartus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Omnes angeli stabant \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Apc 7,11) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Patres ac fratres dilectissimi hodie ut nostis dulcis illa ac non inmerito gratia \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... Nachtrag Schwerzenbeck: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Expliciunt sermones capitulares fratris Henrici de Hollandia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 51 Sermones, hier alle Henricus de Coesveldia zugeschrieben. Von den hier zitierten Sermones stammen 1-3 von ihm, 49-51 jedoch aus Thomas Ebendorfer, Commentaria in Isaiam prophetam, lib. III. \endash  Alle zitierten Sermones auch in Innsbruck, ULBT, Cod. 434 (https://manuscripta.at/?ID=7519).}

