\pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1ra-105rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quaestiones de sacramento matrimonii}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tractatus bonus et perutilis de sacramento matrimonii per modum dubiorum sew questionum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Utrum matrimonium siue sacramentum matrimonii conferat graciam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Dicitur quod non quia secundum Hugonem ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  (43vb) De voto: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Utrum in forma voti includatur quod fiat deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (61vb) De matrimonio: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Utrum fidelis cum infideli possit contrahere \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash   (65vb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De affinitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Utrum per quamlibet carnalem copulam contrahitur affinitas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash (66vb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Utrum cognacio spiritualis impediat matrimonium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (68va) De arbore consanguinitatis: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Materia de arbore consanguinitatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Ad intelligendum arborem consanguinitatis premittende sunt dubitaciones quedam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 quia non prohibetur ut dicit Innocencius. Videantur eciam dubia Gersoni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  103ra-rb Platz ausgespart, dort Textl\u252 \'fccke.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Anonymer Kommentar u.a. zu Thomas von Aquin, Scriptum super Sententiis 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 liber IV (dist. XXXVII-XLII) und Summa theologiae, supplementum tertiae partis q. 42ff. \endash  Der Abschnitt zum Arbor consanguinitatis auch in Linz, ober\u246 \'f6sterr. Landesbibliothek, cod. 340, 308r und Melk, Benediktinerstift, 680, 130r.}

