\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sentencia Scoti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Scotus distinctione 42. Ex dictis omnibus recolligit impedimenta matrimonii dicens impedimentum semper est \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sponsum preciosum prae filiis hominum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Amen etc. In die sancti Egidii anno etc. 46\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1448 September 1]. \endash  106v-108v leer.
