\pard\sl252\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa165\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 5ra-233rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes Nider}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Praeceptorium divinae legis}}
\par \pard\sl252\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa165\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (5ra-9rb) Index alphabeticus, mit Kapitelangaben. \endash  (9v-10v leer.) \endash  (11ra) Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit preceptorium diuine legis fratris Iohannis Nider sacre theoloye \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 professoris ordinis predicatorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Decalogi legem sacratissimam primo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (! vielm.: primum) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 divinitus prothoplastorum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  (11ra-233rb) Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sunt igitur tria principaliter praenotanda praeceptorum praeambula: primo quam stricte deus velit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 substantia mea donec intrem in gaudium domini qui es trinus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash  Kolophon: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cunradus Frey de L \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (?)\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 almachtiger got ...s O wie fro ich was do ich schraib deo gratias ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 1458\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (233va-b) knappe Notizen zu verschiedenen Dekretalen sowie Abk\u252 \'fcrzungsverzeichnis (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ray est Raymundus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ...). 
\par \pard\sl252\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa165\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Druck: GW 26903-26947. \endash  Kaeppeli, Scriptores Nr. 2540, Hs. genannt.}

