\par \pard\sl254\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa165\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u220 \'dcberschrift Schwerzenbeck: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Speculum curatorum et est egregius tractatus vtilis ad legendum. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Primo videndum est de superbia: hoc peccatum cum difficultate cognoscitur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vinculis vel corrupcione carnali copule eius etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash  260v-262v leer.
