\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 60rb-77rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Richardus de s. Victore}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : De statu interioris hominis
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit liber eiusdem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [Nachtrag Schwerzenbeck: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Richardi de sancto Victore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de statu interioris hominis\u8249 \'8b Sero quidem misi quod petenti promisi sed necessitatis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  neque fota oleo. Explicit liber Richardi de statu interioris hominis per me fratrem Oswaldum Nott monachum in Tegernse monasterii sancti Quirini et finitus est liber anno domini m cccc\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  liiii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [1454] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et dicat mihi quilibet qui legerit vnum Aue maria propter deum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Nachtrag Schwerzenbeck: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit liber Richardi de statu interioris hominis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ].
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Edition: Richard de Saint-Victor, De statu interioris hominis, hrsg. von J. Ribaillier, in: Archives d\u700 'histoire doctrinale et litt\u233 \'e9raire du Moyen \u194 \'c2ge 42 (1967), S. 61-128.  \endash  Stegm\u252 \'fcller, RB 7333.}

