\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 196ra-230rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Michael Pragensis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : Remediarium abiecti prioris
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (196ra) Kapitel\u252 \'fcbersicht. \endash  (196rb) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit liber qui vocatur remediarium abiecti prioris seu prepositi editus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Nachtrag Schwerzenbeck: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 a domino Michaele carthusiensis ordinis quondam vicario domus orti prope Pragam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  cuidam fratri qui dolebat se inepte regis officio exutum vnde ualde fuit contristatus. Cuius primum capitulum inuocat diuinum auxilium \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Afflicto scripturus fratri quod tuus Ihesu Christe suggesserit spiritus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 conscriptum opus propter quod sit in eternum benedictus. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit. Hunc librum collegit et composuit pater venerabilis dominus Michael quondam vicarius domus orti prope Pragam ... Labor scripture finitus est feria 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  post festum Egidii abbatis anno 1454 manu fratris L. E. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Leonhardi Eggerer] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 professi monasterii in Tegrinsee ordinis sancti Benedicti. Laus deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \endash  230v-231v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: Bernard Pez, Bibliotheca ascetica antiquo-nova, Bd. 2. Regensburg 1723, S. 227-468. \endash  Zum Verfasser Michael von Prag, in \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 VL 6 (1987), Sp. 509-513 (Franz Josef Worstbrock).}

