\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 281r/286r \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Epistola ad episcopum Bononiensem [1443 April 5]
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Epistola responsalis cuiusdam Cartusiensis ad episcopum Bononiensem cardinalem sancte crucis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Reuerenciam tam debitam quam honestam si mecum sentitis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 (Der Brief wird nach 281v fortgesetzt auf 286r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 post erroris declaracionem maior laus sequetur et gloria datis.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Parallelhss.: M\u252 \'fcnchen, BSB, Cgm 1586, 97r-98r. \endash  Augsburg, UB, Cod. I. 3. 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 \u176 \'b0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  18, 11r-12v. \endash  Edition: William Paul Lundell, Carthusian Policy and the Council of Basel. Diss. Toronto 1996, Appendix E, S. 265-271 (online unter https://tspace.library.utoronto.ca/bitstream/1807/12255/1/NQ35443.pdf) }

