\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Excerpta sequencia de 7\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 tem\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sacramentis sunt compilata per venerabilem magistrum Iohannem Schlitp\u228 \'e4cher anno domini m cccc xxx vii \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [1437]. \endash  (46rb) Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Assit ad inceptum sancta Maria mecum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Perlegere cupiens lecturam cuiusdam venerabilis doctoris super 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 to\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  libro sententiarum sensi meam quam valde habeo labilem memoriam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  (46rb-134rb) Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Utrum in quolibet hominum statu fuerint aliqua sacramenta \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 largitori attribuatur cui sit laus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen. Et illud opusculum est excerptum a praefato magistro venerabili Iohanne Schlitpacher priore supradicti monasterii in anno hiis metris contento millesimo quadringentesimo ter quoque deno ac septeno \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [1437]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... Et erat completum ab eodem die 17 mensis Iunii. Expliciunt hec excerpta die sabbatina ante festum omnium sanctorum anno 1449. Deo gracias. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\u252 \'fcller, RS 496. \endash  Madre, S. 122-123. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 VL 8 (1992), Sp. 732 Nr. I,12 (Franz Josef Worstbrock).}

