\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r Stiftungsvermerk: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hunc librum obtulit deo et sancto Quirino martiri in monasterio Tegernsensi frater Hainricus de Purckhausen ex sacerdote seculari monachatum ibidem professus. Anno domini M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  cccc\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  lxviii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 uo\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1468]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Scriptum vero per magistrum Andream de Scherding sacre theologie professorem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [Erg\u228 \'e4nzung von sp\u228 \'e4terer Hand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 alme vniuersitatis Wiennensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  Darunter Inhaltsverzeichnis. \endash  1r-v, 2v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 2r-163v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Andreas de Schaerding}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Quaestiones super V libris Ethicorum}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Questiones magistri Andree de Sch\u228 \'e4rding\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [Erg\u228 \'e4nzung von sp\u228 \'e4terer Hand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sacre paginis professoris et doctoris qui propria manu scripsit hunc librum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 super quinque libris ethicorum Aristotilis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (2r) Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Calamitose huius peregrinationis humane cursum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (3v-42v) Liber I: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Queritur primo vtrum de virtutibus sit scientia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Buridanus ponit duas conclusiones \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  (42r-68r) Liber II: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Circa secundum librum ethicorum queritur primo vtrum virtutes \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85\u8249 \'8b \endash  (68v-107r) Liber III: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Queritur circa tercium vtrum possibile sit quod voluntas \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et in hoc terminatur exercitum tertii Ethicorum vltima de mense februarii Anno 1460\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 mo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1460 Februar 29]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  (107v-131r) Liber IV: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Queritur circa quartum vtrum liberalitas sit virtus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  (131r-163r) Liber V: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Queritur circa quintum librum Ethicorum primo vtrum iusticia sit passionum moderatiua \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 honor laus et gloria nunc et in secula seculorum. Amen. Anno 1460\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 mo\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  Liber V, Quaestio 4 bricht 134v ab, 135r-v leer, Text setzt 136r mit Quaestio 5 wieder ein. \endash  163v-169v leer.}

