\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1r-34v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Enea Silvio Piccolomini}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Libellus dialogorum de concilii generalis auctoritate (1441)}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (1r) Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit dialogus venerabilis et egregii viri domini Enee Siluii Senensis sanctissimi domini nostri Felicis diuina prouidencia pape quinti secretarii de rebus conciliaribus. Prohemium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Eneas Siluius secretarius apostolicus rectori et universitati studii Coloniensis salutem dicit. Homini christiano qui vere Christianus vult dici \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  (2r-34) Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Primus dialogus. Martinus: Ita est vt dicis Enea versari sedulo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 postquam clausa fuerit pecunia coemamus ingressum. Finis. Laus deo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Leonhardus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash  Darunter von sp\u228 \'e4terer Hand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit dyalogus venerabilis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (wie oben)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  35r leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Kritische Edition: Enea Silvio Piccolomini, Libellus Dialogorum, hrsg. von Simone Iaria. Rom 2015 (Edizione nazionale dei testi umanistici), S. 3-126, Hs. genannt.}

