\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sequitur tractatulus magistri Iohannis Gerson cancellarii parisiiensis de duplici statu \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (97v) Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Pax quam omnes conseruare conuenit cum omnibus maxime \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  (98v-99v) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Pro statu priuilegiatorum secuntur consideraciones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Status priuilegiatorum ad predicandum et confessiones audiendum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 christiane religionis si vult inveniri. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit opusculum de statu curatorum et priuilegiatorum magistri Gerson\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
