\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Collacio de omnibus sanctis 1430 magistri Iohannis Plate etc incompleta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Laudate dominum in sanctis eius \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (Ps 150). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ita scribitur originaliter psalmo 150\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  transsumptiue vero in solempnitate omnium sanctorum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (101v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Laudate dominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Egregii et eximii viri patres \u8230 \'85 verba illa secundum doctores Cassiodori videlicet Nicolai de Lira\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ad litteram sunt et fuerunt verba \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85}

