\pard\sl252\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa165\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 156ra-186ra {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes Schlitpacher de Weilheim}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Claviger psaltorum}}
\par \pard\sl252\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa165\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Nachtrag Schwerzenbeck: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur clauiger psalterii editus per venerabilem virum magistrum Iohannem Schlippacher Mellicensis cenobii monachum professum. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Darunter Besitzeintrag: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Iste liber attinet monasterio Tegernsee\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (156rb) Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In Christi nomine 1460\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Circa librum psalmorum est sciendum quod quamquam aput Hebreos teste beato Ieronimo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  (157ra-186ra) Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Beatus vir \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (Ps 1,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Circa illum primum psalmum sciendum quod ipse est sine titulo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  ... (186ra) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9bAlleluia\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Laudate dominum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (Ps 150,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Titulus est alleluia ut supra \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 laudabunt te ad quam laudem nos perducat qui cum patre \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit clauiger psalterii 1460 in vigilia sancti Laurencii martyris \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [1460 August 9]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Notandum quod iste praesens libellus est editus a venerabili patre Iohanne Slitpacher de Weilham anno ab incarnacione domini 1439. Ihesu fili dei misere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [re]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  mei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \endash  186rb-188v leer.
\par \pard\sl252\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa165\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Parallelhss.: Melk, Benediktinerstift, Cod. 960 (1, A 1), p. 414-423. \endash  Melk, Benediktinerstift, Cod. 1381 (280, E 71), p. 1-197. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 VL 8 (1992), Sp. 735 Nr. V,1a (Franz Josef Worstbrock, Hs. genannt mit unvollst\u228 \'e4ndiger Signatur: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Clm 18524\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ). \endash  Stegm\u252 \'fcller, RB 4951. }

