\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 85r-125r \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Psalterium
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In rationali diuinorum officiorum parte sexta ante cursum de tempore aduentus domini sic inquit Guilhelmus episcopus Minacensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Est sciendum quod beatus Iheronimus tempore Damasi pape correxit psalterium lxx \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Beatus vir \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Ps 1,1) ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 in loco quem disposuisti eis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (Ps 83,7) // Textabbruch, 125v-132v leer.}

