\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit tractatus de disciplina religiosorum in conuersando cum aliis in ambulando in stando in habitu in gestu et in silencio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De disciplina ait psalmista psalmo 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : Apprehendite disciplinam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (Ps 2,12). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Apprehendite ait id est uoluntarie sumite \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 perfecta apprehensio ad quam nos perducat ... Amen \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   }

