\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (1ar) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipiunt sermones beati Ieronimi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sermo de natiuitate dominica in ipsius diei commendacionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hodie verus sol ortus est \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (2r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sermo beati Ieronimi presbyteri de epiphania exponens grecum vocabulum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ...\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dies epiphaniorum greco nomine sic uocatur quod enim nos apparicionem uel ostensionem dicimus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (3v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sermo beati Ieronimi presbyteri de quadragesima \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ...\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quoniam quomodo miles semper exercetur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (13v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sermo beati Ieronimi presbyteri de assumpcione beate Marie virginis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ...\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Scientes fratres dilectissimi auctori \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Sieben Sermones, hier Hieronymus zugeschrieben.  Zu 1: Ps.-Hieronymus, Epistola XXV seu sermo de nativitate domini, PL 30, 220-221. \endash  Zu 2: S. Hieronymi Opera omnia, ed. G. Morin. Turnhout 1958 (CC 78), S. 530-532. \endash  Zu 3: Ps-Hieronymus, Epistola XXVII seu sermo de quadragesima, PL 30, 223f. \endash  Zu 7: Ps.-Hieronymus, Epistola X, PL 30, 143-145.}

