\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (74r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de sanctis angelis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b [nachgetragen: \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo magistri Heinrici de Holandia fratris ordinis Carthus.\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ] \endash  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Angeli eorum semper \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Mt 18,10). \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Patres ac fratres dilectissimi cum ab eterno et ante secula summa illa maiestas abissalis sapiencia \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (83r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo sancti Maximi episcopi de natiuitate sancti Iohannis baptiste\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cunctorum quidem prophetarum fratres karissimi veneranda recordacio est \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (83v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo eiusdem de sanctis apostolis Petro et Paulo\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Beatissimorum appostolorum \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (!)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Petri et Pauli inseparabilem fidem \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 36\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (216r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo sancti Augustini episcopi de circumcisione domini\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ipse puer paruus ex semine \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \u8250 \'9b\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Anno domini etc lxx\plain \f2\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  in die sancti Alexii\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b [1470 Juli 17] \endash   \plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 37\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (216v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de sancto Crisogono martire\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Venite post me \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Mt 4,19). \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In verbis istis sanctus patronus noster Crisogonus cuius hodie natalia celebramus \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \u8250 \'9b\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 finitus est sermo iste anno domini m\plain \f2\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  cccc\plain \f2\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  78\plain \f2\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 uo\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  in die sancti Erasmi episcopi et martiris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b [1478 Juni 3]. \endash  (120r) Datierung: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Anno domini 1469 penultima die aprilis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b [1469 April 29]. \endash  (148r) Datierung: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1468\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  95v, 111r-v, 125v, 154ar leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb240\sa240\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs20\cf1 1 = Henricus de Coesveldia, Sermones capitulares (auch in Innsbruck, ULBT, Cod. 434, 89v). \endash   2 = Ps.-Maximus Taurinensis, Homilia 66, PL 57, 387-390. \endash  3 = Ps.-Maximus Taurinensis, Homilia 70, PL 57, 397-400. \endash  36 = Augustinus, Sermo 369, PL 39, 1656. \endash  (161r) Wiener Universit\u228 \'e4tspredigt, Andreas de Sch\u228 \'e4rding zugeschrieben. \endash  Weitere Sermones u.a. Henricus de Coesveldia, Iohannes Geuss, Bernhard von Clairvaux, Augustinus und anderen Kirchenv\u228 \'e4tern zugeschrieben.}

