\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermones Odonis de aliquibus sanctis secuntur hic\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (221r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In anunciacione sancte Marie virginis sermo\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Missus est Gabriel \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Lc 1,26). \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominus aparuit in flamma in medio rubi ignis \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (227r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo in natiuitate sancte Marie \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...\u8249 \'8b \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Liber generacionis \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Mt 1,1). \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In libro sapiencie 18 dicitur: dum medium silencium tenerent omnia \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (233r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo in assumpcione sancte Marie virginis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Intrauit Ihesus in quoddam castellum \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Lc 10,38). \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cum in hoc ewangelio non fiat mencio de beata virgine merito quaeritur \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 11\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (284v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo eiusdem de transfiguracione domini\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Assumpsit Ihesus Petrum \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Mt 17,1). \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In transfiguracione domini vi erant persone praesentes \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 12\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (294r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo eiusdem \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...\u8249 \'8b \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ecce nos reliquimus \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Mt 19,27). \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Per sedes xii intelligitur vniuersitas iudicantium \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \u8250 \'9b\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1469. Expliciunt sermones Odonis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Schneyer, RLS 4, S. 483-498, die hier zitierten Sermones S. 488 Nr. 76, 75, 78, 79, 73.}

