\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sentencie de sacramento\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quod sacramentum altaris sepius in ecclesia celebratur non ex infirmitate tanti sacramenti fieri credendum est \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 de qua nos incerti sumus quare fecisset non accepit non fecit // \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Textabbruch [die sechs Zeilen davor rot durchgestrichen]. \endash  190v leer.}

