\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (25ra) Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota sedente sancto Gregorio mandauit sancto Paterio ut ea que sparsisset late colligeret \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit prologus Paterii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cum beatissimi atque apostolici Gregorii pontificis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (25vb) capitulatio. \endash  (26ra-374va) Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In nomine sancte trinitatis incipit liber testimoniorum veteris testamenti \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In exposicione beati Iob liber xxvii capitulo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [radiert]\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Uirtutes angelice quae in diuino amore \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 conspicit merore turbatus hylarescit. 
