\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 109ra-134ra \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Notulae ex libris Bernhardi Claraevallensis
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (109ra) Kapitel\u252 \'fcbersicht. \endash  (109ra-134ra) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipiunt notule valde bone ex diuersis libris beati Bernardi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [korrigiert: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 excerpte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 qualiter monachus con[vivere] et proficere debeat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Pvtas parua res sit scire viuere \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 experieris nisi in patria ad quam nos perducere dignetur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen. Et sic est finis.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Parallelhss.: M\u252 \'fcnchen, UB, 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Cod. ms 679, 138rb-168v. }

