\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (134rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sermo beati Bernardi abbatis de aduentu domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Uolo vos fratres non ignorare tempus visitacionis nostre \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (135va) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sermo beati Bernardi de aduentu domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Si deuote celebramus aduentum domini id facimus quod oportet \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (135vb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sermo beati Bernardi abbatis de vigilia natiuitatis domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hodiernum quidem sermonem ordinis nostri conswetudo non habet \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (138rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sermo beati Bernardi abbatis de natiuitate domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Grandis quidem est dilectissimi hodierna dominice natiuitatis sollempnitas \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (140ra) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sermo beati Bernardi abbatis de circumcisione domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Postquam consummati sunt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (Lc 2,21). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hinc sunt quod non modo in pondere et mensura \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  ... \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit per me fratrem Oswaldum monachum in Tegernsee\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 In dieser Zusammenstellung auch in M\u252 \'fcnchen, UB, 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Cod. ms 679, 168v-176r. \endash  Edition: Sancti Bernardi opera, Bd. 4 (wie oben), S. 191-195 (Sermo 1), 195-196 (Sermo 2), 220-228 (Sermo 3), 244-251 (Sermo 4), 273-276 (Sermo 5). }

