\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Nachtrag Schwerzenbeck: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Alius planctus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De miseria mundi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hew hew mundi vita quare me delectas ita ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tunc cessabunt persequentes et regnabunt pacientes. Amen. Deo gracias.
