\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (48r) Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Praefacio in tractatum de esu et abstinencia carnium monachorum egregii doctoris Iohannis de Palomar \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amantissimo patri dompno Iohanni abbati \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cum primum vestre paternitatis accepi noticiam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (48v-55r) Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Surgent in iudicio filii Rechab homines ex illo carnali populo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 cuiuslibet melius sentientis. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit. Compleui in vigilia assumpcionis virginis gloriose genitricis dei \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [August 14] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 in eiusdem cenobio Eetal \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [Ettal] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vulgariter nuncupato\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Abschrift von der Hand des Abtes des Wiener Schottenstifts, Johannes von Ochsenhausen oder Martin von Leibitz. \endash  Horacio Santiago-Otero, Manuscritos de autores medievales hispanos I. Madrid 1987 (Medievalia et humanistica 3), S. 147f.}

