\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominus Caspar ordinarius super constitutione de esu carminum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Circa esum carnium aliter sunt prohibiti seculares et aliter monachi quia seculares carnibus vti possunt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ut in constitutione Benedictina statuimus. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  Im Anschluss 91r-v nachgetragene theologische Notizen. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  
