\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (46r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Adest nobis dilectissimi dies venerabilis virginis dedicatus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ieronimus in sermone Cogitis me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Si deum karissimi ore prophetico in sanctis suis laudare iubemur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (47v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Bernhardus in sermone de aduentu ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Virga de radice \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Is 11,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Virgo dei genitrix est flos filius eius \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 26\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (61r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Exquisita mundo gaudia hodierne festiuitatis nouitas \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... 
