\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (260vb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominus prope est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quatuor sunt genera hominum quibus dominus prope est \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominica v post pasca\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Petite et accipietis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Lc 11,9). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nota quod est gaudium vacuum semiplenum plenum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (261rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In annunciacione Marie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Notandum quod in scriptura 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 or \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 dies plenos invenimus beatam virginem habuisse \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (261vb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de die iudicii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Et ego resuscitabo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Io 6,40). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hic dies tantus erit et ex sua magnitudine singulariter \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (262rb) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominica secunda in aduentu domini \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Virtutes celorum mouebuntur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Mt 24,29). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Per virtutes accipimus spiritus anglicos \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  263v-265v leer.}

