\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tractatus egregius contra vicium dampnate proprietatis religiosorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Venerabilissimo in Christo patri ac domino, domino Cistercii \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 in sacro concilio generali anno domini m\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  quadringentesimo xv\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1415 !] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Constancie celebrato \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Pro euidenti et neccessaria salute animarum nostrarum querimus vtrum uel quomodo abbates uel monachi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sicut in regula nostra praecipitur continue prae oculis haberemus. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  112r-v leer.
