\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 113r-119r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Bernardus de Waging}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Praeparatorium ad missam per gratiam et ad communionem}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Preparatorium ad missam per gratiam et ad communionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Et primo de dignitate hospitis. Rex regum dominus dominancium quamuis sibi ipsi sufficiat et nullius indigeat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 infinitum filium tuum dominum nostrum Iesum Christum. Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  Darunter (119r) Oratio: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 O dulcissime domine Iesu Christe inflamma cor meum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  Dazwischen (115v) Johannes Schlitpacher (GND 100966446), Versus: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hoc vite proprie tu regimen retine. \endash  Forme viuendi quo tendas perfice finem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Walther, Initia Nr. 6772). \endash  119v-122v leer. 
