\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (123r) Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipiunt cerimonie regularis obseruancie \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit prologus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quamuis beatissimi patris nostri Benedicti regula sufficientissime ac clare regularis vite exprimat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (123r-145v) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit prologus. De sonando ad collacionem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Omni itaque tempore quando bis manducatur facta cena et postquam manducauerint \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 nil aliud quaerere quam deum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  (145v-146r) Index capitularum. \endash  146v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Tegernseer Parallel\u252 \'fcberl. u.a.: Clm 19639, 224r-268r. \endash  Edition: Breviarium caerimoniarum monasterii Mellicensis (Textus y), hrsg. von Joachim F. Angerer. Siegburg 1985-1987 (Corpus consuetudinum monasticarum 11,1-2), Hs. genannt.}

