\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 147r-176r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Iohannes de Spira}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Epistolae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (147r) [Zeitnah nachgetragen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Epistola fratris Iohannis de Spira ad quendam doctorem religionem nostram ingressum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . Noue conversacionis et vite laudabilem perseueranciam ac felicem consummacionem. Audiui quantum magnificauit dominus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (147v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Subiecto gregi secundum doctrinam apostoli se ipsum praebere formam viuendi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (149r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Vigilanti animo vicinum expectare aduentum domini \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (155v) [S]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 aluti anime sollerter cum effectu prospicere domine ac frater in Christo dilecte \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (160r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quicumque profitetur secundum aliquam regulam approbatam per ecclesiam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (165r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Effici pauperem spiritu et humilem Ihesum per veram humilitatem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit per me fratrem Oswaldum Nott professum in Tegernsee. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Daneben nachgetragen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Anno 1457. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Neun Briefe des Melker Priors Iohannes Wischler de Spira. \endash  Lit.: Teresa Agethen, Apographa epistolarum. Die Tegernseer Briefsammlung des 15. Jahrhunderts. Untersuchung und Regesten-Edition. M\u252 \'fcnster 2019 (Beitr\u228 \'e4ge zur Geschichte des alten M\u246 \'f6nchtums und des Benediktinertums N. F. II/2), S. 174.}

