\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tractatus de nobilitate reuerendi magistri Iohannis Nyder ordinis predicatorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b (138r) Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quoniam in multis secularium locucionibus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (138r-154v) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In quo vere consistat nobilitas prima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Circa hoc in quo consistat nobilitas septem sunt oppiniones \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (!) ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et sic patet veritas requisiti. Explicit per me fratrem Oswaldum Nott monachum et professum in Tegernsee. 
