\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1r-62r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Iohannes Gerson}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : De consolatione theologiae (cum glossis)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit liber primus de consolacione theologie Iohannis Gerson \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 editus ab eodem post concilium generale sancte et catholice ecclesie celebratum in Constancia \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (1r) Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quecumque scripta sunt ait magnus ille discipulus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (1v-62r) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Primo metro primi libri de consolacione philosophie \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sepe peregrinas volucer transmissus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 per pacienciam et consolationem scripturarum spem habeamus. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  (1r) Beginn Glossierung: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In prohemio notantur 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 or\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  cause theologice consolationis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... Dar\u252 \'fcber am oberen Blattrand Nota zum \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 intellectum discursiuum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  62v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Edition: Gerson, \u338 \'8cuvres compl\u232 \'e8tes 9, S. 185-245 Nr. 449.}

