\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Liber exhortatorius beati Basilii ad monachos. Informacio Basilii ad monachos \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Audi fili mi moniciones patris tui et inclina aurem tuam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 deus diligentibus se, quod nobis etc. Explicit. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit epistola beati Basilii ad filios spirituales\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b
