\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ad Bohemos de usu communionis. Prima pars\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dirige domine deus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Ps 5,9). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quoniam varie et innumerabiles sunt quaestiones quae ad opera obscurissima dei \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ad eternam pacem triumphantis ecclesie Christo duce transferri mereamur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (121r) am unteren Blattrand: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Iohannis de Capistrano de ordine fratrum minorum discipuli sancti Bernardini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Hier Iohannes Capistrano zugeschrieben. \endash  Nicolaus Cusanus, Opera omnia, Bd. XV/1: Opuscula III. Fasciculus 1. Opuscula Bohemica. De usu communionis. Epistulae ad Bohemos. Consilium. Intentio, hrsg. von Stephan Nottelmann/Hans Georg Senger. Hamburg 2014.}

