\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 141r-152r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Bonaventura}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : Regula novitiorum
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (141r) Tabula: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit tabula libri Bonauenture de institucione nouiciorum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...\u8249 \'8b \endash  Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sequitur prologus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Renouamini in nouitate sensus vestri \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (141r-152r) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De officio celebrando primum capitulum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cum spiritualia sint semper et vbique in omnibus praeponenda \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a multis possidetur ad quod nos perducat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen. Explicit tractatus Bonauenture \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 anno 1447 in die sancti Arsacii \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [November 12] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  152v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Edition: Bonaventura, Opera omnia, Bd. 8. Quaracchi 1898, S. 475-490. \endash  Lit.: Distelbrink, Bonaventura, S. 52 Nr. 53.}

