\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (99v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tractatus reverendissimi in Christo patris domini Nicolai cardinalis tituli sancti Petri ad vincula \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ad venerabilem patrem dominum Caspar abbatem et fratres in Tegernsee de visione dei \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... darunter Kapitelverzeichnis. \endash  (100r-124v) Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Pandam nunc que uobis dilectissimis fratribus ante promiseram circa facilitatem mistice theologie \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 tibi deo absoluto in eternitate vite gloriose. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Reverendissimi patris domini Nicolai cardinalis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 liber de visione dei ad fratres in Tegernsee. Explicit anno 1455 in vigilia assumpcionis gloriose virginis Marie \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1455 August 14]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ihesus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (100r) am oberen Blattrand: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1455 scriptum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  125r-126v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Edition: Nicholas of Cusa\rquote s Dialectical Mysticism. Text, Translation and Interpretive Study of  De Visione Dei, hrsg. von Jasper Hopkins. Minneapolis \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 1988, diese Hs. Sigle \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20\cf1 O\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , vgl. ebd., S. 102.}

