\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De missis votiuis pro defunctis secuntur dubia et solutiones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b [Nachtrag Schwerzenbeck: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 magistri Iacobi Carthusiensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Filia cuiusdam layici nuper defuncta in vita disposuit sibi redimi quingentas missas speciales \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 quantum de satisfaccione penarum animabus per missas dimittuntur. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  Daran unmittelbar anschlie\u223 \'dfend (215r-v) Nota: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hainricus de Hassia super 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 to\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  misse psalmi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 potest prouenire de centum. Haec Hainricus de Hassia. Editor huius opusculi extitit pater Iacobus sacre theologie professor ordinis Carthusiensium \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 circa annum incarnacionis dominice M cccc lxiiii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 m\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  auctorisante illa et alia sua scripta seu edita sanctissimo patre meo pro tunc papa Nicolao quinto. 1464. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  216r-217v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Druck: GW 13915-13916. \endash  Meier (wie oben), S. 33 Nr. 34, Hs. nicht genannt.}

