\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (60r-61v) Index capitulorum: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Liber iste intitulatur lauacrum consciencie omnium sacerdotum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Capitula huius libri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b ... \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1470. Sequitur prefacio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b  \endash  (62r) Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit prefacio huius libri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Lauamini mundi estote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Ies 1,16). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ex quo nos sacerdotes omnino non communem statum cum popularibus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (64r-222v) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De ornamentis sacerdotum. Capitulum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Lauamini mundi estote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Vbi primo sciendum quod clerici debent esse ornati duplici ornamento \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ut sacerdos et populus cum pace et benediccione redeant ad propria. Amen. Sequitur oracio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit lauacrum consciencie feria 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  post inuencionem sancte crucis anno domini M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  cccc\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  septuagesimo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1470 Mai] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 scriptum per me fratrem Oswaldum Nott de Tittmaning et monachum in Tegernsee\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Druck: GW 13876-13884. \endash  Bloomfield, Incipits Nr. 2902. }

