\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 80r-106r \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Briefe von und an {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes de Capistrano}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  (1451-1454)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (80r) Georg von Podiebrad an Iohannes de Capistrano: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Iohanni de Capistrano ordinis minorum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Nachtrag Schwerzenbeck: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Georgius de Constancz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Licet tuarum serie litterarum non plus mihi salutis offerre uidearis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Prage sabbato ante \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [festum] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 natiuitatis domini nostri Ihesu Christi annorum ab incarnacione eiusdem millesimo quadringentesimo quinquagesimo tercio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [1453]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Georgius de Constat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Kunstadt]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et de Bodiebrot gubernator et magister curie regni Boemie. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Iohannes de Capistrano an Georg von Podiebrad: [Nachtrag Schwerzenbeck: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Epistola fratris Iohannis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ].\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Si scirem mi Georgi litteras tuo nomine mihi nuper obsignatas ex tuo pectore emanasse \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ex Cracouia xxviiii Ianuarii m\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  cccc\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quinquagesimo quarto \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [1454 Januar 29]. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (88r) Iohannes de Capistrano an Georg von Podiebrad: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Iohannes de Capistrano ad Georgium de Constat et de Podiebrat. Luciferine superbie se fatetur alumnum quisquis eterne salutis immemor \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ex Cracouia 1454 die vicesima nona Ianuarii \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [1454 Januar 29]. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (89r-v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Missiva Cromiersis(?) et sacerdotum ibidem fratri Iohanni de Capristano \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Sabbato post \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Stephani]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  regis anno li\u176 \'b0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [1451]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Ad meliorem tendere et ab inchoato ... \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 datum Cromierziz sabbato post Stepahni regis per sacerdotes ibidem. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (89v) Iohannes de Capistrano an Iohannes de Borotin: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Magnifice baro et potens. Frater Iohannes de Capistrano ordinis minorum minimus et indignus cum spiritu salutari gratiam luminis sempiterni. Conuenit strennuis pugilibus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quod erroneum est defensare nititur. //\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Textabbruch\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Parallelhs.: Wien, \u214 \'d6NB, Cod. Ser. n. 3344, 185r-v (Brief 1), 185v-191v (Brief 2), 191r-v (Brief 3) (https://manuscripta.at/?ID=7017). \endash  Brief 5 auch in Melk, Benediktinerstift, Cod. 800 (863, P 57), 7v-9v (https://manuscripta.at/?ID=40551), datiert auf 1451 September 22. Edition von Brief 5 in: Zviwotopis swat\u233 \'e9ho Jana Kapistr\u225 \'e1na, hrsg. von F. Walouch. Br\u252 \'fcnn 1858, S. 792-799.}

