\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 195r-199v \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Legenda de s. Apollonia
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit legenda de sancta Appollania virgine ac martire nec non et regina. Anno 68 scripta huc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (195r) Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Colletemur dilectissimi katholice fidei cultores deuocione ea que poterimus ad gloriam et praeconium gloriosissimi nominis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  (195v-199v) Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Apollania Ysopi regis filia Alexandrie cuiusdam sancti patris precibus ardore sancti spiritus inflammata \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sculptas constitui fecit deauratas et splendidas ad ipsius reuerenciam et honorem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash  Darunter (199v) Confirmatio der Legende durch Bischof Berthold von Freising \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 anno domini m\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ccc\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  nonagesimo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [1390] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 proxima feria 3\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  post octauas pasce.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 nicht nachweisbar?}

