\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 201r-205r \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Albericus Casinensis: Sermo in s. Scholasticam
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Epistola domini Stephani episcopi Aniciensis in vitam sancte Scholastice uirginis sororis sancti Benedicti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tempore quo Iustinus imperator et senior Romane reipublice iura moderabatur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 usque in diem hodiernam operari non cessat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Hier Stephanus Aniciensis zugeschrieben. \endash  Edition: Anselmo Lentini, L\rquote omilia e la vita di S. Scolastica di Alberico Cassinense, in: Benedictina 3 (1949), S. 217-238. \endash  BHL 7522.}

