\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 150r-167r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Leonhardus Estermann (?)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  et alii: Sermones 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (150r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ihesus Maria. Sermo in die concepcionis sancte Marie 1509. \endash  Tota pulchra es \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Ct 4,7). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Illuxit nobis charissimi hodie dies festiua concepcionis gloriose virginis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (151v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Audi Ierusalem. De primo praecepto sermo. \endash  Non habetis deos \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Ex 20,3). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Charissimi quamuis dominus deus cuilibet homini legem indidisset \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (156r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominus doctor Osualdus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Straubinger\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 praebendarius noster 1509. \endash  In festo concepcionis sanctae Marie scripsit. Thema \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... [Anfang unleserlich] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ergo quia peccator sum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (164r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Magister Erasmus sacre theologie ... Nota: fecit nobis collacionem in conuersione sancti Pauli \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [Januar 25] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 anno 1510. \endash  In omnibus te ipsum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Tit 2,7). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Replica in doctrina per bonam intelligentiam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (165r) Hinweis: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sequenti 4 feria fecit nobis collacionem in vulgari. \endash  Thema: Regnum dei non est \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (I Cor IV,20). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dicit Augustinus quod pax est tranquillitas ordinis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (166r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De nono et decimo praeceptis in dominica Iudica. \endash  Non concupisces rem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Ex 20,26). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In hoc sermone tria dicentur. Primum erit de verbo euangelii hodierne dominice \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  Dazwischen (153v-155r) Texterg\u228 \'e4nzungen zu Sermones \u252 \'fcber die Erbs\u252 \'fcnde bzw. zum 1. Gebot. \endash  (155r-v) Notizen zur Kanonistik.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Darunter vielleicht Autographa Estermanns? \endash  3 = dem Tegernseer Praebendar Oswald Straubinger zugeschrieben. Vgl. Repertorium academicum Germanicum: Oswald Straubinger (RAG-ID: ngUK5n971TM73jqCoVDj9SgX), https://resource.database.rag-online.org/ngUK5n971TM73jqCoVDj9SgX,  02.03.2022. \endash  6 = einem Magister Erasmus zugeschrieben.}

