\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 153r-177v \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermones
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (153r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sanctificamini cras enim faciet \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Ios 3,5)\u8249 \'8b [Nachtrag Schwerzenbeck: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Collacio in vigilia nativitatis dominici in Augusta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In nomine benedicte trinitatis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Reverende in Christo pater \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 quia teste scriptura non est in manu hominis vita eius \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... (157v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In Augusta in vigilia natiuitatis ad conuentum monasterii sancti Vdalrici anno m\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  cccc\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  xli\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1441]. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (159r) Nachtrag Schwerzenbeck: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo seu collacio domini Stephani abbatis Mellicensis cenobii ad eius conuentum de passione dominica. \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Christus passus est \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (I Pt 2,21)\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Venerabiles patres ac fratres karissimi ad reparandam ruinam illam magnam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (171v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Christus factus est \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Phil 2,8). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Verba sunt ecclesie hoc sacro triduo sponsi sui \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 in Tegernsee ad conuentum anno l\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 mo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1450] ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (172r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Magistri Iohannis St\u228 \'e4dlar \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 in theologia baccalarii formati Wyenne in aula theologorum pronunciatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Si consurrexistis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Col 3,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Reverendi patres \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 non inmerito in hac dominice resurrectionis die exultare nos hortatur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  Dazwischen (158r, 171v) und vereinzelt an den R\u228 \'e4ndern Notizen vermutlich von der Hand des Johannes Keck.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 1 und 3 = vermutlich von der Hand des Johannes Keck (Autographa?) \endash  2 = Stephanus Spanberg de Melk: Sermo de passione domini, auch in Melk, Benediktinerstift, Cod. 775 (345, G 5), 143r-149r (https://manuscripta.at/?ID=40533). \endash  (172r) Wiener Universit\u228 \'e4tspredigt vermutlich von Johannes Stedler de Landshut, vgl. Repertorium Academicum Germanicum: Johannes Stedler (RAG-ID: ngEU9V577DM36taMyE7t6CqH5DR), https://resource.database.rag-online.org/ngEU9V577DM36taMyE7t6CqH5DR}

