\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 177v-201r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Iohannes Keck}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : Sermones
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (177v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo sequens pronunciatus est per magistrum Iohannem Kek postea monachum in Tegernsee in sacro Basiliensi concilio coram sanctissimo domino Felice papa v\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 to\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  in festo trinitatis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [Mai 27] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 anno 1442\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tres vnum sunt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (I Io 5,8) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sanctissime pater \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 locuturo mihi de summa ac indiuidua trinitate \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (180v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De verbis martilogii \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  in vigilia \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [nativitatis] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 domini. Magister Iohannes Keck anno 46\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  Natus est nobis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Lc 2,11) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... Vox illa patres et fratres quam audistis ex martirologio lectam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (182r) [\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Collacio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 anno etc xlviiii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1449] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 in vigilia nativitatis ad conuentum in \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tegernsee\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge von Schwerzenbeck]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ut ait Ysidorus in libro de officiis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 natalis domini dies ea de causa a patribus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (185v) [Nachtrag Schwerzenbeck: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Collacio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 in Tegernsee in vigilia \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [nativitatis] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 domini anno l\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 mo\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1450]. \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ecce euangelizo vobis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Lc 2,10)\u8249 \'8b ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Reuerende in Christo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Beatus Fulgentius in quodam sermone huius diei sacratissime gaudia \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (191v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Anno li\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1451] [Nachtrag Schwerzenbeck: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Collacio in vigilia nativitatis domini Ihesu Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ]. \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Gloria in excelsis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Lc 2,14) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et sunt verba multitudinum angelorum ad pastores denunciata, ad pastores, inquam, vigilantes super gregem suum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (194r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In Tegernsee anno l\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1450]\u8249 \'8b Nachtrag Schwerzenbeck: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de sancto Benedicto abbate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ecce nos reliquimus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Mt 19,27)\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quia beatissimi patris nostri legislatoris et patroni principue annue solemnitatis festiua \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (199v) Nachtrag Schwerzenbeck: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Collatio seu exhortatio in festo professionis quorundam fratrum. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Confortamini in domino \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Eph 6,10) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quia secundum beatum Bernhardum in isto mundo positi sumus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  193v, 201v-203v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Vermutlich Autographa. \endash  1 = Druck: VD16 K 584 (Tegernsee 1574). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 VL 4 (1983), Sp. 1100-1102 (Heribert Rossmann, Hs. genannt).}

