\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (2r) Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1484\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cum animaduerterem corpusculi mei exilii resolucionem dietim appropinquare celeriter \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (2r-3v) Index capitulorum. \endash  (4r-69r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tractatus ad bene et secure moriendum praeparatorius. Capitulum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Vigilate quia nescitis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Mt 25,13). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Estote parati \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Lc 12,40). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ingens periculum temporius permaxima cautela possibili remediandum extat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 opusculo imperfecto bene et secure moriendi. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nachtrag Schwerzenbeck: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit tractatus per modum sermonis de secure moriendo. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  69v leer.
