ng1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Parasti in dulcedine \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Ps 67,11). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hodie colimus sollemnitatem celebrem iocundam omnique suauitate refertam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... 
