\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tractatus magistri Thome de Haselpach vniuersitatis Wiennensis de quinque sensibus corporis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Postquam dei dono taliter qualiter pauca pro intellectu rudium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  simplicium exemplariter \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 cuius ista organa comparata sunt despiciunt. Hec ille. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  56v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 1. Fassung. \endash  Druck: unter Nikolaus von Dinkelsb\u252 \'fchl, Tractatus octo, Stra\u223 \'dfburg 1516. \endash  Lhotsky, Ebendorfer, S. 81 Nr. 89 (2. Fassung). \endash  Madre, S. 323-328.}

