\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de assumpcione beate Marie virginis factus anno domini 89\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Intrauit Ihesus in quoddam castellum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Lc 10,38). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Mirum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 potest uideri aliquibus quomodo in praecipua ista solemnitate assumpcionis beate virginis non legitur euangelium \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  60v leer.
