\pard\fi0\li0\qc\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 II (61-118)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 61r-113v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Thomas Ebendorfer de Haselbach}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : Collationes de confessione
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermones magistri Thome de Haselpach de confessione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (61r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ecce nunc tempus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...\u8249 \'8b (II Cor 6,2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Haymo exponens verba praemissa dicit: Tempus acceptum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (65v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo secundus de confessione. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Iniquitates dicere properas et confiteri suadet propheta ut iustificetur homo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (72r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo tercius de confessione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sapiens dicit Sapiencie 19: Qui negligit viam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Prv 19,16) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et Ieremie 48 dicitur: Maledictus qui facit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (92v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sextus sermo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Precipit sapiens Proverbiorum 6to: Surge festina \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Prv 6,3) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 id est propriam animam tuam lapsam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (100r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In proverbiis suis Salomon 28 capitulo dicit: Qui confessus fuerit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Prv 28,13) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 scilicet vere pure integre \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (106v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo octauus. \endash  Saluator dicit decem leprosos Luce 17: Ite ostendite \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Lc 17,14) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 de quo Augustinus in De consensu ewangelistarum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Expliciunt collaciones \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [nachgetragen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 de confessione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 magistri Thome de Haselpach anno etc liii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1453].
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Lhotsky, Ebendorfer, S. 75 Nr. 39.}

