\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (53r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In Christi nomine incipit collacio facienda a priore in capitulo pro fratribus sabato ante Inuocauit quando offerunt libros et volunt facere oblaciones suas \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ...\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Reuerende in Christo pater ... quamuis nulla sint tempora quae non inueniantur plena diuinis misteriis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (54v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Alia collacio in die parasceues\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequere me ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Mt 8,22). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et sunt verba nostri saluatoris hodie pro nostra salute crucifixi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... }

