\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (57r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sermo de vno martyre vel aliquo sancto vbi populus conuenit ad negociandum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Negociamini dum venio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (Lc 19,13). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et ut intelligatis me clarius hec verba sic habunt originem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (60r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sermo alius vel secundus de aliquo sancto vbi populus conuenit ad nundinas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Negociamini dum venio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (Lc 19,13). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Carissimi, quamuis hec verba dixit dominus Ihesus suis discipulis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (63v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sermo in festo apostolorum Petri et Pauli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Celi enarrant gloriam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (Ps 18,2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Carissimi, verba quae dixi a principio describit sanctus propheta Dauid \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 65\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (291r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In quinquagesima de vaschango \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Faschango = Fasching, Fastnacht]\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cecus clamabat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (Lc 18,38). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Audistis carissimi historiam ewangelicam, quam si advertistis, perpendere poteritis fatuitatem vestram \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 66\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (295v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sermo de corea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cum saltasset filia \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (Mc 6,22). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Locuturus ad laudem dei atque ad reuocandum homines a multis peccatis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  Dazwischen 118v-119v, 288v-291v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Lit.: siehe 13r.}

