\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (83r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo deuotus et vtilis de visitacione Marie \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 anno xv\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 c\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 5 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1505]. \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Respexit humilitatem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Lc 1,46). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Carissimi verba vestri caritati proposita sunt verba beatissime virginis Marie cuius hodie festum eius visitacionis ad Elizabeth agimus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (84v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de Maria virginis assumpcione et de nouem choris angelorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In voluntate tua deduxisti \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Ps 72,24). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Carissimi verba vestri caritate proposita ... Quam bonus Israel ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (Ps 72,1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sonat de dei bonitate \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (88v) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Si placuerit assumatur pro themate praecedentis sermonis atque pro paeambulo sequens materia. \endash  Assumpta est Maria \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Carissimi hesternum ieiunium et hodierna festiuitas nobis hodie praedicant \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 28\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (140v) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Alius sermo de natiuitate domini \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Puer Ihesus crescebat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Lc 2,40). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In Christo dilecti verba vestre caritati proposita ... Circa que verba est notandum quod in mundo per experientiam videmus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 29\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (141v) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de aliquo patrono vel patrona \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Iubilate deo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Ps 99,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In Christo dilecti, verba vestri caritate proposita \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et sancta mater ecclesia eisdem verbis vesperis et in matutinis hodie ad laudem sancti N. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 30\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (143r) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Alia collacio breuis atque leuis fienda in peregrinacione laicorum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Primo comittatur confessio generalis populi pro deuocionis exaudicionisque igne exercitando \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Lit.: siehe oben 9v.}

