\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sancta trinitas \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... [darunter Eintrag getilgt]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quia habundabit iniquitas \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Mt 24,12). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hec sunt verba domini omnium prophetarum prophete excellentissimi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ex legenda Poncii martiris de Valeriano cesare. Valerianus imperator licet potens \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hoc exemplum est missum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 domino atque venerabili magistro Vdalrico Greynolt plebano in Schonga \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [Schongau] ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ad publicandum populo in laudem et gloriam domini nostri Iesu Christi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  204ar-205v leer. }

