\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (206r) Hinweis zu den folgenden Sermones. \endash  206v leer. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (207r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\cf1 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 M ccccc \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1500] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 primus sermo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\cf1 Homo cum in honore \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\cf1 ... (Ps 48,21). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\cf1 Carissimi heri sancta mater ecclesia in vesperis cepit reducere ad memoriam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\cf1 (209r) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Secundus sermo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9b... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo 2us in aduentu domini \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sanctificauit tabernaculum suum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Ps 46,6). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Carissimi hodie sancta mater ecclesia praedicat nobis festum sanctissime virginis Marie \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (210v) \u8250 \'9b... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo 3us in aduentu domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ecce dominus veniet \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Sach 14,5). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Carissimi hodie octo diebus audivit caritas vestra quomodo sancta mater ecclesia \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 46\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (315\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de assumpcione beate virginis Marie \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Assumpta est Maria \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In Christi dilecti filii et filie verba vestre caritati proposita cecinit heri in vesperis et hodie in matutinis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 47\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (317r) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de natiuitate virginis Marie \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hodie nata est virgo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In Christo dilecti hesternum ieiunium necnon hodierna dies omnibus Christianis praedicant \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 48\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (319r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... Sermo de purificacione beate Marie virginis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Postquam impleti sunt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Lc 2,22). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In domino Ihesu dilecti verba vestre proposita caritati \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Circa que verba occurrit item questio vtrum decebat Mariam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  Dazwischen 241v und 295r-v leer. \endash  321r-321a leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Lit.: siehe oben 9v.}

