\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (327v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... Incipiunt sermones de dei domini x praeceptis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Si vis ingredi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Mt 19,17). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hec sunt domini Ihesu verba et consilium valde efficax \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (329v) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Secundum domini praeceptum. \endash  Non assumes nomen \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Ex 20,7). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Verba vestre proposita caritati \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sunt secundum domini praeceptum quod omnipotens deus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (331r) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tercius sermo est mixtus videlicet de concepcione beate Marie virginis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  Cum iocunditate concepcionem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In Christo dilecti verba vestre proposita caritati heri et hodie valde deuote oravit atque cantavit in honorem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 32\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (388v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quae est ista que ascendit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Ct 8,5). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In Christo dilecti verba vestre caritati proposita ... et possunt dici verba angelorum celestium ammiracione \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 33\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (391v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... Sequens sermo est praedicandus in die annunciacionis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Et nomen virginis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Lc 1,27). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In Christo dilecti postquam omnipotens deus multis annorum centenariis punisset \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 34\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (393v) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de beatissima virgine Maria \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Signum magnum apparuit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Apc 12,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In Christo dilecti verba vestre proposita caritati \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quem descripsit beatus Iohannes ewangelista in deserta Pathmos \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  396r-v leer.}

