\pard\fi0\li0\qc\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 II (Bl. 38-125b)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 38r-112r \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermones in universitate Heidelbergensi
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (38r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De ascensione domini. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo in studio Heydelbergensi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Exaltare domine in virtute \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Ps 20,14)\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Racionabiliter zelant exalte dominaciones hodierni ascensoris exaltatorisve \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (48v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De ascensione. \endash  Ascendens in altum captiuam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Eph 4,8). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Christus dominus noster saluator ad hoc ascendit in celum ad hac \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sedet ad dexteram patris \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (55r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Collacio de corpore Christi. \endash  Natalis sui cenam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Mc 6,21). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Inmanissime \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 flagrantissimeque dilectionis exhibitorio recreari \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 10\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (94r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sancti per fidem vicerunt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Hbr 11,33). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Reuerendissimi patres ... tota sanctarum scripturarum series nos ad salutem invitans \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 11\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (102r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Collacio breuis de concepcione beatae virginis. \endash  Nota. Dum erant abissi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Prv 8,24). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sanctissima dei genitrix virgo Maria suos deuotos famulos famulasque numquam dimittit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 12\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (104r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In festo Marie Magdalene. Iuxta venerabilium patrum virorum sacre theologie professorum ... Remittuntur tibi peccata \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Lc 5,6) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... Quemadmodum Iohannis xii scribitur quod cenante Ihesu in Bethania \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 103v-103bv leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Sermo 11 nachgetragen. }

