\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ewangelium de beata Maria Magdalena secundum postillam ipsius ipsius \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Gorram super Lucam. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  (114r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Rogabat autem illum quid phariseus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Lc 7,36). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Occasio eorum quae describit Lucas in praecedentibus capitulis quaedam peccatrix ad Christum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ad pacem dei te ducunt quod nobis concedat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen.
