\pard\fi0\li0\qc\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 V (Bl. 159-180)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 159r-178v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Expositio in caput 33 regulae Benedicti}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u220 \'dcberschrift Schwerzenbeck: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tractatulus in quo sunt hic infra scripta aliqua notabilia super capitulo 33\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  regule sancti Benedicti \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Praecipue hoc vicium peculiare etc. Precipue idest ante omnia vel maxime hoc vicium peculiare idest proprium \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vt regni eius merentur esse consortes quod ipse praestare dignetur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen. Swing dich morgennsterndlein. \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (178v) Fragment eines Briefes: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Reuerende pater \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 dum de rebus ordine dicturi sunt ab aliquo scripture sacre \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  179r-180r leer. \endash  180v leer bis auf Besitzeintrag: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Iste liber pertinet ad monasterium Tegernsee.}

