\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 118v-266r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Albertus de Horto Christi}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Sermones capitulares de sanctis}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (118v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipiunt sermones aliqui capitulares \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [Nachtrag Schwerzenbeck: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 fratris Alberti Carthusiensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 de sanctis. Sermo de purificacione beate Marie virginis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Omnes quidem currunt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (I Cor 9,24) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... Beatus Gregorius in Moralia 9 libro pertractans istum passum Iob 9 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (122r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo in purificacione beate Marie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Surge illuminare \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Is 60,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominice incarnacionis nec non hodierne solempnitatis excellenciam et gloriam Leo papa \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (124v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Alius sermo de purificacione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Postquam impleti sunt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Lc 2,22). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hodie, dilectissimi, festiuitatem agimus solempnem et gaudiosam in qua, ut testatur Beda \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 44\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (254r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Exhortacio siue collacio in sepultura fratrum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Beati mortui \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Apc 14,13). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hec verba dixit beatus Iohannes in Apocalypsi quando in spiritu eleuatus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 45\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (255v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In commemoracione \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [nachgetragen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 omnium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 animarum defunctarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Gaudere cum gaudentibus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Rm 12,15). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Pro recommendacione cunctarum animarum fidelium quarum hodie \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 festivam agimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  (266r) Oratio: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Auete omnium fidelium anime, in pace Christi requiescite \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Lit.: siehe 4r.}

