\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (44r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominica 5\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ta\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  post penthecostes. \endash  Sermo de verbis euangelii ... Nisi abundauerit iusticia \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Mt 5,20). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nota quod iusticia legis antique non potuit saluare obseruatores \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (49r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de epistola dominice 5\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 te\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  in aduentu domini. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de verbis epistole Nihil mihi conscius \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (I Cor 4,4). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Notandum quod alia sunt iudicia dei alia iudicia hominum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (55r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de purificacione beate Marie virginis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Lumen ad reuelacionem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Lc 2,32). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Solemnitatem festi presentis an dicam esse dei genitricis an filii dei omnipotentis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 11\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (96r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo 20\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ma\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  post festum penthecostes anno 1492\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de verbis euangelii Vade filius tuus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Io 4,50). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Notandum quod Christus istum moriturum viuificauit quia dominus specialiter viuificat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash 