\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (329r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de epiphania domini. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Videntes adorauerunt eum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Mt 28,17). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dilectissimi magnam festiuitatem epiphanie que apparicio domini interpretatur celebramus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (330v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de verbis epistole in dominica 50\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ime\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Si linguis hominum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (I Cor 13,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quia beatus Paulus in hodierna epistola valde caritatem commendat ideo in praesenti sermone \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (344r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominica 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  40\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo domini Antonini archipeiscopi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [Antoninus Florentinus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 de verbis euangelii Assumpsit Ihesus Petrum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Mt 17,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sciendum quod sicut videmus quod famescentes libenter sustinent labores \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (366r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominica 19\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de verbis euangelii Venite ad nupcias \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Mt 22,4). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 O quam benignissima est dei misericordia qui cum bonorum meorum non egeat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (371r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo Socci de corpore Christi. Desiderio desideraui \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Lc 22,15). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sicut Christus in magno desiderio corporis et sanguinis sui sacramentum nobis tradidit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...   }

