\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (49v) (nachgetragen) Index Sermonum: ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sermones istos collegit dominus Cristannus in habitu seculari pro tunc sacerdos post monachus et prior in Tegernsee deinde abbas in Altaich superiori. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  (58r) Schaltzettel mit redaktioneller Notiz, 58v leer. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (59r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominica prima in adventu domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Preparate in occursum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Am 4,12). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quando aliquis rex ad ciuitatem aliquam est venturus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 (52r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Dominica secunda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Erunt signa \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ... (Lc 21,25). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 In praecedenti dominica actum est de aduentu Christi in carne \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 (53v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Dominica tercia de adventu Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Cum audisset Iohannes \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ... (Mt 11,2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 In hoc ewangelio agitur de tribus scilicet de incarnacione Iohannis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 53\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 (178v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Dominica vigesimatercia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Abeuntes pharisei \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ... (Mt 22,5). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Scribe et pharisei sepe conati sunt ut caperent Ihesum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 54\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 (182r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Dominica vltima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Domine filia mea \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ... (Mt 9,18). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Iste princeps tria fecit in verbis istis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Anno domini M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 cccc\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 liiii in vigilia penthecostes \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1454 Juni 8]\u8249 \'8b Darunter von anderer Hand: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In vigilia sancti Nicolay anno cccc liiii \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1454 Dezember 5]\u8249 \'8b
