\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (12r-212v) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit tractatulus capituli Ffirmiter credimus magistri Conradi Soltaw Pragensis doctoris \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Firmiter credimus et simpliciter confitemur fidem orthodoxam fidelium solidum et primum omnium virtutum immobile fundamentum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 placentes deo ad eternam merentur beatitudinem pervenire. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit per me fratrem Oswaldum Nott monachum et professum in Tegernsee\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (212v-218v) Registrum: ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit per me fratrem Oswaldum Nott de Tittmaning monachum et professum in Tegernsee anno domini M cccc lxvi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [1466].
