\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 38br-109v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Hieronymus de Mondsee}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Sermones}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (38br) \u220 \'dcberschrift Schwerzenbeck: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo magistri Ieronimi ipso factus tempore sue professionis multum solemnis. \endash  Locuturus in laudem omnipotentis dei atque ad nostram edificacionem qualecumque exhortatorium habebo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (50r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Volo quinque verba \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (I Cor 14,19). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Notandum quod inter docentes qui pascunt populum verbo dei \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (58v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo 3\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 us\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominus dabit ignem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Idt 16,21). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In praecedentibus duobus sermonibus dictum est de duobus primis nouissimis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 16\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (103v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Secundus sermo de chorea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De chorea eciam illicita loquens Crisostimus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sic eam diffinit: corea est circulus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 17\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (105r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de dominica decima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Deus propicius esto \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Lc 18,13) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominica proxima \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  suo exemplo docuit nos Christus esse compassiuos ad proximos \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... (108r) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1461 quo tempore fui in M\u228 \'e4nnsee\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 18\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (108v) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De concordia et discordia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Supportate inuicem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Eph 4,2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In hiis verbis admonet nos appostolus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  vt mutuo pacifice conuersemur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...  \endash  (93r) Datierung: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1461 in M\u228 \'e4nnsee \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [Mondsee]. \endash  49v, 85v leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Gl\u252 \'fcckert, Hieronymus von Mondsee, S. 195 Nr. 18, Hs. genannt. \endash  1 = Ebd., Nr. 19.}

