\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Aliud. Vniuersis ad quos praesens pervenerit magister Ieronimus philosophus Erdfordie ... Noueritis quod anno 1472 de mense Septembri sole existente in libra \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 in bonum mutare placuerit etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  Darunter von ders. Hand F\u252 \'fcrbitte f\u252 \'fcr den 1471 verstorbenen Thomas, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 iam quondam scolaris ac discipulus paternitatis vestre in Krembs et scriptor illius iudici[i] \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...
