\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 7v-70v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Hugo de Novo Castro}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : De victoria Christi contra antichristum
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (7v) Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit tractatus de victoria Cristi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 contra antichristum Hugonis de Nouo Castro \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Prologus huius libri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Non sum propheta \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... (Am 7,14). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Humilis ille propheta Amos considerans \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (8r-v) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Capitula primi libri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (8v-70r) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Capitulum primum de interpretacione huius nominis antichristi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quia vero omnis noticia incipit a cognicione significati nominis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 determinandum si sint credenda. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit tractatus vtilis de victoria Christi contra antichristum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1473\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  Darunter nachgetragene Notiz mit inhaltlichem Bezug zum Text.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Druck: GW 13566. \endash  Lit.: Richard Sharpe, A Handlist of the Latin Writers of Great Britain and Ireland before 1540. Turnhout 1997 (Publications of The Journal of Medieval Latin 1), S. 190 Nr. 524. }

