\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (273v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Responsio fratris Iohannis Keck super consultatione patris prioris in B\u252 \'fcren \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [Benediktbeuern] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 de abbatis auctoritate. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Non potest abbas ea quae sunt ordinis episcopalis vt sunt ordinum exorcistatus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (274r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Responsio eiusdem super consultacione eiusdem prioris de nouiciis si teneantur ad horas canonicas dicendas. \endash  Nouicios ego inteligo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 probationis annum agentes \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (274v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Responsio praedicti fratris Iohannis ad consultationem eiusdem qui supra super festo translationis sancti Benedicti celebrando. \endash  Huius consultacionis difficultas dependet ex quadam apostolica asserta bulla \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  275v leer.
